hadiths[600]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","(1) Wuzu farz hone ka bab. Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Aye iman walon jab tum namaz ke liye khade ho, ayat. Daleel is par ke yeh baaz khade hone walon par hai baaz par nahin: Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Said - ne hum se bayan kiya, (ha), aur Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abdur Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya dono ne, Sufyan se, Alqamah ibn Marthad se, Sulaiman ibn Buraidah se, un ke walid se Raziallahu anhu, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) har namaz ke waqt wuzu farmate the, phir jab Fath wala din tha to aap ne wuzu farmaya aur apne khuffon par masah kiya phir tamam namazein ek hi wuzu se padhin, to Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak aap ne kuch aisa kiya jo aap nahin kiya karte the, aap ne farmaya: Maine jaan boojh kar aisa kiya hai aye Umar. Yeh alfaz Ishaq ke hain aur Ibn Hashim ne wa masaha ala khuffaihi zikr nahin kiya."
"2","(2) Hawa kharij hone se wuzu ka bab. Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Ibrahim ibn Marzuq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Suhail ibn Abi Salih se, un ke walid se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Awaz ya hawa ke baghair wuzu nahin."
"3","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Uyaynah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, aur Abbad ibn Tamim se, un ke chacha se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi namaz me kuch paye to wapas na jaye hatta ke hawa paye ya awaz sune."
"4","(3) Pakhana, peshab aur neend se wuzu ka bab. Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Asim se, Zirr se unhon ne kaha: Main Safwan ibn Assal al-Muradi Raziallahu anhu ke paas aaya to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamein hukm dete the jab hum safar me ya musafir hote ke apne khuff teen din aur un ki raatein na utarein magar janabat ki wajah se, aur pakhane ki wajah se na utarein, na peshab ki wajah se, na neend ki wajah se."
"5","(4) Mazi se wuzu ka bab. Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Usman ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne hamein khabar di, Salim Abu al-Nadr se, Sulaiman ibn Yasar se, Miqdad ibn al-Aswad se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se us mard ke bare me pucha jo apni ahliya se qareeb hota hai phir mazi kharij karta hai, to aap ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi is me se kuch paye to apni sharmgah par pani chhidke, yani use dhoye aur wuzu kare."
"6","Muhammad ibn Hisham al-Marwazi ne Baghdad me hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu Bakr - yani Ibn Ayyash - ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Husayn se, Abu Abdur Rahman al-Sulami se, Ali Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Main mazi bahut kharij karne wala mard tha, phir mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se puchne me sharm aayi kyunki aap ki beti mere nikah me thin, to maine ek mard ko hukm diya to us ne aap se pucha, to aap ne farmaya: Is se wuzu hai."
"7","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Muawiyah ibn Salih ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Ala ibn al-Haris se, Hizam ibn Hakim se, un ke chacha Abdullah ibn Sad se unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se pucha, aap ne farmaya: Aur pani ke baad pani woh mazi hai, aur har nar mazi kharij karta hai, to is se apni sharmgah aur apne khasiein dho aur namaz ke liye apna wuzu karo."
"8","(5) Qai se wuzu ke bare me jo aya hai us ka bab. Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdus Samad ibn Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Husain al-Muallim se, Yahya ibn Abi Kasir se, Awzai se, Yaish se, un ke walid se, Madan ibn Talhah se, Abu al-Darda Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne qai ki to roza tor diya, unhon ne kaha: Phir main Sauban se Damishq ki masjid me mila aur maine is ka un se zikr kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha, maine un ke liye wuzu ka pani dala tha."
"9","(6) Neend se wuzu ke bare me bab. Ibn al-Muqri aur Abdullah ibn Hashim aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi apni neend se uthe to apna hath apne wuzu ke pani me na duboye hatta ke use teen martaba dho le, kyunki woh nahin janta ke us ka hath kahan raat bhar raha. Ibn al-Muqri ne ek martaba kaha: jahan us ka hath raat bhar raha. Aur yeh alfaz Ibn al-Muqri ke hain."
"10","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, unhon ne Kuraib se suna, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Main apni khala Maimunah ke paas raat bhar raha, to maine dekha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) raat ko ek mashkize ki taraf uthe, to is se pani liya, phir halka wuzu kiya use kam karte hue aur halka rakhte hue, unhon ne kaha: To maine bhi waisa hi kiya jaisa unhon ne kiya, phir main un ke bayein taraf khada hua to unhon ne mujhe apne dayein taraf kar diya, phir jitni Allah ne chaha namaz padhi, phir soye hatta ke kharrate lene lage, phir un ke paas munadi aaya to namaz ke liye uthe aur wuzu nahin kiya."
"11","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se hadees bayan ki unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Salamah ibn Kuhail se, Kuraib se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Main apni khala Maimunah bint al-Haris ke paas raat bhar raha, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) raat ko namaz padhne ke liye uthe, phir let gaye phir soye hatta ke kharrate lene lage, unhon ne kaha: Phir Bilal un ke paas aaye to unhein namaz ki ittela di, to woh uthe phir namaz padhi aur wuzu nahin kiya."
"12","Yaqub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne kaha: Maine apne walid se suna woh Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se hadees bayan karte the, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri aankh soti hai aur mera dil nahin sota."
"13","(7) Behosh hone wale ke liye taharat ka bab. Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muawiyah ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Abi Aishah ne Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Main Aishah Raziallahu anha ke paas dakhil hua to maine un se kaha: Kya aap mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki bimari ke bare mein hadees bayan nahin karengi? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) par bimari bhari ho gayi to Aap ne farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz parh li? To hum ne kaha: Nahin, wo Aap ka intezar kar rahe hain ya Rasulullah, to Aap ne farmaya: Mere liye mikhzab mein pani rakho, to hum ne aisa hi kiya, unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne ghusl kiya phir uthne ka irada kiya to Aap par behoshi tari ho gayi, phir Aap ko hosh aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz parh li? To hum ne kaha: Nahin, wo Aap ka intezar kar rahe hain ya Rasulullah, to Aap ne farmaya: Mere liye mikhzab mein pani rakho, to hum ne aisa hi kiya, unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne ghusl kiya phir uthne ka irada kiya to Aap par behoshi tari ho gayi, phir Aap ko hosh aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz parh li? To hum ne kaha: Nahin, wo Aap ka intezar kar rahe hain ya Rasulullah, to Aap ne farmaya: Mere liye mikhzab mein pani rakho, to hum ne aisa hi kiya, to Aap ne ghusl kiya phir uthne ka irada kiya to Aap par behoshi tari ho gayi, phir Aap ko hosh aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz parh li? To hum ne kaha: Nahin, wo Aap ka intezar kar rahe hain ya Rasulullah, unhon ne kaha: Aur log masjid mein thehre hue Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka isha aakhirah ki namaz ke liye intezar kar rahe the, unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne Abu Bakr ki taraf (paigham) bheja ke wo logon ko namaz parhayen."
"14","(8) Mushrik ke Islam lane par taharat ka bab. Ibrahim ibn Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Sufyan se, unhon ne al-Agharr se, unhon ne Khalifah ibn Husayn ibn Qays ibn Asim se, unhon ne apne dada Qays ibn Asim se (riwayat kiya): ke unhon ne Islam qabool kiya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen pani aur sidr se ghusl karne ka hukm diya."
"15","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah aur Abdullah ibne Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id al-Maqburi se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat kiya): ke Thumamah al-Hanafi qaid kiye gaye, phir unhon ne Islam qabool kiya to unhon ne unhen ghusl karne ka hukm diya, to unhon ne ghusl kiya aur do rakaten namaz parhi, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare bhai ka Islam yaqinan achha ho gaya hai."
"16","(9) Zakar ko chhune se wuzu ka bab. Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr se, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid aur Urwah ne un cheezon ka muzakara kiya jin se wuzu kiya jata hai, to Urwah ne zikr kiya aur zikr kiya, hatta ke zakar ko chhune se wuzu ka zikr kiya, mere walid ne kaha: Maine ise nahin suna, to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Marwan ne Busrah se khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne zakar ko chhue to use wuzu karna chahiye, hum ne kaha: Un ki taraf (aadmi) bhejen, to unhon ne ek muhafiz ya ek aadmi bheja, to qasid usi (baat) ke sath wapas aaya."
"17","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Usamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwah se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Marwan se, unhon ne Busrah bint Safwan se ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jab tum mein se koi apne zakar ko chhue to use wuzu karna chahiye."
"18","Abu al-Azhar Ahmad ibn al-Azhar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Fudayk ne hum se bayan kiya, Rabi'ah ibn Uthman se, unhon ne Hisham ibn Urwah se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Marwan se, unhon ne Busrah se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne zakar ko chhue to use wuzu karna chahiye. Urwah ne kaha: Maine Busrah se pucha to unhon ne us ki tasdiq ki."
"19","Ahmad ibn al-Faraj al-Himsi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Zubaydi ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Shu'ayb ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mard bhi apni sharmgah ko chhue to use wuzu karna chahiye aur jo aurat bhi apni sharmgah ko chhue to use wuzu karna chahiye."
"20","(10) Is se wuzu saqit hone ke bare mein jo riwayat aayi hai us ka bab. Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Jabir ne hum se bayan kiya, Qays ibn Talq se, unhon ne apne walid se ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se zakar ko chhune ke bare mein pucha to Aap ne is mein koi wuzu (lazim) qarar nahin diya."
"21","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mulazim ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Badr ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, Qays ibn Talq se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas baithe hue the to ek aadmi aaya goya ke dehati tha, to us ne kaha: Ya Nabiyullah, aadmi ke namaz mein apne zakar ko chhune ke bare mein Aap kya farmate hain? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Wo tumhare (jism ke) gosht ke ek tukre ke siwa aur kya hai - ya unhon ne kaha: Tumhara ek hissa hai."
"22","(11) Aag se lagi hui cheez se wuzu tark karne ke bare mein jo aaya hai us ka bab. Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se - yani Ibn Urwah se - unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Kaysan ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Ata se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se (ha)."
"23","Unhon ne kaha: Aur mujhe Muhammad ibn Ali ibn Abdullah ibn Abbas ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se (ha)."
"24","Unhon ne kaha: Aur mujhe al-Zuhri ne hadees bayan ki, Ali ibn Abdullah ibn Abbas se, unhon ne apne walid Raziallahu anhu se (ha)."
"25","Unhone kaha: aur mujh se Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha: mujh se Fulan ibn Amr ibn Umayyah ne apne walid se bayan kiya: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne gosht ya haddi wala gosht khaya phir namaz parhi aur pani ko haath tak na lagaya."
"26","Muhammad ibn Awf al-Ta'i, Abdullah ibn Ahmad ibn Shabbuwayh aur Abd al-Samad ibn Abd al-Wahhab al-Himsi ne hum se bayan kiya, un sab ne kaha: Ali ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Shu'ayb ibn Abi Hamzah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: mujh se Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhu se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se do muamlon me se aakhri muamla aag se lagi hui cheez se wuzu tark kar dena tha. Ibn Awf ne Shu'ayb se, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se (riwayat karke) kaha."
"27","(12) Oont ke gosht se wuzu ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abu Huzayfah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sufyan ne Simak ibn Harb se, unhone Ja'far ibn Abi Thawr se, unhone Jabir ibn Samurah Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat kiya) ke ek shakhs ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya, to usne kaha: kya main bakri ke gosht se wuzu karun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, usne kaha: to kya main bakrion ke baade me namaz parhun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, usne kaha: to kya main oont ke gosht se wuzu karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, usne kaha: to kya main oonton ke baithne ki jagah me namaz parhun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin."
"28","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Muhadir al-Hamdani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: A'mash ne Abdullah ibn Abdullah se, unhone Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, unhone Bara ibn Azib Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat kiya), unhone kaha: ek shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya, to usne kaha: kya main oonton ke baithne ki jagah me namaz parhun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, usne kaha: to kya main unke gosht se wuzu karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, usne kaha: kya main bakrion ke baade me namaz parhun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, usne kaha: to kya main unke gosht se wuzu karun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: aur ise Uthman ibn Abdullah ibn Mawhab aur Ash'ath ibn Abi al-Sha'tha ne Ja'far ibn Abi Thawr se riwayat kiya."
"29","(13) Qaza-e-hajat ke liye door jane ke bare me jo warid hua hai: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Muhammad - yani Ibn Amr - ne Abu Salamah se, unhone Mughirah ibn Shu'bah se (riwayat kiya), unhone kaha: main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath Aap ke kisi safar me tha, aur jab Aap hajat ke liye jate to raste se door chale jate."
"30","(14) Khala me dakhil hote waqt ki dua ka bab: Abu Ja'far Ahmad ibn Sa'id al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Nadr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abd al-Aziz - yani Ibn Suhayb - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: maine Anas Raziallahu anhu se suna, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab khala me dakhil hote to kehte: Ae Allah! Beshak main teri panah mangta hun khabees mardon aur khabees auraton (shayateen) se."
"31","(15) Pakhana aur peshab aur istinja ke liye qiblah ki taraf munh karne ki karahat ka bab: Yusuf ibn Musa al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abu Muawiyah, Waki aur Muhammad ibn Fudayl ne hum se bayan kiya - Yusuf ne kaha: aur alfaz al-Darir ke hain - un sab ne kaha: A'mash ne Ibrahim se, unhone Abd al-Rahman ibn Yazid se (riwayat kiya), unhone kaha: Salman se kaha gaya: tumhare Nabi ne tumhe har cheez sikhayi hai hatta ke pakhana karna bhi, unhone kaha: Haan, beshak unhone hume mana kiya hai ke hum qiblah ki taraf munh karke pakhana ya peshab karein ya apne dayen haathon se istinja karein, ya hum me se koi teen pattharon se kam par tanhai ikhtiyar kare, aur ke hum me se koi gobar ya haddi se istinja na kare."
"32","Abu Sa'id Abdullah ibn Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: mujh se Uqbah - yani Ibn Khalid - ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Ubaydullah, yani Ibn Umar, ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: mujh se Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban ne Wasi ibn Habban se, unhone Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat kiya), unhone kaha: main Hafsah ke ghar ke upar chadha to maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap Bayt al-Maqdis ki taraf munh aur Ka'bah ki taraf peeth karke qaza-e-hajat kar rahe the."
"33","Abu al-Azhar Ahmad ibn al-Azhar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Ya'qub, yani Ibn Ibrahim ibn Sa'd, ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: mujh se mere walid ne Ibn Ishaq se (riwayat kiya), unhone kaha: mujh se Aban ibn Salih ne Mujahid ibn Jabr se, unhone Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se (riwayat kiya), unhone kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hume mana kiya tha ke hum pani bahate waqt apni sharmgahon se qiblah ki taraf peeth karein ya uski taraf munh karein. Phir unhone kaha: maine Aap ko wafat se ek saal pehle qiblah ki taraf munh karke peshab karte dekha."
"34","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Safwan ibn Isa ne Hasan ibn Dhakwan se, unhone Marwan al-Asfar se (riwayat kiya), unhone kaha: maine Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ko dekha ke unhone apni sawari qiblah ki taraf munh karke bithayi, phir uski taraf (munh karke) baith kar peshab karne lage, to maine kaha: Ae Abu Abd al-Rahman! Kya is se mana nahin kiya gaya, unhone kaha: Kyun nahin, is se sirf khule maidan me mana kiya gaya hai, pas jab tumhare aur qiblah ke darmiyan koi cheez ho jo tumhe chhupaye to koi harj nahin."
"35","(16) Pakhana aur peshab ke liye jin jaghon se bachna chahiye unka bab: Rabi ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya ke Ibn Wahb ne unhe khabar di, unhone kaha: mujhe Sulayman, yani Ibn Bilal, ne Ala se khabar di, unhone apne walid se, unhone Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat kiya) ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Do la'nat wali cheezon se bacho! Sahaba ne kaha: Ae Rasulullah! Wo do la'nat wali cheezein kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Wo jo logon ke raste par ya kisi qaum ki majlis me pakhana karta hai."
"36","Abu Ja'far al-Mukharrimi Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Mu'adh ibn Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya. Ha. Aur Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Mu'adh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: mujh se mere walid ne Qatadah se, unhone Abdullah ibn Sarjis Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat kiya) ke Nabiullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum me se koi surakh me peshab na kare. Yeh Ishaq ki hadees ke alfaz hain, aur unhone izafa kiya: unhone Qatadah se kaha: surakh me peshab karne me kya karahat hai, unhone kaha: kaha jata hai: beshak ye jinnon ke maskan hain."
"37","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ash'ath se, al-Hasan se, Abdullah ibn Mughaffal se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum me se koi apne mustaham (nahane ki jagah) me peshab na kare, kyunke aam waswasa usi se hota hai."
"38","(17) Khare ho kar aur logon ke qareeb peshab karne ki rukhsat ka bab: Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Shaqiq Abu Wa'il se, Huzaifah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath chal raha tha, pas Aap logon ke subatah (kura karkat dalne ki jagah) tak pahunche, pas Aap ne khare ho kar peshab kiya, to main hat gaya, pas Aap ne mujhe bulaya aur farmaya: Tum kyun hat gaye? Pas main Aap ke aqb (edhi ke paas) khara ho gaya, phir jab Aap farigh hue to pani mangwaya, pas wuzu kiya aur apne khufo par masah kiya."
"39","(18) Peshab karne wale ko salam karne ki karahat ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Raja ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id yani Ibn Salamah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr jo Ibn Umar ibn Abdur Rahman ibn Abdullah ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab hain unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: ke ek shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas se guzra jabke Aap pani baha rahe the, to us shakhs ne Aap par salam kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use salam ka jawab diya, phir farmaya: Jab tum mujhe is tarah dekho to mujh par salam na kiya karo, kyunke agar tum aisa karoge to main tumhe salam ka jawab nahin dunga."
"40","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qabisah aur Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Dahhak ibn Uthman se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas se guzra jabke Aap peshab kar rahe the, pas us ne Aap par salam kiya, to Aap ne use jawab nahin diya."
"41","(19) Istinja me witr (taq adad) mustahab hone ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Abu Ja'far al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi wuzu kare to apni naak me pani dale, phir naak jhare, aur jo patharon se istijmar kare to witr (taq adad) kare."
"42","(20) Pani se istinja karne ka bab: Abbas ibn al-Walid al-Bayruti ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Shu'ayb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Utbah ibn Abi Hakim al-Hamdani ne mujhe khabar di, Talhah ibn Nafi' se ke unhon ne un se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ayyub aur Jabir ibn Abdullah aur Anas ibn Malik al-Ansariyon ne mujh se bayan kiya ke jab ye ayat nazil hui: Fihe rijalun yuhibbuna an yatatahharu wallahu yuhibbul muttahhirin (Us me aise mard hain jo pak hona pasand karte hain aur Allah pak hone walon ko pasand karta hai), to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aye Ansar ki jama'at, beshak Allah ne taharat ke bare me tumhari khair ke sath sana ki hai, to ye tumhari taharat kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hum namaz ke liye wuzu karte hain aur janabat se ghusl karte hain, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: To kya is ke sath is ke ilawa bhi kuch hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, siwa is ke ke hum me se jab koi pakhana se nikalta hai to pani se istinja karna pasand karta hai, Aap ne farmaya: To wo yehi hai, pas tum is ko lazam pakro."
"43","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Abi Maymunah se, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) apni hajat ke liye tashrif le jate, to main aur hum me se ek larka idawah (pani ka bartan) ke sath Aap ke piche jate, phir jab Aap apni hajat puri kar lete to main Aap ko idawah pakra deta, pas Aap istinja karte."
"44","(21) Khala se nikalne ke waqt ke qaul ka bab: Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Isra'il ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Yusuf ibn Abi Burdah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah Raziallahu anha ne mujh se bayan kiya: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab pakhana se nikalte to farmate: Ghufranaka (main Teri bakhshish chahta hun)."
"45","(22) Pani ki taharat aur us miqdar ka bab jo najis hoti hai aur najis nahin hoti: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, Safwan ibn Sulaym se, Sa'id ibn Salamah se, ke al-Mughirah ibn Abi Burdah ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Ek shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya, pas kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hum samundar me sawar hote hain aur apne sath thora pani le jate hain, pas agar hum us se wuzu kar lein to pyase reh jayen, to kya hum samundar ke pani se wuzu kar sakte hain? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ka pani pak karne wala hai, us ka murdar halal hai."
"46","Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Warraq aur Hajjaj ibn Hamzah al-Wazi aur Abu Yahya Muhammad ibn Sa'id al-Attar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usamah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Kathir se, Muhammad ibn Abbad ibn Ja'far se, Abdullah ibn Abdullah ibn Umar se, un ke walid Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se pani ke bare me aur darindon aur janwaron me se jo us par ate hain ke bare me pucha gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Jab pani do qullah ho to wo najasat ko nahin uthata."
"47","Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Shakir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usamah ne hum se bayan kiya, (ha). Aur Muhammad ibn Sulayman al-Qirati ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usamah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Kathir se, Muhammad ibn Ja'far se, Abdullah ibn Abdullah ibn Umar se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se isi tarah pucha gaya. Aur Isa ibn Yunus ne kaha, al-Walid se, Muhammad ibn Ja'far ibn al-Zubayr se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Umar se, un ke walid se. Aur Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne kaha, Muhammad ibn Ja'far ibn al-Zubayr se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Umar se, un ke walid se bhi isi tarah."
"48","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Affan ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim ibn al-Mundhir ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hum apne ya Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Umar ke ek bagh me the, pas namaz ka waqt aaya, to Ubaydullah bagh ke maqra (pani jama hone ki jagah) ki taraf khare hue, aur us me oont ki khal thi, pas wo us se wuzu karne lage, to hum ne kaha: Kya tum is se wuzu karte ho jabke is me oont ki khal hai? Pas wo us se wuzu karne lage, to hum ne kaha: Kya hum is se wuzu karein jabke is me ye khal hai? To unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab pani do qullah ho to wo najis nahin hota."
"49","Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Warraq aur Musa ibn Abdur Rahman al-Masruqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usamah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Kathir se, Muhammad ibn Ka'b se, Ubaidullah ibn Abdullah se - al-Masruqi ne kaha: ibn Rafi ibn Khadij - Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, kya hum Buda'ah ke kunwen se wuzu karen? aur woh aisa kunwan hai jis mein gandagi aur haiz ke kapde aur kutton ka gosht phenka jata hai, to unhon ne farmaya: Pani pak hai, use koi cheez napak nahin karti."
"50","Muhammad ibn Yahya, Ahmad ibn Yusuf aur Ibn Awn ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamen khabar di, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) apni kisi zauja ke pas tashreef laye jabke un ke ghusl ya un ke wuzu se kuch pani bach gaya tha, to aap ne us se wuzu karne ka irada kiya to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main ne is se janabat ka ghusl kiya hai, to aap ne farmaya: Beshak pani napak nahin hota."
"51","Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Thauri ne hamen isi isnad ke sath isi tarah khabar di."
"52","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Abu Ja'far al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein kutta piye to use chahiye ke use saat martaba dhoye."
"53","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn al-Khalil ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn Mushir ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Razin aur Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein kutta zabaan dale to use chahiye ke use baha de aur use saat martaba dhoye."
"54","Ali ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein kutta zabaan dale to use chahiye ke use saat martaba dhoye."
"55","Aur Ayyub ne kaha: Ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se: un mein se pehli ya un mein se ek mitti ke sath ho."
"56","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Tayyah se, Mutarrif se, Abdullah ibn Mughaffal se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab kutta bartan mein zabaan dale to use saat martaba dho lo aur aathwin martaba use mitti se malo."
"57","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne hamen khabar di, Ayyub se, Ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se. Aur Hammam ibn Munabbih se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi thehre hue pani mein hargiz peshab na kare jo behta na ho, phir us se wuzu kare."
"58","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Allan ibn al-Mughirah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad - woh Ibn Ja'far hain - aur Sulaiman ibn Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Utbah - woh Ibn Muslim hain - ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaid ibn Hunain se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke mashroob mein makkhi gir jaye to use chahiye ke use mukammal dubo de, phir use phenk de, pas beshak us ke ek par mein bimari hai aur dusre mein shifa hai."
"59","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hamen khabar di, Ibn Wahb se, Amr ibn al-Harith se, Bukair ibn Abdullah se ke Abu al-Sa'ib ne un se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi thehre hue pani mein ghusl na kare jabke woh junubi ho, to unhon ne kaha: Aye Abu Hurairah, woh kaise kare? Unhon ne kaha: Woh use chullu bhar bhar kar le."
"60","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) pyale se ghusl farmate the, aur main aur woh ek hi bartan se ghusl karte the. Mahmud ne izafa kiya: aur woh faraq hai."
"61","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Mard aur auratein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein ek hi bartan se sab mil kar wuzu kiya karte thay."
"62","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne humein khabar di, Anas Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne masjid ke qible mein thook dekha to use apne haath se khurach diya, to Aap par is baat ki nagawari Aap ke chehre mein dekhi gayi, to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak banda jab namaz ke liye khada hota hai to woh apne Rabb se sargoshi karta hai - ya us ka Rabb us ke aur qible ke darmiyan hota hai - to jab tum mein se koi thuke to apne bayein taraf ya apne qadam ke neeche thuke, ya yun kare, aur Aap ne apne kapde mein thuka aur us ke ek hisse ko dusre se ragad diya."
"63","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah ibn Nafi par padha aur Mutarrif ibn Abdullah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Malik se, Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talhah se, Humaydah bint Ubayd ibn Rifa'ah se, Kabshah bint Ka'b ibn Malik se - aur woh Ibn Abi Qatadah ke nikah mein thin - ke Abu Qatadah un ke paas dakhil hue to unhon ne un ke liye wuzu ka pani undela, to ek billi aayi jo us mein se peene lagi, to unhon ne us ke liye bartan jhuka diya yahan tak ke us ne pi liya, Kabshah ne kaha: To unhon ne mujhe apni taraf dekhte hue paya, to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ta'ajjub karti ho aye mere bhai ki beti, unhon ne kaha: To maine kaha: Ji haan, to unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh napak nahin hai, beshak woh tum par aane jaane walon mein se hai, mard ho ya aurat."
"64","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Yazid aur Ahmad ibn Shayban al-Ramli ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Ibn Wa'lah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se marfu'an, aur Ibn al-Muqri ne ek martaba kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya - : Jo bhi khaal dabaghat di jaye to woh pak ho gayi, aur Ibn Shayban ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya."
"65","Abu Yahya Muhammad ibn Sa'id al-Attar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il Ibn Ulayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Rayhanah ne hum se bayan kiya, Safinah se jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sahabi hain, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) sa' se ghusl farmate thay aur mudd se wuzu farmate thay."
"66","(23) Miswak ke bare mein jo warid hua hai: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar ye baat na hoti ke main apni ummat par mashaqqat dalunga to main unhein har wuzu ke sath miswak ka hukm deta."
"67","(24) A'mal mein niyyat ka bab: Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Sa'id se, Muhammad ibn Ibrahim al-Taymi se, Alqamah ibn Waqqas se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Umar Raziallahu anhu ko minbar par suna aur woh ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se khabar de kar bayan kar rahe thay: Beshak a'mal niyyat hi se hain, aur beshak har shakhs ke liye wahi hai jo us ne niyyat ki, to jis ki hijrat Allah aur Us ke Rasul ki taraf ho to us ki hijrat usi ki taraf hai jis ki taraf us ne hijrat ki, aur jis ki hijrat duniya ki taraf ho jise woh pata hai ya aurat ki taraf ho jis se woh nikah karta hai, to us ki hijrat usi ki taraf hai jis ki taraf us ne hijrat ki."
"68","(25) Tahur ke baghair namaz qubul nahin hoti: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak se, Mus'ab ibn Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Log Ibn Amir ki wafat ke waqt un ki ta'reef karne lage, to Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ne kaha: Khabardar beshak main un ke liye un se dhoka karne wala nahin hun, lekin maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Allah tahur ke baghair namaz qubul nahin farmata, aur na khiyanat ke maal se sadqah."
"69","Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ibn Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, Hammam ibn Munabbih se, unhon ne kaha: Ye woh hai jo Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad jo Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hain un se, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ki namaz jab woh be wuzu ho jaye qubul nahin hoti yahan tak ke woh wuzu kare."
"70","(26) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke wuzu ki sifat aur us ki sifat jis ka Aap ne hukm diya: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi se, Humran ibn Aban se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Uthman Raziallahu anhu ko dekha unhon ne wuzu kiya to apne dono haathon par teen martaba pani bahaya to unhein dhoya, phir teen martaba kulli ki aur naak mein pani chadha kar jhada, phir apna chehra teen martaba dhoya, phir apna dayan haath kohni tak teen martaba dhoya, phir bayan isi tarah [phir apne sar ka masah kiya, phir apna dayan paon takhnon tak teen martaba dhoya, phir bayan isi tarah] phir unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekha unhon ne mere is wuzu ki tarah wuzu kiya, phir unhon ne farmaya: Jo shakhs mere is wuzu ki tarah wuzu kare, phir do rak'atein padhe jin mein woh apne dil mein baat na kare to us ke pichle gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"71","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Za'idah ibn Qudamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid ibn Alqamah al-Hamdani se, Abd Khayr se, unhon ne kaha: Ali Raziallahu anhu Fajr padhne ke baad Rahbah mein dakhil hue to Rahbah mein baith gaye, phir apne ek ghulam se kaha: Mere liye tahur lao, to ghulam un ke paas ek bartan laya jis mein pani tha aur ek tasht, Abd Khayr ne kaha aur hum baithe un ki taraf dekh rahe thay, to unhon ne apne dayein haath se bartan pakda to apne bayein haath par undela, phir apni hatheliyan dhoyin, phir bartan ko apne dayein haath se pakda to apne bayein haath par undela, phir apni hatheliyan dhoyin, phir apne dayein haath se bartan pakda to apne bayein haath par undela, phir apni hatheliyan dhoyin, teen martaba aisa kiya, Abd Khayr ne kaha: Ye sab is tarah ke woh apna haath bartan mein dakhil nahin karte thay yahan tak ke use teen martaba dho lete, phir unhon ne apna dayan haath bartan mein dakhil kiya to apna munh bhara to kulli ki aur naak mein pani chadhaya aur apne bayein haath se jhada teen martaba, phir apna chehra teen martaba dhoya, phir apna dayan haath kohni tak teen martaba dhoya, phir apna bayan haath kohni tak teen martaba dhoya, phir apna dayan haath bartan mein dakhil kiya yahan tak ke pani ne use dhaanp liya, phir use pani samet uthaya jo us ne uthaya tha, phir use apne bayein haath se ponchha, phir apne dono haathon se mil kar ek martaba apne sar ka masah kiya, phir apna dayan haath bartan mein dakhil kiya, phir apne dayein paon par undela to use apne bayein haath se teen martaba dhoya, phir apna dayan haath bartan mein dakhil kiya to use pani se bhara, phir us mein se piya, phir kaha: Ye Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka tahur hai to jo shakhs Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke tahur ko dekhna chahe to ye un ka tahur hai."
"72","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Thawri aur Ma'mar aur Dawud ibn Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek ek martaba wuzu kiya."
"73","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amr ibn Yahya se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Zaid Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne wuzu farmaya to Ap ne apne dono haathon ko do martaba dhoya aur apne dono paon ko do martaba aur apne chehre ko teen martaba."
"74","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Salih ibn Muslim al-Ijli ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Sabit ibn Sauban ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abdullah ibn al-Fazl se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: kabhi main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekhta ke Ap do do martaba wuzu farmate the."
"75","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman, yani Ibn Mahdi ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Israil ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amir ibn Shaqiq se, Shaqiq ibn Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Usman Raziallahu anhu ko dekha ke unhon ne wuzu kiya to unhon ne apni dono hatheliyon ko teen martaba dhoya, aur kulli ki aur naak me pani chadhaya, aur apne chehre ko teen martaba dhoya, aur apne sar ka aur apne dono kaanon ke zahir aur batin ka masah kiya, aur apne dono paon ko teen teen martaba dhoya, aur ungliyon me khilal kiya, aur apni dadhi me khilal kiya, hatta ke unhon ne apna chehra teen teen martaba dhoya, aur unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekha ke Ap ne waisa hi kiya jaisa tum ne mujhe karte hue dekha, Ishaq se kaha gaya: kya is me ye nahin hai: aur unhon ne apni dono ziraon ko dhoya? Unhon ne kaha: jo mere paas tha main ne tumhe de diya."
"76","Aur Muhammad ibn Yahya ne humein ye hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ghassan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Israil ne humein isi sanad ke sath hadees bayan ki, to unhon ne is me kaha: aur unhon ne apni dono ziraon ko teen martaba dhoya."
"77","Bahr ibn Nasr ne Ibn Wahb se, unhon ne Yahya ibn Abdullah ibn Salim aur Malik ibn Anas se, unhon ne Amr ibn Yahya al-Mazini se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Zaid ibn Asim al-Mazini se, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat kiya: ke Ap ne bartan se apne dono haathon par pani dala to unhen dhoya, aur kulli ki aur teen martaba naak me pani dal kar naak jhadi, aur Ap ne apne dono haathon se pani liya to apne sar ke agle hisse se ibtida ki, phir Ap apne dono haathon ko sar ke pichhle hisse tak le gaye, phir unhen agle hisse ki taraf wapas laye."
"78","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Mughirah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hariz ibn Usman ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Maisarah al-Hazrami ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: main ne Miqdam ibn Ma'dikarib Raziallahu anhu ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas wuzu ka pani laya gaya to Ap ne teen teen martaba wuzu farmaya, phir Ap ne apne sar ka aur apne dono kaanon ke zahir aur batin ka masah kiya."
"79","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dauraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Ashja'i ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sufyan se, Musa ibn Abi Aishah se, Amr ibn Shu'aib se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se: ke ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aya to us ne Ap se wuzu ke bare me sawal kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne teen teen martaba wuzu farmaya, aur farmaya: jis ne izafa kiya to us ne bura kiya aur zulm kiya aur zyadati ki aur zulm kiya."
"80","Ibn al-Muqri aur Abdur Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jab tum me se koi wuzu kare to use chahiye ke apni naak me pani dale, phir naak jhade."
"81","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asad ibn Musa ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Qariz ibn Shaibah se, Abu Ghatfan se, unhon ne kaha: main Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ke paas dakhil hua to main ne unhen wuzu karte hue paya to unhon ne kulli ki aur naak me pani chadhaya, phir unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: do martaba khoob tarah se ya teen martaba naak jhado."
"82","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne humein khabar di, Shu'bah se, Muhammad ibn Ziyad se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu hamare paas se guzarte the jabke log wuzu khane se wuzu kar rahe hote the to main ne unhen kehte hue suna: wuzu mukammal karo, kyunke main ne Abu al-Qasim (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: aidiyon ke liye aag se kharabi hai."
"83","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdus Samad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, (ha). Aur Abu Ja'far al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Nazr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, dono ne Shu'bah se isi ke sath, Muhammad ne kaha: aidhi ke liye, aur doosre ne kaha: aidiyon ke liye."
"84","Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sulaim al-Taifi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Kasir ne mujhe hadees bayan ki, Asim ibn Laqit ibn Sabirah se, unhon ne apne walid se, main ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, mujhe wuzu ke bare me batayiye, Ap ne farmaya: wuzu mukammal karo, aur ungliyon me khilal karo, aur naak me pani chadhane me mubalgha karo, magar ye ke tum rozedar ho."
"85","(27) Moozon par masah ka bab 89 - Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim se, Hammam ibn al-Harith se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jarir ko dekha ke unhon ne taharat ke bartan se wuzu kiya aur apne moozon par masah kiya, logon ne kaha: Kya aap apne moozon par masah karte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Beshak maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko aisa karte hue dekha hai, unhon ne kaha: To yeh hadees Abdullah ke ashab ko bahut achhi lagti thi, woh kehte the: Beshak unka Islam to (surah) al-Ma'idah ke nuzul ke baad hua tha."
"86","90 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bukayr ya'ni Ibn Amir al-Bajali ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu Zur'ah se, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne peshab kiya aur moozon par masah kiya, to kuch logon ne un par etiraz kiya, unhon ne kaha: Beshak yeh (amal) (surah) al-Ma'idah (ke nuzul) se pehle ka tha, unhon ne kaha: Main to Islam hi us waqt laya jab (surah) al-Ma'idah nazil ho chuki thi, aur maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko masah karte hue sirf us ke nazil hone ke baad hi dekha hai."
"87","91 - Abd al-Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ya'ni Ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Taymi se, Bakr se, al-Hasan se, Ibn al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah se, unke walid se, Bakr ne kaha: Aur hum ne ise Ibn al-Mughirah se, unke walid se suna hai: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne wuzu kiya aur apni peshani aur amame par aur moozon par masah kiya."
"88","92 - Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Amr al-Ghazzi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Walid ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, Thawr ibn Yazid se, Raja ibn Haywah se, al-Mughirah ke katib se, al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mooze ke upar aur neeche masah kiya."
"89","93 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Hashimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Urwah se, al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko moozon ki peeth (upari hisse) par masah karte hue dekha."
"90","94 - Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, al-Hakam aur Hammad se, Ibrahim se, Abu Abdullah al-Jadali se, Khuzaymah ibn Thabit Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se (riwayat hai) ke Aap ne farmaya: Musafir ke liye teen din aur unki raaten, aur muqeem ke liye ek din aur ek raat (hai), moozon par masah ke bare mein."
"91","95 - Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Ma'in ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Wahhab al-Thaqafi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Muhajir ibn Makhlad se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Bakrah se, unke walid Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne muqeem ke liye ek din aur ek raat, aur musafir ke liye teen din aur unki raaten muqarrar kiye, moozon par masah ke bare mein."
"92","(28) Janabat aur us ke liye taharat ke bare mein 96 - Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwah se, unke walid se, Zaynab bint Umm Salamah se, unki walida Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Umm Sulaym Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aayin aur Aap se us aurat ke bare mein sawal kiya jo khwab mein woh dekhe jo mard dekhta hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Jab woh pani dekhe to ghusl kare, unhon ne kaha: To maine kaha: Tum ne auraton ko ruswa kar diya, aur kya aurat ko bhi ehtelam hota hai? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhara dayan haath khak aalud ho, phir uska bachcha us se mushabeh kaise hota hai?"
"93","97 - al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Khalid al-Khayyat ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah al-Umari se, Ubaydullah se, al-Qasim se, A'ishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se us mard ke bare mein sawal kiya gaya jo tari paye aur use ehtelam yaad na ho? Aap ne farmaya: Woh ghusl kare, aur us mard ke bare mein (sawal kiya gaya) jo dekhe ke use ehtelam hua tha aur tari na paye? Aap ne farmaya: Us par ghusl nahin hai."
"94","98 - Abu Yahya Muhammad ibn Sa'id al-Attar aur Ishaq ibn Ibrahim ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hammad ibn Khalid se isi sanad ke sath isi tarah (riwayat) kiya, aur unhon ne izafa kiya: To Umm Sulaym ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aur kya us aurat par bhi (ghusl) hai jo is me se kuch dekhe? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, beshak auraten mardon ki hamsheera hain."
"95","99 - Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Ansar me se kuch mard, un me Abu Sa'id al-Khudri aur Abu Ayyub (bhi the), kehte the: Pani pani se hai, aur woh gumaan karte the ke jo apni biwi ko chhue us par ghusl nahin hai jab tak use inzal na ho, phir jab is ka zikr Umar aur A'ishah aur Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhum se kiya gaya to unhon ne is ka inkar kiya aur unhon ne kaha: Jab khatna khatne se mil jaye to ghusl wajib ho gaya, to Sahl al-Ansari ne kaha, aur unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko paya tha jabke woh Aap ke zamane me pandrah saal ke the: Mujhe Ubayy ibn Ka'b Raziallahu anhu ne hadees bayan ki ke woh fatwa jo woh dete the: Pani pani se hai, ek rukhsat thi jis ki Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Islam ke shuru me ijazat di thi, phir us ke baad ghusl ka hukm diya, aur Abd al-Malik ibn Marwan ne ise Ansar ke ek mard se liya tha, phir jab use ilm pahuncha to us ne ghusl kiya aur ghusl ka hukm diya."
"96","100 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Samad ibn Abd al-Warith aur Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Abu Rafi se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se."
"97","Us ne kaha: aur hum se Wahb ibn Jarir ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Shu'bah ne khabar di, Qatadah se, unhon ne Hasan se, unhon ne Abu Rafi' se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jab woh us ki chaar shakhon ke darmiyan baithe, phir zor lagaye."
"98","Aur Abd al-Samad aur Abu Nu'aym ne kaha: Phir us se jidd-o-jahd kare - to ghusl wajib ho gaya."
"99","Hum se Sulaiman ibn Shu'ayb al-Ghazzi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Bishr yani Ibn Bakr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe al-Awza'i ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abdur Rahman ibn al-Qasim ne hadees bayan ki, apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha Raziallahu anha se, ke un se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jo jima' kare aur inzal na ho? To unhon ne kaha: Maine aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne aisa kiya, phir hum dono ne us se ghusl kiya. Aur Walid ibn Muslim ne bhi ise marfu' bayan kiya."
"100","Hum se Abdullah ibn Hashim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Yahya yani Ibn Sa'id ne bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Amr ibn Murrah ne hadees bayan ki, Abdullah ibn Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ali Raziallahu anhu ke pas aaya, main aur meri qaum ke do aadmi aur Banu Asad ka ek aadmi - mera khayal hai: to unhon ne un dono ko kisi taraf bhej diya - to unhon ne kaha: Tum dono tanomand aadmi ho, pas apne deen ke liye koshish karo, phir woh baitul khala mein dakhil hue aur tayyari ki, phir bahar aaye aur pani ka ek tasht liya aur us se masah kiya, phir Quran padhne lage, goya hum ne un par inkar kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hajat puri karte, phir bahar aate aur Quran padhte, aur hum un ke sath gosht khate, aur janabat ke siwa koi cheez Aap ko us se nahin rokti thi, aur kabhi kaha: nahin chhupati thi. Yahya ne kaha: Aur Shu'bah is hadees ke bare mein kehte the: Tu pehchanta hai aur inkar karta hai? Yani: ke Abdullah ibn Salamah budhe ho chuke the, jab Amr ne unhe paya."
"101","Hum se Abdullah ibn Hashim aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Umar Raziallahu anhu ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se pucha: Kya hum mein se koi junubi halat mein so sakta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Use chahiye ke wuzu kare aur so jaye aur chahe to khaye."
"102","Hum se Ishaq ibn Mansur ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Yahya ibn Sa'id ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Humaid ne bayan kiya, Bakr se, Abu Rafi' se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) un se mile jabke woh junubi the, unhon ne kaha: Pas main chup kar peeche hat gaya aur ghusl kiya, phir aaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Tum kahan the ya tum kahan chale gaye the? Maine kaha: Main junubi tha. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Musalman napak nahin hota."
"103","Hum se Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdur Razzaq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Kuraib se, Ibn Abbas se, Maimunah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko parda kiya, pas Aap ne janabat se ghusl kiya."
"104","Hum se Ibn al-Muqri' ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Ayyub ibn Musa se, Sa'id ibn Abi Sa'id se, Abdullah ibn Rafi' jo Umm Salamah ke azaad kardah ghulam hain se, Umm Salamah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main ek aurat hun jo apne sar ki choti sakhti se bandhti hun, to kya main use ghusl-e-janabat ke liye kholun? To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhe bas itna kafi hai ke us par pani ke teen lap bhar kar dalo, phir apne upar pani bahao to tum pak ho jaogi, ya kaha: to jab tum pak ho chuki hogi."
"105","Hum se Abdullah ibn Hashim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Yahya yani Ibn Sa'id ne bayan kiya, Hisham se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Aisha Raziallahu anha ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ghusl-e-janabat ke bare mein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Aap apne dono hathon se shuru karte aur unhe dhote, phir namaz ke liye apna wuzu karte, phir apne sar ke balon ki jadon mein ungliyon se khilal karte, yahan tak ke jab samajhte ke khal tak pani pahuncha diya hai to teen chullu bhar kar apne sar par dalte, phir apne baqi jism par pani bahate."
"106","Hum se Yusuf ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Jarir ne bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Salim se, Kuraib se, Ibn Abbas se, Maimunah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ghusl kiya, Aap ne apni sharmgah dhoyi, aur apne hath ko zameen par mala, ya kaha: deewar par, phir namaz ke liye apna wuzu kiya, phir apne sar aur baqi jism par pani bahaya, phir ek taraf hat kar apne dono paon dhoye, pas maine Aap ko ek kapda diya taake Aap us se khushk hon, ya taake us se ponchhen, to Aap ne use lene se inkar kar diya, aur apne hath se is tarah ishara kiya ke use jhatakte hain."
"107","(29) Haiz ka bab: Hum ko Ali ibn Khashram ne khabar di, ke Ismail Ibn Ulayyah ne unhe khabar di, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Mu'adhah al-Adawiyyah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat ne Aisha Raziallahu anha se pucha: Kya haiz wali aurat namaz ki qaza karti hai? To unhon ne kaha: Kya tum Haruriyyah ho? Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamanay mein haiz se hotin to qaza nahin kartin thin, aur na hamein qaza ka hukm diya jata tha."
"108","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdur Razzaq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne khabar di, al-A'mash se, Thabit ibn Ubaid se, Qasim ibn Muhammad se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe chatai pakda do - jabke woh haiz se thin - unhon ne kaha: Main haiz se hun, Aap ne farmaya: Woh tumhare hath mein nahin hai."
"109","Ibn al-Muqri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Mansur ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unki walida se, unhone kaha: Maine Aisha Raziallahu anha ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hum me se kisi ek ki god me apna sar rakhte jabke woh haiz se hoti, phir Quran ki tilawat farmate."
"110","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Waki' ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Hisham ibn Urwah se, unke walid se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) itikaf ki halat me mujawir hote hue apna sar meri taraf jhukate, to main use dhoti aur kanghi karti jabke main apne hujre me hoti - aur main haiz se hoti - jabke Woh masjid me hote."
"111","Ibn al-Muqri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sufyan ne unhi se ek aur martaba hadees bayan ki, Ayyub se, Ibn Sirin se, Umm Atiyyah se, unhone kaha: Unse zikr kiya gaya to unhone kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Kunwari jawan ladkiyon aur parda-nasheen khawateen ko nikalo taake woh Eid aur Musalmanon ki dua me hazir hon, aur haiz wali aurten Musalmanon ki namazgah se alag rahen."
"112","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhone kaha: Jab mujhe haiz aata to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) mujhe hukm dete to main izar bandh leti, phir Woh mujh se mubasharat farmate."
"113","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Hakim al-Athram se, Abu Tamimah al-Hujaymi se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo kahin ke paas gaya aur uski baat ki tasdeeq ki, ya kisi aurat ke paas pichle maqam me gaya, ya kisi haiz wali aurat ke paas gaya, to usne us cheez se baraat ikhtiyar ki jo Allah ne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) par nazil farmayi."
"114","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, al-Hakam se, Abd al-Hamid se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us shakhs ke bare me farmaya jo apni biwi ke paas haiz ki halat me jaye, Aap ne farmaya: Woh ek dinar ya aadha dinar sadqa kare."
"115","Ahmad ibn Muhammad al-Shafi'i ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: al-Hasan ibn Ali al-Hulwani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sa'id ibn Amir ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, al-Hakam se, Abd al-Hamid se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se isi tarah. Shu'bah ne kaha: Aur falan aur falan ne gumaan kiya ke al-Hakam use marfu'an bayan nahin karte the, to Shu'bah se kaha gaya: Humein wohi bayan karo jo tum ne suna hai, aur falan aur falan ki baat chhodo, to unhone kaha: Mujhe ye pasand nahin ke main duniya me Nuh ki umr paun aur main is hadees ko bayan karun ya is se khamosh rahun."
"116","Muhammad ibn Zakariyya al-Jauhari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Bundar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se isi hadees se hadees bayan ki, aur use marfu'an bayan nahin kiya. To ek shakhs ne Shu'bah se kaha: Beshak tum use marfu'an bayan karte the? Unhone kaha: Main majnun tha, phir main theek ho gaya."
"117","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abdullah ibn Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sa'id - yani Ibn Abi Arubah - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abd al-Karim se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh ek dinar ya nisf dinar sadqa kare."
"118","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Abu Ja'far al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Aun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne humein khabar di, apne walid se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhone kaha: Fatimah bint Abi Hubaysh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aayin aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main ek aisi aurat hun jise istihaza ka khoon aata hai aur main kabhi paak nahin hoti, to kya main namaz chhod dun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, ye to sirf ek rag hai aur ye haiz nahin hai, phir jab haiz aaye to namaz chhod do, phir jab woh khatm ho jaye to apne se khoon dho lo aur namaz padho."
"119","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dauraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, Sakhr ibn Juwayriyah se, Nafi' se, Sulayman ibn Yasar se ke use ek shakhs ne hadees bayan ki, Umm Salamah se ke ek aurat ko khoon kasrat se jari rehta tha jo us se band nahin hota tha, to Umm Salamah ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se puchha, to Aap ne farmaya: Woh un dino aur raaton ki ginti dekhe jin me woh is se pehle haiz se hoti thi aur unki tadaad, to utni miqdar tak namaz chhod de, phir jab namaz ka waqt aaye to ghusl kare aur kapde se patti bandhe aur namaz padhe. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Isi tarah Musa ibn Uqbah aur al-Laith ibn Sa'd ne kaha, Nafi' se, Sulayman se, ek shakhs se, Umm Salamah Raziallahu anha se. Aur Malik aur Ubaidullah aur Yahya ibn Sa'id aur ghairon ne kaha, Nafi' se, Sulayman se, Umm Salamah se. Aur Ayyub ne kaha: Sulayman se khud, Umm Salamah se."
"120","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abdullah ibn Yusuf al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Bakr ibn Mudar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Ja'far ibn Rabi'ah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Irak se, Urwah se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhone kaha: Beshak Umm Habibah bint Jahsh jo Abd al-Rahman ibn Auf ke nikah me thin, unhone Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se khoon ki shikayat ki, to Aap ne unse farmaya: Utni muddat thehri raho jitni tumhe tumhara haiz rokta tha, phir ghusl karo. Unhone kaha: Aur woh har namaz ke liye ghusl karti thin."
"121","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ma'mar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Husayn Al-Mu'allim ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Zainab bint Umm Salamah ne khabar di ke ek aurat ko khoon behne ki bimari thi, aur woh Abdur Rahman ibn Awf ke nikah me thi, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use hukm diya ke har namaz ke waqt ghusl kare aur namaz parhe. Aur Ma'mar aur Hisham ne ise riwayat kiya to un dono ne kaha: Yahya se, Abu Salamah se, ke Umm Habibah se marvi hai."
"122","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Shayban se, Yahya se, Abu Salamah se, Umm Abi Bakr se, ke unhon ne use khabar di ke Aisha Raziallahu anha ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us aurat ke bare me farmaya jo taharat ke baad shak wali cheez dekhe: Yeh sirf ek rag hai ya ragen hain."
"123","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isra'il ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Muhajir se, Safiyyah bint Shaybah se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Ansar me se ek aurat ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se haiz wali aurat ke bare me sawal kiya jab woh haiz se ghusl karna chahe, Aap ne farmaya: Apna pani aur beri ke patte le, phir ghusl kar aur khoob pakizgi hasil kar, phir apne sar par pani baha yahan tak ke sar ki jadon tak pahunche, phir mushk lagi hui rui ka tukda le, us ne kaha: Main kaise karun? To Aap khamosh rahe, phir us ne kaha: Main kaise karun? To Aap khamosh rahe, to Aisha ne kaha: Mushk lagi hui rui ka tukda le aur us se khoon ke nishan ka peecha kar, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) sun rahe the aur unhon ne un par koi inkar nahin kiya."
"124","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus ibn Ubayd se, Al-Hasan se, Uthman ibn Abi Al-As se, ke woh chalis din tak aurton ke qareeb nahin jate the - yani nifas me -. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Aur Abu Bakr Al-Hudhali ne ise Al-Hasan se musnad bayan kiya hai."
"125","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Yusuf ibn Mahak se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Nifas wali aurat chalis din tak namaz se ruki rahegi."
"126","Ibn Al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwah se, Fatimah bint Al-Mundhir se, un ki dadi Asma se: ke ek aurat ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se us kapde ke bare me sawal kiya jise haiz ka khoon lag jaye, Aap ne farmaya: Use khurach de aur mal kar ragad de aur pani chhidak de aur namaz parh."
"127","(30) Tayammum ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Salih se, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah ne bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas se, Ammar ibn Yasir Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Dhat Al-Jaysh me raat ko padav dala aur Aap ke sath Aap ki zauja Aisha thin, to Zafar ke aqeeq ka un ka ek haar toot gaya, to log un ke us haar ki talash me rok liye gaye yahan tak ke fajr roshan ho gayi, aur logon ke pas pani nahin tha, to Abu Bakr un par naraz hue aur kaha: Tum ne logon ko rok diya aur un ke pas pani nahin hai, to Allah Azza wa Jalla ne Apne Rasul par pak mitti se taharat ki ruksat nazil farmayi, to Musalman Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath khade hue aur unhon ne apne hathon se zameen par mara, phir apne hath uthaye aur mitti me se kuch bhi mutthi me nahin liya, phir un se apne chehron aur apne hathon ka kandhon tak, aur apni hatheliyon ke andaruni hisse se baghlon tak masah kiya. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Aur log is ko miyar nahin banate."
"128","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Awf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Raja ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Imran ibn Husayn ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath ek safar me the to Aap ne logon ko namaz parhayi, phir jab Aap apni namaz se faregh hue to achanak ek shakhs alag khada tha jis ne jamaat ke sath namaz nahin parhi thi, to Aap ne farmaya: Ae falan! Tujhe logon ke sath namaz parhne se kis cheez ne roka? Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Mujhe janabat lahq ho gayi hai aur pani nahin hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum par pak mitti lazim hai, pas woh tumhen kifayat karegi."
"129","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad - yani Ibn Amr - ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere liye zameen masjid aur taharat ka zariya bana di gayi hai."
"130","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj Al-Anmati ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit aur Humayd se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere liye har pakiza zameen masjid aur taharat ka zariya bana di gayi hai."
"131","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne Yahya ibn Sa'id se, unhon ne Shu'bah se riwayat karke bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Al-Hakam ne bayan kiya, Dharr se, Sa'id ibn Abdur Rahman ibn Abza se, un ke walid se: ke ek shakhs Umar Raziallahu anhu ke pas aya aur kaha: Main junubi ho gaya hun aur mujhe pani nahin mila, to unhon ne kaha: Namaz na parh, to Ammar ne kaha: Ae Amir Al-Mu'minin! Kya aap ko yaad nahin, jab main aur aap ek lashkar me the, to hum junubi ho gaye aur hamen pani na mila, to rahi aap ki baat to aap ne namaz nahin parhi, aur rahi meri baat to main mitti me lot-pot hua aur namaz parhi, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhen sirf ye kafi tha ke apne dono hathon se zameen par maro, phir phoonk maro, phir un se apne chehre aur apni hatheliyon ka masah karo. To Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Ae Ammar! Allah se daro, to unhon ne kaha: Agar aap chahen to main ise bayan na karun."
"132","Al-Hakam ne kaha: Aur mujh se Ibn Abdur Rahman ibn Abza ne apne walid se Dharr ki hadees ki tarah bayan kiya."
"133","Us ne kaha: aur Salamah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Dharr se, usi isnad me jis ka Al-Hakam ne zikr kiya, us ne kaha: Umar ne kaha: balke hum tumhein wahi supurd karenge jo tum ne apne zimme liya hai."
"134","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Affan ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Aban Al-Attar ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Qatadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Azrah se, Sa'id ibn Abdur Rahman ibn Abza se, us ke walid se, Ammar ibn Yasir Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabiullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tayammum ke bare me farmaya karte the: chehre aur hatheliyon ke liye ek zarb hai."
"135","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Abu Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Al-Laith ne mujh se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Rabi'ah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman ibn Hurmuz se, Umair maula Ibn Abbas se ke us ne use kehte hue suna: main aaya, main aur Abdullah ibn Yasar maula Maimunah zauja Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) yahan tak ke hum Abu Al-Juhaym ibn Al-Harith ibn Al-Simmah Al-Ansari ke paas dakhil hue, to Abu Al-Juhaym ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Bi'r Jamal ki taraf se tashreef laye, to ek aadmi un se mila aur unhein salam kiya to Rasulullah ne salam ka jawab nahin diya yahan tak ke deewar ki taraf mutawajjeh hue, phir apne chehre aur hathon ka masah kiya."
"136","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Umar ibn Hafs ibn Ghiyath ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Al-Walid ibn Ubaidullah ibn Abi Rabah ne mujhe khabar di ke Ata ne un se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se ke ek aadmi sardiyon me junbi ho gaya to us ne sawal kiya, to use ghusl ka hukm diya gaya, phir us ne ghusl kiya to mar gaya, phir is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya gaya to unhon ne farmaya: un logon ka kya hoga, unhon ne use qatl kar diya, Allah unhein qatl kare, teen martaba, beshak Allah ne sa'eed ya tayammum ko tahoor banaya hai, Ibn Abbas ko shak hua, phir us ne baad me use sabit kar diya."
"137","Muhammad ibn Ishaq ibn Khuzaimah ne mujh se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Yusuf ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Al-Sa'ib se, Sa'id ibn Jubair se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se marfu'an, Allah Ta'ala ke qaul: Wa in kuntum marda au ala safar ke bare me, us ne kaha: jab aadmi ko Allah ke raste me zakhm ho, ya phore hon, ya chechak ho, phir woh junbi ho jaye aur use dar ho ke agar ghusl karega to mar jayega to use tayammum karna chahiye."
"138","(31) Badan aur kapron ko najasaton se pak rakhne ka bab: Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad Al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Waki' ibn Al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: main ne Mujahid ko Tawus se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se hadees bayan karte hue suna, us ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) do qabron par se guzre to farmaya: beshak ye dono azab diye ja rahe hain, aur inhein kisi badi baat me azab nahin diya ja raha: raha ye to ye chughli karta phirta tha, aur raha ye dusra to ye apne peshab se ihtiraz nahin karta tha, phir unhon ne khajoor ki tar shaakh mangwai to use do hisson me cheer diya, phir is par ek gaad diya aur is par ek, phir farmaya: shayad in se takhfeef ki jaye jab tak ye khushk na hon."
"139","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Ya'la ibn Ubaid ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Zaid ibn Wahb se, Abdur Rahman ibn Hasanah se, us ne kaha: main aur Amr ibn Al-Aas baithe hue the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamare paas tashreef laye aur un ke hath me dhal thi, to unhon ne baithe hue peshab kiya, to hum ne aapas me baat ki aur hum ne kaha: ye is tarah peshab karte hain jaise aurat peshab karti hai, to woh hamare paas aaye aur farmaya: kya tumhein maloom nahin ke Bani Israil ke ek shakhs ko kya pesh aaya, jab inhein peshab lagta to use kaat dete, phir us ne inhein mana kiya to use us ki qabr me azab diya gaya."
"140","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb se, Ibn Lahi'ah aur Al-Laith ibn Sa'd aur Amr ibn Al-Harith se, Yazid ibn Abi Habib se, Suwaid ibn Qais se, Mu'awiyah ibn Hudaij se, us ne kaha: main ne Mu'awiyah ibn Abi Sufyan Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: main ne Umm Habibah zauja Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aur Raziallahu anha se sawal kiya: kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) us kapre me namaz padhte the jis me un se jima karte the, to unhon ne kaha: haan, jab tak us me koi gandagi na dekhein."
"141","Ibn Al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq Al-Shaibani se, Abdullah ibn Shaddad se, Maimunah zauja Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne oon ke ek mirt me namaz padhi, aur us ka kuch hissa un par tha jabke woh haiza thin."
"142","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Abdul Wahhab Al-Hajabi ne mujh se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Khalid ibn Al-Harith ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Al-Ash'ath ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad se, Abdullah ibn Shaqiq Al-Uqaili se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) apni biwiyon ke lihaafon me namaz nahin padhte the."
"143","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hudhaifah ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, Hammam ibn Al-Harith se, us ne kaha: Aishah Raziallahu anha ke paas ek mehmaan tha jo junbi ho gaya, to woh jo use laga tha use dhone laga, to Aishah Raziallahu anha ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamein use khurchne ka hukm diya karte the."
"144","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Abdullah Al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, us ne kaha: Hisham ibn Hassan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ma'shar se, Ibrahim se, Al-Aswad se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: main yaqeenan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke kapre se use ragad diya karti thi, phir woh us me namaz padhte the, main ne Al-Ansari se kaha: kya tumhara matlab janabat hai, us ne kaha: to aur kya cheez hai."
"145","Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Affan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne humein khabar di, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke kapde se mani ragarti thi, phir Aap usi me namaz padhte the."
"146","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Maymun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Yasar ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Aisha Raziallahu anha ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab Aap ke kapde ko mani lag jati to Aap us jagah ko dho lete jahan woh lagi hoti, phir namaz ke liye bahar tashreef le jate jabke main Aap ke kapde par ghusl ke asar se dhabbon ko dekh rahi hoti."
"147","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah se, Umm Qays se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas apne ek bete ko lekar hazir hui jo abhi khana nahin khata tha, to us ne Aap par peshab kar diya, to Aap ne pani mangwaya aur us par chhirak diya. Aur Ma'mar aur al-Layth aur Amr ibn al-Harith ne al-Zuhri se is bare me yeh kaha: to Aap ne us par pani ke chhinte dale."
"148","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwah se, un ke walid se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas chhote bachche laye jate the taake Aap un ke liye dua karein, to ek bachche ne Aap par peshab kar diya to Aap ne us ke peshab par pani bahaya."
"149","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurayrah se: ke ek dehati masjid me dakhil hua aur namaz padhi, phir jab farigh hua to kaha: Ae Allah mujh par aur Muhammad par rehem farma aur hamare sath kisi aur par rehem na farma, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) us ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Tune wasee cheez ko tang kar diya, phir kuch der na guzri ke us ne masjid me peshab kar diya, to log us ki taraf jaldi se badhe to Aap ne unhein mana kiya aur farmaya: Us par pani ka ek dola ya ek bartan bahao, yani us ke peshab par, aur farmaya: Tum aasani karne wale bana kar bheje gaye ho aur tum sakhti karne wale bana kar nahin bheje gaye."
"150","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Idris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Umarah ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith al-Taymi se, Ibrahim ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ki umm walad se, unhon ne kaha: Main apna daman lamba rakhti thi aur use lekar gandi jagah aur saaf jagah se guzarti thi, phir main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salamah ke paas hazir hui aur un se is bare me pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Use us ke baad wali zameen pak kar deti hai."
"151","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhayr aur Sharik ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Isa ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Musa ibn Abdullah ibn Yazid se, Banu Abd al-Ashhal ki ek aurat se, ke us ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se pucha aur kaha: Hamari badbudar galiyan hain aur barish hoti hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya us ke baad us se zyada pakiza rasta nahin hai, unhon ne kaha: Ji haan, Aap ne farmaya: To yeh us ke badle hai."
"152","(32) Paanch namazon ke farz hone aur un ki behson ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur us me se jo main ne Abdullah ibn Nafi ko padh kar sunaya aur Mutarrif ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Malik se, un ke chacha Abu Suhayl ibn Malik se, un ke walid se ke unhon ne Talhah ibn Ubaydullah Raziallahu anhu ko farmate hue suna: Najd ke rehne walon me se ek shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aya jiske sar ke baal bikhre hue the, us ki awaz ki gunj sunai deti thi aur samajh me na ata tha ke woh kya keh raha hai, hatta ke woh qareeb aya to woh Islam ke bare me sawal kar raha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Din aur raat me paanch namazein hain, us ne kaha: Kya mujh par is ke siwa kuch aur hai, Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, magar yeh ke tu nafl ada kare, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur Ramazan ke mahine ka roza hai, us ne kaha: Kya mujh par is ke siwa kuch aur hai, Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, magar yeh ke tu nafl rakhe, unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se zakat ka zikr kiya, us ne kaha: Kya mujh par is ke siwa kuch aur hai, Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, magar yeh ke tu nafl de, unhon ne kaha: Phir woh shakhs peeth pher kar wapas gaya aur woh keh raha tha: Main is par na izafa karunga aur na is me se kami karunga, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh kamyab hoga agar us ne sach kaha."
"153","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Maysarah aur Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se ke un dono ne Anas Raziallahu anhu ko farmate hue suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Madinah me Zuhr ki chaar rakatein padhin, aur main ne Aap ke sath Dhu al-Hulayfah me Asr ki do rakatein padhin."
"154","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah, yani Ibn Idris, ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Ibn Abi Ammar se, Abdullah ibn Babah se, Ya'la ibn Umayyah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu se kaha: Pas tum par koi gunah nahin ke tum namaz me se qasr karo agar tumhe dar ho, jabke log aman me aa chuke hain, to Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Mujhe usi par ta'ajjub hua jis par tumhe ta'ajjub hua, phir main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se pucha to Aap ne farmaya: Yeh ek sadqa hai jo Allah ne tum par kiya hai, pas us ke sadqe ko qubool karo."
"155","Muhammad ibn Hisham ibn Mallas al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harmalah ibn Abd al-Aziz al-Juhani ne san ek sau banwe me hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere chacha Abd al-Malik ibn al-Rabi ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, apne walid se, apne dada se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se ke Aap ne farmaya: Bachche ko saat saal ki umar me namaz ka hukm do, aur us par das saal ki umar me maro."
"156","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah se, Hammad se, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, Nabi se ke Aap ne farmaya: Teen shakjson se qalam utha liya gaya hai: Sone wale se hatta ke woh jaag jaye, aur bachche se hatta ke woh bada ho jaye, aur majnoon se hatta ke woh aqlmand ho jaye ya hosh me aa jaye."
"157","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Affan se isi sanad ke sath aur unhon ne kaha: hatta ke wo muhtalim ho jaye."
"158","(33) Namaz ke auqat ka bab: Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman ibn al-Haris se, unhon ne kaha: Hakim ibn Hakim ne mujh se bayan kiya, Nafi ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jibril Alaihissalam ne Baitullah ke paas meri imamat karwai, pas unhon ne mujhe Zuhr padhai jab suraj dhal gaya jab wo tasmay ke barabar thi, phir unhon ne mujhe Asr padhai jab har cheez ka saya us ke barabar ho gaya, phir unhon ne mujhe Maghrib padhai jab rozedar iftar karta hai, phir unhon ne mujhe Isha padhai jab shafaq ghaib ho gaya, phir unhon ne mujhe Fajr padhai jab rozedar par khana aur peena haram ho jata hai, phir unhon ne agle din mujhe Zuhr padhai jab har cheez ka saya us ke barabar tha, phir unhon ne mujhe Asr padhai jab har cheez ka saya do guna tha, phir unhon ne mujhe Maghrib padhai jab rozedar iftar karta hai ek hi waqt me, phir unhon ne mujhe Isha padhai raat ke pehle teesre hisse tak, phir unhon ne mujhe Fajr padhai aur use roshan karke padha, phir meri taraf mutawajjeh hue, pas farmaya: Aye Muhammad, yeh tum se pehle ambiya ka waqt hai, aur waqt in dono waqton ke darmiyan hai."
"159","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nuaym aur Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman ibn al-Haris se, Hakim ibn Hakim ibn Abbad ibn Hunayf se, Nafi ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jibril Alaihissalam ne Baitullah ke paas do martaba meri imamat karwai. Ibn Yahya ne kaha: Aur dono ne mil kar poori hadees bayan ki pas unhon ne namaz ka zikr do waqton me kiya, jaldi padhne aur roshan karke padhne me."
"160","Muhammad ibn Bazi al-Naysaburi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq - yani Ibn Yusuf al-Azraq - ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan al-Thawri ne hum se bayan kiya, Alqamah ibn Marthad se, Sulayman ibn Buraydah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya pas un se namaz ke waqt ke bare me sawal kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: hamare sath ye dono namazen padho, pas Bilal ko hukm diya jab suraj dhal gaya to unhon ne azan di, phir unhen hukm diya to unhon ne Zuhr ki iqamat kahi, phir unhen hukm diya to unhon ne Asr ki iqamat kahi jabke suraj buland, safed aur saaf tha, phir unhen hukm diya to unhon ne Maghrib ki iqamat kahi jab suraj ghurub ho gaya, phir unhen hukm diya to unhon ne Isha ki iqamat kahi jab shafaq ghaib ho gaya, phir unhen hukm diya to unhon ne Fajr ki iqamat kahi jab fajr tulu hui, pas jab doosra din hua to unhen Zuhr thandi karke padhne ka hukm diya pas unhon ne use khoob thanda karke padha, phir unhen hukm diya to unhon ne iqamat kahi - yani Asr ki - jabke suraj us se zyada buland tha jo pehle tha, phir unhen hukm diya to unhon ne Maghrib ki iqamat kahi shafaq ghaib hone se pehle, phir unhen hukm diya to unhon ne Isha ki iqamat kahi jab raat ka teesra hissa guzar gaya, phir unhen hukm diya to unhon ne Fajr ki iqamat kahi aur use roshan karke padha, phir farmaya: namaz ke waqt ke bare me sawal karne wala kahan hai? Pas wo shakhs un ki taraf khada hua, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: tumhari namaz ka waqt us ke darmiyan hai jo tum ne dekha."
"161","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar se, Zuhri se, Abi Salamah se, Abi Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne Asr ki ek rakat suraj ghurub hone se pehle pa li to us ne use pa liya, aur jis ne Subh ki ek rakat suraj tulu hone se pehle pa li to us ne use pa liya."
"162","Muhammad ibn al-Husayn ibn Tarkhan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman - yani Ibn al-Mughirah - ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Abdullah ibn Rabah se, Abi Qatadah se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se ke Aap ne farmaya: Neend me koi kotahi nahin, lekin kotahi us par hai jo namaz na padhe yahan tak ke doosri namaz ka waqt aa jaye."
"163","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Taymi se, Abi Usman se, Ibn Masud Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhen Bilal ki azan - ya kaha: Bilal ki nida - Taymi ko shak hua - dhoke me na dale, pas fajr wo nahin jo is tarah kehta hai, aur unhon ne apna hath uthaya, lekin fajr wo hai jo is tarah hai, aur unhon ne apni do ungliyan aarz me phailain."
"164","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zakariyya ibn Adi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne hamen khabar di, Yunus se, Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne Asr ki namaz ka ek sajda suraj ghurub hone se pehle pa liya aur Fajr ka suraj tulu hone se pehle pa liya to us ne use pa liya."
"165","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, Abi Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab garmi sakht ho jaye to namaz thandi karke padho pas beshak garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhaap se hai."
"166","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim ibn Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abi Hassan se, Abidah se, Ali Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se Aap ne farmaya: Unhon ne hamen darmiyani namaz, Asr ki namaz se mashghul rakha, Allah un ki qabron ko - ya kaha: un ke gharon aur un ke peton ko - aag se bhar de."
"167","(34) Azan ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ibn Sad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Haris al-Taymi ne mujh se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Zayd ibn Abd Rabbihi se, unhon ne kaha: mere walid Abdullah ibn Zayd Raziallahu anhu ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne naqus bajane ka hukm diya taake logon ko namaz ke liye jama karne ke liye use bajaya jaye to mere gird jabke me soya hua tha ek shakhs chakkar lagaya jis ke hath me naqus tha, pas me ne us se kaha: Aye Allah ke bande, kya tum naqus bechte ho? To us ne kaha: tum us ke sath kya karoge? Unhon ne kaha: me ne kaha: ham us ke zariye namaz ke liye pukarte hain, us ne kaha: kya me tumhen us se behtar cheez na bataun? Me ne kaha: kyun nahin, us ne kaha: tum kaho: Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah, Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Hayya ala al-salah Hayya ala al-salah, Hayya ala al-falah Hayya ala al-falah, Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, La ilaha illallah. Unhon ne kaha: phir wo thodi door hat gaya, unhon ne kaha: phir tum kaho jab tum namaz ki iqamat kaho: Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Hayya ala al-salah, Hayya ala al-falah, Qad qamat al-salah Qad qamat al-salah, Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, La ilaha illallah. Pas jab subh hui to me Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya pas Aap ko us se khabar di jo me ne dekha tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Yeh khwab-e-haq hai InshaAllah, pas Bilal ke sath khade ho jao pas jo tum ne dekha hai use un par pesh karo pas wo us ke sath azan kahen, pas beshak wo tum se zyada buland awaz wale hain, pas me Bilal ke sath khada hua pas me use unhen talqeen karne laga aur wo us ke sath azan kehte, unhon ne kaha: pas Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu ne us ke bare me suna jabke wo apne ghar me the, to wo apni chadar ghaseet-te hue nikle kehte hue: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne aap ko haq ke sath bheja hai Ya Rasulullah, yaqinan mujhe bhi usi jaisa dikhaya gaya hai jaisa use dikhaya gaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Pas Allah ke liye hamd hai."
"168","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Abi Qilabah se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Bilal ko hukm diya gaya ke azan ke kalimat do do martaba kahen aur iqamat ke kalimat ek ek martaba kahen."
"169","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Muhammad ibn Idris ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak ibn Atiyyah se, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Bilal ko hukm diya gaya ke azan ko shafa (do-do karke) kahe aur iqamat ko witr (ek-ek karke) kahe. Ayyub ne kaha: Siwaye iqamat ke. Yeh hadees Ibn Idris ke alfaz hain."
"170","Abu Jafar al-Darimi Ahmad ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail Ibn Ulayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ayyub se kaha: Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Qilabah se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Bilal ko hukm diya gaya ke azan ko shafa kahe aur iqamat ko witr kahe. To Ayyub ne kaha: Siwaye iqamat ke."
"171","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Affan ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amir al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Makhul ne bayan kiya ke Ibn Muhayriz ne un se bayan kiya ke Abu Mahdhurah ne unhen khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen unnis kalimon wali azan aur satrah kalimon wali iqamat sikhayi. Azan: Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah, Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Hayya alas salah, Hayya alas salah, Hayya alal falah, Hayya alal falah, Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, La ilaha illallah, aur iqamat: Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah, Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Hayya alas salah, Hayya alas salah, Hayya alal falah, Hayya alal falah, Qad qamatis salah, Qad qamatis salah, Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, La ilaha illallah."
"172","Musa ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Masruqi aur Ibrahim ibn Ahmad ibn Yaish ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se."
"173","Aur al-Qasim se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Bilal raat mein azan dete hain, pas khao aur piyo hatta ke Ibn Umm Maktum azan de."
"174","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa yani Ibn Yunus ne hamen khabar di, Shubah se. Aur Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir al-Aqadi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Jafar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Muthanna se suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se suna, woh kehte the: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein azan do-do karke thi aur iqamat ek-ek karke, siwaye is ke ke woh kehte the: Qad qamatis salah, use dohra kar kehte the, pas jab hum use sunte to wuzu karte aur namaz ke liye nikalte. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Abu al-Muthanna ka naam Muslim ibn Mihran hai, jo Masjid Kufa ke muazzin hain."
"175","(35) Qibla ka bab. Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Nufayli ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab pehle Madinah tashreef laye to solah ya satrah mahine tak Bayt al-Maqdis ki taraf rukh karke namaz parhte rahe, halanke unhen pasand tha ke un ka qibla Bait ki taraf ho, aur sab se pehli namaz jo unhon ne parhi woh Asr ki namaz thi, aur un ke sath kuch logon ne namaz parhi, to un mein se ek shakhs jo un ke sath namaz parh chuka tha nikla, pas ek masjid walon ke pas se guzra jabke woh ruku mein the, to us ne kaha: Main Allah ki qasam kha kar gawahi deta hun ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Makkah ki taraf rukh karke namaz parhi hai, to woh jis halat mein the usi mein Bait ki taraf ghoom gaye, aur unhen pasand tha ke qibla Bait ki taraf pher diya jaye, aur unhon ne baqi hadees zikr ki."
"176","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ibn Qudamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak ibn Harb se, Musa ibn Talhah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek ko chahiye ke apne samne rahl ke pichhle hisse ki manind koi cheez rakhe aur namaz parhe."
"177","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur un ahadees mein se jo main ne Abdullah ibn Nafi ko parh kar sunayin, aur mujh se Mutarrif ne bayan kiya, Malik se, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Abdur Rahman ibn Abi Said se, Abu Said al-Khudri se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parh raha ho to woh kisi ko apne samne se guzarne na de, aur jitna ho sake use roke, phir agar woh inkar kare to us se lade, kyunke woh to bas shaitan hai."
"178","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah se, ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se suna, woh kehte the: Main aur al-Fadl Arafah ke din aaye jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) namaz parh rahe the aur hum ek gadhi par the, pas hum saf ke ek hisse ke samne se guzre to hum us se utar gaye aur use chhod diya ke woh charti rahe, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hum se kuch na kaha. Mahmud ne izafa kiya: Pas hum namaz mein dakhil ho gaye."
"179","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Yahya yani Ibn Said ne bayan kiya, Hisham se, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se mere walid ne bayan kiya, Aisha Raziallahu anha se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) raat mein namaz parhte the jabke main bister par un ke aur qible ke darmiyan aade leti hoti thi, pas jab woh witr parhne ka irada karte to mujhe jaga dete to main witr parh leti."
"180","(36) Namaz ke liye kapdon ka bab. Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Said se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se ke ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya aadmi ek kapde mein namaz parh sakta hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum sab do-do kapde pate ho?"
"181","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se Sufyan se, unhon ne Abu al-Zinad se, unhon ne al-A'raj se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se riwayat karke bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke aadmi ek hi kapde mein namaz padhe jabke uske kandhe par us mein se kuch na ho."
"182","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harun ibn Ma'ruf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hatim ibn Isma'il ne hum se Ya'qub ibn Mujahid Abu Hazrah se, unhon ne Ubadah ibn al-Walid ibn Ubadah se riwayat karke bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main aur mere walid nikle hatta ke hum Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ke paas unki masjid mein aaye, aur unhon ne hadees ka kuch hissa zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) namaz padhne ke liye khade hue, aur mere upar ek chadar thi, maine uske dono kinaron ko mukhalif taraf karna chaha to wo mujhe na pahunchi, aur uske jhalar the to maine use ulta kiya, phir uske dono kinaron ko mukhalif taraf kiya, phir us par jhuk kar use lapet liya, phir main aaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke baayein taraf khada ho gaya to unhon ne mera haath pakad kar mujhe ghumaya hatta ke mujhe apne daayein taraf khada kar diya, aur Jabbar ibn Sakhr aaye to unhon ne wuzu kiya, phir aaye aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke baayein taraf khade hue to unhon ne hum dono ko dono haathon se pakda aur humein dhakka dekar apne peeche khada kar diya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) mujhe dekhte rahe aur mujhe ehsas na hua, phir main samajh gaya, to unhon ne apne haath se farmaya: Is tarah, yani apni kamar kas lo, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) farigh hue to farmaya: Aye Jabir, maine kaha: Labbaik Ya Rasulullah, unhon ne farmaya: Agar wo kushada ho to uske dono kinaron ko mukhalif taraf karo, aur agar tang ho to use apne kamar par kas kar bandh lo."
"183","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Nu'man aur Abu al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se Qatadah se, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Sirin se, unhon ne Safiyyah bint al-Harith se, unhon ne A'ishah Raziallahu anha se riwayat karke bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah haizah aurat ki namaz khimar ke baghair qabool nahin farmata."
"184","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn al-Mufaddal ne hum se Abu Maslamah se, aur wo Sa'id ibn Yazid hain, bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas Raziallahu anhu se pucha: Kya Nabi apne jooton mein namaz padhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"185","(37) Masjid ke bare mein jo kuch aaya: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se Ma'mar se, unhon ne al-Zuhri se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di ke A'ishah aur Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ne unhein khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) par jab aakhri waqt nazil hua to wo apne chehre par ek dharidar ooni chadar dalne lage, phir jab bechain hote to use apne chehre se hata dete, aur farmate: Yahud aur Nasara par Allah ki la'nat ho, unhon ne apne ambiya ki qabron ko masjidein bana liya, A'ishah Raziallahu anha farmati hain: Unke jaise kaam se darate hue."
"186","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se al-Shaybani se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah ibn Shaddad ko Maymunah se hadees bayan karte hue suna: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khumrah par namaz padhte the."
"187","(38) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki namaz ki sifaat ka bab: Ibn al-Muqri', Harun ibn Ishaq aur Yusuf ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Salim se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat karke bayan kiya ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekha jab wo namaz shuru karte to apne dono haath uthate hatta ke unhein apne kandhon ke barabar kar lete, aur jab ruku ka irada karte aur jab ruku se apna sar uthate, aur dono sajdon ke darmiyan rafa yadain nahin karte the."
"188","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Akhi Ibn Shihab ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne chacha se, unhon ne kaha: Salim ibn Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di ke Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab namaz ke liye khade hote to apne dono haath uthate hatta ke jab wo dono kandhon ke barabar hote to takbir kehte, phir jab ruku ka irada karte to dono ko uthate hatta ke wo dono kandhon ke barabar hote, isi haal mein takbir kehte aur ruku karte, phir jab apni peeth uthane ka irada karte to dono ko uthate hatta ke wo dono kandhon ke barabar hote, phir kehte: Sami' Allahu liman hamidah, phir sajda karte aur sajde mein apne haathon ko nahin uthate, aur har rak'at mein aur har takbir mein jo ruku se pehle kehte dono ko uthate hatta ke unki namaz khatm ho jati."
"189","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ibn Minhal aur Abu Salih Katib al-Layth dono ne Abd al-Aziz ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Salamah se, unhon ne apne chacha al-Majishun ibn Abi Salamah se, unhon ne al-A'raj se, unhon ne Ubaydullah ibn Abi Rafi' se, unhon ne Ali ibn Abi Talib Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat kiya: Ke wo jab namaz shuru karte to takbir kehte, phir kehte: Maine apna chehra us Zaat ki taraf kar liya jisne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya, yaksoo hokar aur main mushrikon mein se nahin hoon, beshak meri namaz aur meri qurbani aur mera jeena aur mera marna Allah ke liye hai jo tamam jahanon ka Rabb hai, uska koi sharik nahin, aur isi ka mujhe hukm diya gaya hai aur main sab se pehle Musalmanon mein se hoon, Aye Allah Tu Badshah hai, Tere siwa koi mabud nahin, Tu mera Rabb hai aur main Tera banda hoon, maine apni jaan par zulm kiya aur apne gunah ka iqrar kiya, pas mere tamam gunah bakhsh de, Tere siwa gunahon ko koi nahin bakhshta, aur mujhe behtareen akhlaq ki hidayat de, Tere siwa uske behtareen ki taraf koi hidayat nahin deta, aur uske bure ko mujh se pher de, Tere siwa uske bure ko koi nahin pherta, labbaik wa sa'daik aur tamam bhalai Tere dono haathon mein hai, aur shar Teri taraf mansub nahin, main Tere se hoon aur Teri taraf hoon, Tu barkat wala aur buland hai, main Tujh se bakhshish mangta hoon aur Teri taraf tauba karta hoon, phir jab ruku karte to kehte: Aye Allah Tere liye maine ruku kiya, aur Tujh par iman laya, aur Tere liye farmabardar hua, Tere liye mera kaan aur meri aankh aur mera maghz aur meri haddiyan aur mere paththe jhuk gaye, phir jab apna sar uthate to kehte: Sami' Allahu liman hamidah, Rabbana wa lakal hamd mil'as samawati wal ard, wa mil'a ma shi'ta min shai'in ba'd, phir jab sajda karte to kehte: Aye Allah Tere liye maine sajda kiya aur Tujh par iman laya, aur Tere liye farmabardar hua, mere chehre ne us Zaat ko sajda kiya jisne use paida kiya, aur uski surat banai to uski surat khoob banai, aur uske kaan aur aankh ko khola, pas Allah barkat wala hai jo sab se behtareen khaliq hai, aur jab apni namaz se farigh hote aur salam pherte to kehte: Aye Allah bakhsh de mere liye jo maine aage bheja, aur jo peeche chhoda, aur jo chhupaya, aur jo zahir kiya, aur jo had se badha, aur jo Tu mujh se zyada janta hai, Tu aage karne wala aur peeche karne wala hai, Tere siwa koi mabud nahin, Abu Salih ne dono mein kaha: Mera Tere siwa koi mabud nahin."
"190","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se Amr ibn Murrah se, unhon ne Asim al-Anazi se, unhon ne Ibn Jubayr ibn Mut'im se, unhon ne apne walid Raziallahu anhu se riwayat karke bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab namaz mein dakhil hote to kehte: Allahu Akbar kabira, wal hamdu lillahi kathira, teen martaba, wa subhan Allahi bukratan wa asila, Aye Allah main Tujh se panah mangta hoon shaitan mardud se, uske phoonk aur uske thook aur uske chubhan se, Amr ne kaha: Uska phoonk takabbur hai, aur uska chubhan deewangi hai, aur uska thook shair hai, aur Mis'ar ne Amr ibn Murrah se, Anazah ke ek aadmi se riwayat kiya, aur Husayn se, Amr ibn Murrah se ikhtilaf kiya gaya, to un mein se kisi ne kaha: Ammar ibn Asim se, aur un mein se kisi ne kaha: Umarah se, aur Ibn Idris ne kaha: Husayn se, Amr se, aur Abbad ibn Asim se."
"191","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Idris, Uqbah aur Abu Khalid ne hum se Ibn Abi Arubah se, unhon ne Qatadah se, unhon ne Anas Raziallahu anhu se riwayat karke bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aur Abu Bakr, Umar aur Usman Raziallahu anhum ke peeche namaz padhi, to wo Bismillah ir Rahman ir Rahim buland awaz se nahin padhte the."
"192","Ibn al-Muqri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Ayyub se, unhon ne Qatadah se, unhon ne Anas Raziallahu anhu se riwayat karke bayan kiya: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar Raziallahu anhuma qirat ka aaghaz Alhamdu lillahi Rabbil Alamin se karte the."
"193","Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar Raziallahu anhuma ke peeche namaz parhi, to maine unhein Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim buland awaz se parhte hue nahin suna. Shu'bah ne kaha: Maine Qatadah se kaha: Kya tum ne ise khud suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ji haan."
"194","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Layth ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Khalid ibn Yazid ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Abi Hilal se, Nu'aym al-Mujmir se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ke peeche namaz parhi, to unhon ne Bismillahir Rahmanir Rahim parhi, phir Ummul Quran parhi yahan tak ke Wala al-Dallin tak pahunche, to Aameen kaha, aur logon ne Aameen kaha, aur woh jab bhi sajda karte to Allahu Akbar kehte, aur jab baithne se khade hote to Allahu Akbar kehte, aur jab salam pherte to kehte: Us Zaat ki qasam Jiske Haath mein meri jaan hai, beshak main tum mein sab se zyada Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki namaz se mushabeh namaz parhne wala hun."
"195","Ibn al-Muqri' aur Mahmud ibn Adam aur Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya - aur yeh hadees Ibn al-Muqri' ke alfaz hain - unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Zuhri se, Mahmud ibn al-Rabi' se, Ubadah ibn al-Samit se marfu'an riwayat hai, aur ek martaba unhon ne mujh se kaha: Unhon ne bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Us shakhs ki koi namaz nahin jis ne Fatihatul Kitab na parhi."
"196","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Al-Qattan - ne hum se bayan kiya, Ja'far ibn Maymun se, Abu Uthman se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Fatihatul Quran ke baghair koi namaz nahin, phir jo kuch zyada parhe. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Yeh Ja'far hain, un se Al-Thawri aur Isa ibn Yunus ne riwayat ki hai."
"197","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammam se, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abdullah ibn Abi Qatadah se, unke walid Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Zuhr ki namaz ki pehli do rak'aton mein har rak'at mein Fatihatul Kitab aur ek surat parha karte the, aur kabhi kabhi humein koi ayat suna diya karte the, aur pehli rak'at ko itna lamba karte jitna dusri mein lamba na karte, aur aakhri do rak'aton mein har rak'at mein Fatihatul Kitab parha karte the. Unhon ne kaha: Aur isi tarah Asr ki namaz mein, unhon ne kaha: Aur isi tarah Fajr ki namaz mein."
"198","Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Aur ise Makhlad ibn Yazid ne riwayat kiya, Al-Awza'i se, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, isi isnad ke sath isi tarah, magar unhon ne: aur Fajr ki namaz ka zikr nahin kiya. Ise Muhammad ibn Idris ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Humaydi se, un se."
"199","Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne mujhe khabar di, Ata' se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Har namaz mein qira'at hai, to jo kuch Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein sunaya hum ne tumhein sunaya, aur jo kuch unhon ne hum se poshida rakha hum ne tum se poshida rakha, phir maine unhein kehte hue suna: Qira'at ke baghair koi namaz nahin."
"200","Ibn al-Muqri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mis'ar se, Ibrahim al-Saksaki se, Ibn Abi Awfa Raziallahu anhu se ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe koi aisi cheez sikha dijiye jo mujhe Quran se kifayat kare, to unhon ne farmaya: Kaho: Subhanallah, walhamdulillah, wa la ilaha illallah, wallahu akbar. Sufyan ne kaha: Yazid Abu Khalid al-Wasiti ne izafa kiya: Us aadmi ne kaha: Yeh mere Rabb ke liye hai, to mere liye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Kaho: Allahumma, ighfir li warhamni wahdini wa afini. Us aadmi ne kaha: Chaar mere Rabb ke liye aur chaar mere liye."
"201","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyaynah ne mujhe khabar di, Al-Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tak pahunchate hue, unhon ne farmaya: Jab qari Aameen kahe to tum Aameen kaho, pas beshak farishte Aameen kehte hain, to jis ka Aameen kehna farishton ke Aameen kehne ke muwafiq ho gaya uske pichle gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"202","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se ke woh jab bhi jhukte aur uthte to takbir kehte the, aur kehte the: Beshak main tum mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki namaz se sab se zyada mushabeh namaz parhne wala hun."
"203","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne mujhe khabar di, Abd al-Hamid ibn Ja'far se, Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Ata' se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Humayd al-Sa'idi ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ashab mein se das afrad mein suna, un mein se ek Abu Qatadah hain Raziallahu anhum, unhon ne kaha: Beshak main tum mein sab se zyada Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki namaz ko janne wala hun. Unhon ne kaha: Kyun? Allah ki qasam, na tum hum mein sab se zyada unki pairwi karne wale the aur na hum mein sab se pehle, ya kaha: sab se lambi unki sohbat rakhne wale the. Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Phir pesh karo. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab namaz ke liye khade hote to apne dono haath kandhon ke barabar uthate, phir takbir kehte yahan tak ke har haddi apni jagah par seedhi qaraar pakad leti, phir qira'at karte, phir takbir kehte aur apne dono haath kandhon ke barabar uthate, yahan tak ke har haddi apne jod par wapas aa jati, phir ruku karte aur apni hatheliyan apne ghutnon par rakhte, phir seedhe hote aur na bahut jhukte aur na sar utha lete, phir apna sar uthate to kehte: Sami'allahu liman hamidah, apne dono haath kandhon ke barabar seedhe uthate hue. Abu Asim ne kaha: Mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Yahan tak ke har haddi apni jagah par wapas aa jati, phir kehte: Allahu Akbar, phir zameen ki taraf jhukte apne dono haathon ko apne pehluon se door rakhte hue, phir sajda karte, phir apna sar uthate to apni baayin taang modte aur us par baithte, aur jab sajda karte to apne pairon ki ungliyan khol diya karte the, phir laut kar sajda karte, phir apna sar uthate to kehte: Allahu Akbar, aur apni baayin taang modte aur us par seedhe baithte, yahan tak ke har haddi apni jagah par wapas aa jati, phir dusri rak'at mein bhi isi tarah karte, yahan tak ke jab do rak'aton se khade hote to takbir kehte aur apne dono haath kandhon ke barabar uthate, jaisa namaz ke aaghaz mein kiya tha, phir apni baqi namaz mein bhi isi tarah karte, yahan tak ke jab woh qadah hota jis mein salam hai to apni baayin taang peeche karte aur baayein pehlu par mutawarrikan baithte. Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne sach kaha, isi tarah woh kiya karte the."
"204","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur Abu Asim ne humein ek aur martaba ise bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Hamid ibn Ja'far ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Ata' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Humayd al-Sa'idi ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ashab mein se das afrad mein suna, un mein se ek Abu Qatadah hain, unhon ne kaha: Beshak main tum mein sab se zyada Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki namaz ko janne wala hun. Ibn Yahya ne kaha: Aur unhon ne hadees ko mukammal bayan kiya."
"205","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talhah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali ibn Yahya ibn Khallad ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne apne chacha Rifa'ah ibn Rafi' se riwayat kiya ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas baithe hue thay jab ek shakhs aaya, phir masjid me dakhil hua aur namaz parhi, phir jab apni namaz se farigh hua to aaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko aur jamaat walon ko salam kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Aur tum par bhi salam, wapas jao aur namaz parho kyunke tum ne namaz nahin parhi, unhon ne kaha: Phir woh wapas gaya aur namaz parhi, unhon ne kaha: Phir hum us ki namaz ko ghaur se dekhne lage, hum nahin jante thay ke us me kya aib nikalte hain, phir jab us ne apni namaz poori ki to aaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko aur jamaat walon ko salam kiya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur tum par bhi salam, wapas jao aur namaz parho kyunke tum ne namaz nahin parhi, aur us baat ka zikr ya to do martaba ya teen martaba kiya, phir us shakhs ne kaha: Mujhe nahin maloom ke aap ne meri namaz me kya aib nikala hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum me se kisi ki namaz mukammal nahin hoti yahan tak ke wuzu ko is tarah mukammal kare jaisa Allah Ta'ala ne use hukm diya hai, phir apna chehra dhoye aur apne haathon ko kohniyon tak dhoye aur apne sar ka masah kare aur apne paon ka takhnon tak, phir Allah ki takbeer kahe aur Us ki hamd aur Us ki buzurgi bayan kare, aur Quran me se jitna Allah ne use ijazat di ho aur aasan ho parhe, phir takbeer kahe aur ruku kare aur apni hatheliyon ko apne ghutnon par rakhe yahan tak ke us ke jor pur-sukoon ho jayen aur dheele par jayen, phir kahe: Sami'Allahu liman hamidah, seedha khara ho jaye yahan tak ke har haddi apni jagah le le aur apni peeth seedhi kare, phir takbeer kahe aur sajda kare aur apni peshani jamaye, Hammam ne kaha: Aur kabhi unhon ne kaha: Apne chehre ko zameen par jamaye yahan tak ke us ke jor pur-sukoon ho jayen aur dheele par jayen, phir takbeer kahe aur apna sar uthaye aur apne nitamb par barabar baith jaye aur apni peeth seedhi kare, phir isi tarah namaz ka wasf kiya yahan tak ke farigh hue, phir farmaya: Tum me se kisi ki namaz mukammal nahin hoti yahan tak ke woh aisa kare."
"206","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mu'awiyah al-Darir aur Muhammad ibn Fudayl aur Ali ibn Ubayd aur Muhammad ibn Rabi'ah aur Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne Umarah ibn Umayr se, unhon ne Abu Ma'mar se, unhon ne Abu Mas'ud al-Ansari Raziallahu anhu se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Us namaz ka koi faida nahin jis me aadmi ruku aur sujood me apni peeth seedhi na kare."
"207","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ya'ni Ibn Idris ne mujhe khabar di, Asim ibn Kulayb se, unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Aswad se, unhon ne Alqamah se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein namaz sikhayi, phir takbeer kahi aur apne haath uthaye, phir jab ruku ka irada kiya to apne haathon ko ghutnon ke darmiyan milaya, unhon ne kaha: Phir yeh baat Sa'd tak pahunchi to unhon ne kaha: Mere bhai ne sach kaha, hum pehle aisa kiya karte thay, phir humein is ka hukm diya gaya ya'ni ghutnon ko pakarne ka, aur unhon ne apne haathon ko apne ghutnon par rakha."
"208","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya (h), aur Ibn al-Muqri' aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne fajr ki namaz ki aakhri rak'at se apna sar uthaya to farmaya: Aye Allah, al-Walid ibn al-Walid ko aur Salamah ibn Hisham ko aur Ayyash ibn Abi Rabi'ah ko aur Makkah me kamzoron ko nijaat de, Aye Allah, Mudar par apni pakar sakht kar de aur use un par Yusuf ke saalon jaise qahet ke saal bana de."
"209","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Nu'man Muhammad ibn al-Fadl al-Sadusi ne hum se bayan kiya aur un ka laqab Arim tha aur woh sakhti se door thay, siqah sadiq musalman thay, unhon ne kaha: Thabit ibn Yazid Abu Zayd al-Ahwal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hilal ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne musalsal ek mahine tak Zuhr aur Asr aur Maghrib aur Isha aur Fajr me har namaz ke aakhir me jab aakhri rak'at me Sami'Allahu liman hamidah kaha to qunut kiya, Banu Sulaym ke ek qabile Ril aur Dhakwan ke khilaf bad-dua karte thay aur jo un ke peeche thay woh amin kehte thay, unhon ne kaha: Unhein Islam ki dawat dene ke liye bheja tha to unhon ne unhein qatl kar diya, Ikrimah ne kaha: Yeh qunut ki kunji hai."
"210","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, unhon ne Tawus se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein saat haddiyon par sajda karne ka hukm diya aur baal ya kapra sametne se mana kiya: apne donon haathon aur apne ghutnon aur apni peshani aur apne paon ki ungliyon ke kinaron par."
"211","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ya'ni Ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasam us Zaat ki jis ne unhein izzat bakhshi aur un par Kitab nazil ki, maine dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ek raat humein Maghrib ki namaz parha rahe thay aur un ki peshani aur naak ka bansaa paani aur geele gaare me tha."
"212","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, unhon ne Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi sajda kare to apne haathon ko rakhe aur jab uthaye to unhein uthaye, kyunke donon haath sajda karte hain jaise chehra sajda karta hai."
"213","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ya'ni Ibn Idris ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim ibn Kulayb se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Wa'il ibn Hujr se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Main zaroor Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki namaz dekhunga, unhon ne kaha: Phir jab unhon ne namaz shuru ki to takbeer kahi aur apne haath uthaye, to maine dekha ke un ke angoothe un ke kaanon ke qareeb thay, aur hadees zikr ki, unhon ne kaha: Phir sajda kiya aur apna sar apne donon haathon ke darmiyan usi andaze par rakha jitna namaz shuru karte waqt tha."
"214","Ibn al-Muqri' aur Abd al-Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Suhaym se, unhon ne Ibrahim ibn Abdullah ibn Ma'bad se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne parda uthaya aur log Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ke peeche safon me thay, Ibn al-Muqri' ne kaha: Aur ek martaba kaha: Woh peeche hatna chahte thay to unhon ne un ki taraf ishara kiya ke wahin raho to woh wahin rahe, phir farmaya: Aye logo, nubuwwat ki khushkhabriyon me se nek khwab ke siwa kuch baqi nahin raha jo aadmi dekhe ya us ke liye dekha jaye, phir farmaya: Khabardar, mujhe ruku ya sajde me qirat karne se mana kiya gaya hai, raha ruku to us me Rab ki azmat bayan karo aur raha sajda to us me dua me koshish karo kyunke laiq hai ke tumhare liye qubool ki jaye, Ibn al-Muqri' ne kaha: Aur ek martaba kaha: Phir ummeed hai, yeh hadees Ibn al-Muqri' ki hai."
"215","Yusuf ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Ala' ibn Abd al-Jabbar al-Basri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid al-Hadhdha' ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Qilabah se, unhon ne Malik ibn al-Huwayrith se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Woh hamari masjid me hamare paas aaye aur humein namaz parhayi, phir kaha: Main chahta hun ke tumhein dikhaun ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) kaise namaz parhte thay, unhon ne kaha: Jab woh doosre sajde se apna sar uthate to baithete aur zameen par sahara lete, phir khare hote."
"216","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Shaqiq se, unhon ne Abdullah Raziallahu anhu se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke peeche namaz parhte to kehte: Salam ho Jibril par, salam ho Mika'il par, salam ho Israfil par, salam ho falan aur falan par, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamari taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Beshak Allah hi al-Salam hai, phir jab tum namaz me baitho to kaho: Al-tahiyyatu lillahi wa al-salawatu wa al-tayyibat, salam ho aap par aye Nabi aur Allah ki rehmat aur Us ki barkatein, salam ho hum par aur Allah ke nek bandon par, kyunke jab tum ye kahoge to aasman aur zameen me har nek bande ko pahunchta hai: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Us ke bande aur Us ke Rasool hain, phir jo chahe ikhtiyar kare."
"217","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se Shu'bah se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Hakam ne mujh se Ibn Abi Layla se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Ka'b ibn Ujrah mile to unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhein ek tohfa na dun, ya kya main tumhein ek baat na bataun? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamare paas bahar tashreef laye to hum ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hum ne aap par salam ko pehchan liya hai ya hum ne jaan liya hai to namaz (durood) kaise hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah, Muhammad par aur Muhammad ki aal par rehmat bhej jaisi Tune Ibrahim ki aal par rehmat bheji, beshak Tu hamd wala, buzurg wala hai, aur Muhammad par aur Muhammad ki aal par barkat nazil farma jaisi Tune Ibrahim ki aal par barkat nazil farmai, beshak Tu hamd wala, buzurg wala hai."
"218","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa - ya'ni Ibn Yunus - ne hum se Al-Awza'i se bayan kiya, Hassan ibn Atiyyah se, Muhammad ibn Abi A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi tashahhud parhe to chaar cheezon se panah mange: Jahannam ke azab se, aur qabr ke azab se, aur zindagi aur maut ki fitne se, aur Masih Dajjal ke shar se, phir apne liye jo chahe dua kare."
"219","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman - ya'ni Ibn Mahdi - ne hum se Zaidah ibn Qudamah se bayan kiya, Asim ibn Kulayb se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere walid ne khabar di ke Wa'il ibn Hujr ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main zaroor dekhunga ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) kaise namaz parhte hain? Unhon ne kaha: To main ne Aap ko dekha, Aap khare hue to takbeer kahi aur apne dono haathon ko uthaya yahan tak ke dono kaanon ke barabar ho gaye, phir apni dayen hatheli ko apni bayen hatheli ki pusht aur kalai aur sa'id par rakha, phir ruku kiya to apne dono haathon ko usi tarah uthaya, phir sajda kiya to apni dono hatheliyon ko apne kaanon ke barabar rakha, phir baithe to apni bayen taang ko bichhaya aur apni bayen hatheli ko apni bayen raan aur bayen ghutne par rakha, aur apni dayen kohni ke kinare ko apni dayen raan par rakha, phir apni ungliyon mein se do ko band kiya aur halqa banaya, phir apni ungli ko uthaya to main ne Aap ko dekha ke Aap use dua karte hue harkat de rahe the, phir main us ke baad sard mausam ke zamane mein aaya to main ne logon ko dekha ke un par kapron ki zyadti thi aur wo apne haathon ko kapron ke neeche se harkat de rahe the."
"220","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman - ya'ni Ibn Mahdi - ne mujhe Sufyan se khabar di, Abu Ishaq se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) apne dayen taraf salam pherte the: As-salamu alaikum wa rahmatullah, aur apne bayen taraf: As-salamu alaikum wa rahmatullah, yahan tak ke yahan se Aap ke rukhsar ki safedi dikhai deti aur yahan se Aap ke rukhsar ki safedi dikhai deti."
"221","(39) Namaz mein jaiz aur na-jaiz af'aal ka bab. Ibn al-Muqri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Az-Zuhri se bayan kiya, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tasbeeh kehna mardon ke liye hai aur taali bajana aurton ke liye hai."
"222","Ibn al-Muqri' aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Abu Hazim se bayan kiya, unhon ne Sahl ibn Sa'd as-Sa'idi Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhein kya hua ke jab tumhein tumhari namaz mein koi cheez pesh aayi to tum ne taali bajayi, ye to sirf aurton ke liye hai, jise us ki namaz mein koi cheez pesh aaye to use chahiye ke kahe: SubhanAllah."
"223","Muhammad ibn Sa'id Abu Yahya al-Attar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Ibrahim ibn Ulayyah ne hum se bayan kiya (ha). Aur Ali ibn Khashram ne humein khabar di ke Ismail ibn Ulayyah ne unhein Al-Hajjaj ibn Abi Uthman se khabar di, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Hilal ibn Abi Maymunah se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Mu'awiyah ibn al-Hakam as-Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: Jabke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath namaz parh rahe the ke qaum mein se ek aadmi ko chheenk aayi to main ne kaha: Yarhamukallah, to qaum ne mujhe ghoor kar dekha to main ne kaha: Meri maa mujhe gum paye, tumhein kya hai ke tum meri taraf dekhte ho, to wo apne haathon ko apni raanon par maarne lage, phir jab main ne dekha ke wo mujhe khamosh kara rahe hain to main khamosh ho gaya, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne namaz poori ki - mere maa baap Aap par qurban - Allah ki qasam, main ne Aap se pehle aur Aap ke baad Aap se behtar taleem dene wala koi mu'allim nahi dekha, Allah ki qasam, na Aap ne mujhe jhirka, na mujhe bura kaha, na mujhe maara, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ye namaz hai, logon ki is guftagu mein se koi cheez is mein durust nahi, ye to sirf tasbeeh aur takbeer aur Quran ki qiraat hai, ya jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main jahiliyyat se naya nikla hun, aur Allah Islam le aaya hai, aur hum mein se kuch log kahinon ke paas jaate hain, Aap ne farmaya: Un ke paas na jao, main ne kaha: Aur hum mein se kuch log badfaali lete hain, to Aap ne farmaya: Wo ek cheez hai jo wo apne seenon mein paate hain, to wo unhein na roke, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Aur hum mein se kuch log lakiren kheenchhte hain, Aap ne farmaya: Ek nabi lakiren kheenchta tha, to jo us ki lakeer ke muwafiq ho to bas wahi hai, unhon ne kaha: Aur meri ek laundi thi jo Uhud aur al-Jawwaniyyah ki taraf meri bakriyan charati thi, to ek din main ne use dekha ke bhediya us ki bakriyon mein se ek bakri le gaya hai, aur main ek aadmi hun jo afsos karta hai jaise wo afsos karte hain, lekin main ne use ek thappar maar diya, phir main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se us ka zikr kiya to Aap ne us ko mujh par bahut bara samjha, main ne kaha: Kya main use aazad na kar dun, Aap ne farmaya: Use mere paas lao, to main use Aap ke paas laya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah kahan hai? Us ne kaha: Aasmaan mein, Aap ne farmaya: Main kaun hun? Us ne kaha: Aap Rasulullah hain, Aap ne farmaya: Wo mominah hai to use aazad kar do."
"224","Ibn al-Muqri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Ma'mar se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Damdam ibn Jaws se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne namaz mein do kaalon ko qatl karne ka hukm diya."
"225","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se Ibn Ajlan se bayan kiya, Al-Maqburi se, Amr ibn Sulaym se, Abu Qatadah Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne namaz parhi jabke Umamah bint Abi al-As Aap ki gardan par thin, to jab Aap ruku karte to unhein utar dete aur jab khare hote to unhein utha lete."
"226","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Awn ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nafi' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Quba ki taraf wahan namaz parhne ke liye bahar tashreef le gaye, unhon ne kaha: Phir Ansar aaye aur Aap ko salam kiya jabke Aap namaz parh rahe the, unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ae Bilal, tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko kis tarah dekha ke Aap unhein jawab de rahe the jab wo Aap ko salam kar rahe the aur Aap namaz parh rahe the? Unhon ne kaha: Aap is tarah kehte, aur unhon ne apni hatheli phaila di."
"227","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se Shu'ayb ibn al-Layth se bayan kiya, Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj se, Nabil Sahib al-Aba' se, Abdullah ibn Umar se, Suhayb Sahib Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas se guzra jabke Aap namaz parh rahe the to main ne salam kiya to Aap ne mujhe ishare se jawab diya, unhon ne kaha: Main nahi janta magar ye ke unhon ne kaha: Apni ungli se ishare se. Aur Ibn Uyaynah ne kaha: Zayd ibn Aslam se, Ibn Umar se, Suhayb Raziallahu anhum se."
"228","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne humein khabar di ke Shu'ayb ibn al-Layth ne unhein khabar di, Al-Layth se, Abu az-Zubayr se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) beemar hue to hum ne Aap ke peeche namaz parhi jabke Aap baithe hue the, phir Aap ne hamari taraf tawajjoh farmai to humein khara dekha to Aap ne hamari taraf ishara kiya to hum baith gaye."
"229","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Sa'id - ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Yahya ibn Abi Kathir ne hadees bayan ki, Abu Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Mu'ayqib ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se masjid me masah ke baare me poochha gaya, Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum karne wale ho to ek baar karo."
"230","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abu Dharr Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi namaz ke liye khada ho to kankariyon ka masah na kare, kyunki rehmat us ke saamne hoti hai."
"231","Ahmad ibn Sa'id al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Bukayr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne Ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne namaz me ikhtisar se mana farmaya. Dar al-Kutub al-Ilmiyyah ki taba'at me isi tarah hai, aur shayad durust (Abdullah ibn Bakr) hai."
"232","Hasan ibn Bishr ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Suhayl ibn Abi Salih se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Sa'id al-Khudri se, apne walid Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi namaz me jamahi le to jahan tak ho sake use roke, phir agar us par ghalba ho jaye to apna haath apne munh par rakhe."
"233","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Fadl - yani Ibn Musa - ne Hisham ibn Urwah se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, A'ishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum me se kisi ko namaz me hadas lahiq ho jaye to wapas chala jaye aur apni naak pakad le."
"234","Bahr ibn Nasr ne Ibn Wahb se, unhon ne Amr ibn al-Harith aur Yunus ibn Yazid aur Ibn Sam'an se bayan kiya ke Ibn Shihab ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu ne hadees bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab raat ka khana qareeb la diya jaye aur namaz aa jaye to Maghrib ki namaz padhne se pehle us se ibtida karo."
"235","(40) Musafir ki namaz ke baare me jo warid hai: Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Uqbah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne Yahya ibn Abi Ishaq se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath Hajj ke liye nikla, to Aap do do rak'at namaz padhte rahe yahan tak ke Madinah wapas tashreef laye. Unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Tum Makkah me kitne din thehre? Unhon ne kaha: Das din."
"236","Ibn al-Muqri' aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf se bayan kiya, unhon ne Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz ko apne hum-nashinon se poochhte hue suna: Tum ne Makkah me qiyam ke baare me kya suna hai? al-Sa'ib ibn Yazid ne kaha: mujhe al-Ala' ibn al-Hadrami ne khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Makkah me muhajir ka qiyam apne nusuk ada karne ke baad teen din hai."
"237","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne al-Zuhri se bayan kiya, Salim se, apne walid Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se: ke jab safar me tezi ikhtiyar karna hota to Aap Maghrib aur Isha ko jama kar lete the."
"238","al-Rabi' ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Bakr ne al-Awza'i se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Yahya ibn Abi Kathir ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Thawban ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hum se Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) apni sawari ki peeth par nafl namaz padhte the jidhar bhi woh Aap ko le jati, phir jab farz namaz padhne ka irada karte to utar jate aur qibla ki taraf rukh karte."
"239","Muhammad ibn Ismail ibn Salim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: mujhe Abu al-Zubayr ne khabar di ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap apni sawari par har simt me nawafil padh rahe the, lekin do sajdon ko ruku' se past rakhte the, ishare se ishara karte hue."
"240","(41) Baith kar namaz padhne ke baare me jo warid hai: Ibn al-Muqri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne al-Zuhri se bayan kiya, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ghode se gir pade to Aap ka dahina pehlu chhil gaya, to hum Aap ki iyadat ke liye Aap ke paas dakhil hue, phir namaz ka waqt aaya to Aap ne baith kar namaz padhi, to hum ne baith kar namaz padhi, phir jab Aap ne apni namaz poori ki to farmaya: Imam to is liye muqarrar kiya gaya hai ke us ki iqtida ki jaye, pas jab woh takbir kahe to takbir kaho, aur jab woh ruku' kare to ruku' karo, aur jab woh uthe to utho, aur jab woh kahe: Sami' Allahu liman hamidah - to kaho: Rabbana wa lakal hamd, aur jab woh baith kar namaz padhe to tum sab baith kar namaz padho."
"241","Muhammad ibn Sa'id al-Attar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq al-Azraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husayn al-Mukattib ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Buraydah se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se baith kar namaz parhne ke bare mein sawal kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Jo khare ho kar namaz parhe to woh afzal hai, aur jo baith kar namaz parhe to us ke liye khare ho kar parhne wale ke ajr ka aadha hai, aur jo lete hue namaz parhe to us ke liye baith kar parhne wale ke ajr ka aadha hai."
"242","Aur isi tarah Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se yeh (hadees) bayan ki, Yazid ibn Harun se, Husayn se."
"243","Hasan ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Tahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Husayn al-Muallim se, Abdullah ibn Buraydah se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe nasoor tha to main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se namaz ke bare mein sawal kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Khare ho kar namaz parho, phir agar taqat na rakho to baith kar, phir agar taqat na rakho to pehlu par (let kar)."
"244","(42) Salat-ul-khawf ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Mujahid se, Abu Ayyash al-Zuraqi Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Usfan mein the, unhon ne kaha: Mushrikon ne hamara samna kiya, aur un par Khalid ibn al-Walid tha, aur woh hamare aur qiblah ke darmiyan the, unhon ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hamein Zuhr ki namaz parhayi to unhon ne kaha: Woh aisi halat mein the ke agar hum un ki ghaflat mein un par hamla kar dete, phir unhon ne kaha: Ab un par ek aisi namaz aa rahi hai jo unhein un ke beton aur un ki janon se zyada mehboob hai, unhon ne kaha: To Jibril is ayat ke sath Zuhr aur Asr ke darmiyan nazil hue: Aur jab tum un mein ho aur un ke liye namaz qaim karo, unhon ne kaha: To namaz ka waqt aaya to Aap ne unhein hukm diya - Ibn Yahya ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne - aur un dono ne kaha: To unhon ne hathyar utha liye, to hum Aap ke peeche do safon mein khare hue, unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne ruku kiya to hum sab ne ruku kiya, phir Aap ne sar uthaya to hum sab ne sar uthaya, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apne sath wali saf ke sath sajda kiya, aur dusre khare un ki hifazat kar rahe the, phir jab unhon ne sajda kar liya aur khare hue to dusre baith gaye aur unhon ne apni jagah sajda kiya, phir yeh log in logon ke morchon ki taraf aage barhe, aur yeh log in logon ke morchon ki taraf aaye, unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne ruku kiya to sab ne ruku kiya, phir Aap ne sar uthaya to sab ne sar uthaya, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne aur Aap ke sath wali saf ne sajda kiya, aur dusre khare un ki hifazat kar rahe the, unhon ne kaha: Phir jab woh baith gaye to dusre baith gaye aur unhon ne sajda kiya, phir Aap ne unhein salam phera, phir Aap wapas tashreef le gaye, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ise do martaba parha: Ek martaba Usfan mein, aur ek martaba Banu Sulaym ki zameen mein, aur isi tarah Ata aur Abu al-Zubayr ne Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat ki."
"245","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne mujhe khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek giroh ke sath namaz-e-khawf ki ek rakat parhi, aur dusra giroh dushman ke samne tha, phir woh wapas hue aur apne sathiyon ki jagah dushman ki taraf rukh kar ke khare hue, aur woh dusre aaye to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ke sath ek rakat parhi, phir Nabi ne salam phera, phir in logon ne ek rakat qaza ki, aur un logon ne ek rakat."
"246","Abu Abdullah Hammad ibn al-Hasan ibn Anbasah al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rawh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se (riwayat hai) ke Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se jab namaz-e-khawf ke bare mein sawal kiya jata to woh kehte: Imam aur logon ka ek giroh aage barhe, to Imam un ke sath ek rakat parhe, aur un mein se ek giroh us ke aur dushman ke darmiyan ho jinhon ne namaz na parhi ho, phir jab jo us ke sath hain ek rakat parh lein to woh un logon ki jagah peeche hat jayen jinhon ne namaz nahin parhi, aur salam na pherein aur jo logon ne namaz nahin parhi woh aage barhen aur us ke sath ek rakat parhein phir Imam wapas jaye aur us ne do rakatein parhi hon, phir dono girohon mein se har ek khara ho aur Imam ke wapas jane ke baad apne liye ek rakat parhe, to dono girohon mein se har ek ne do rakatein parhi hon, aur agar khawf is se zyada sakht ho to woh paidal khare apne qadmon par, ya sawar ho kar qiblah ki taraf rukh kar ke aur baghair qiblah ki taraf rukh kiye namaz parhein, Malik ne kaha: Nafi ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar ke bare mein nahin samajhta magar ke unhon ne ise Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se hi bayan kiya."
"247","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb se, Malik se, Yazid ibn Ruman se, Salih ibn Khawwat se, us shakhs se jis ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Dhat al-Riqa ke din namaz-e-khawf parhi ke ek giroh Aap ke sath saf-basta hua, aur ek giroh dushman ke samne saf-basta hua to Aap ne jo Aap ke sath the un ke sath ek rakat parhi, phir Aap khare rahe aur unhon ne apne liye (namaz) mukammal ki, phir woh wapas hue aur dushman ke samne saf-basta hue, aur dusra giroh aaya to Aap ne un ke sath Apni namaz ki bachi hui rakat parhi, phir Aap baithe rahe yahan tak ke unhon ne apne liye (namaz) mukammal ki, phir Aap ne salam phera."
"248","Muhammad ibn Ismail ibn Salim ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rawh ibn Ubadah ne kaha: Shubah aur Malik ibn Anas ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Said se, al-Qasim ibn Muhammad se, Salih ibn Khawwat se, Sahl ibn Abi Hathmah se ke unhon ne namaz-e-khawf ke bare mein kaha: Ek giroh Imam ke samne khara ho, aur ek giroh us ke peeche to woh jo us ke peeche hain un ke sath ek rakat aur do sajde parhe, phir woh apni jagah baitha rahe yahan tak ke woh ek rakat aur do sajde qaza karein, phir woh apne sathiyon ke maqam ki taraf muntaqil ho jayen, phir un ke sathi in logon ki jagah ki taraf muntaqil ho jayen to woh un ke sath ek rakat aur do sajde parhe, phir woh apni jagah baitha rahe yahan tak ke woh ek rakat aur do sajde parhein, phir woh salam phere."
"249","Muhammad ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rawh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim se, un ke walid se, Salih ibn Khawwat se, Sahl ibn Abi Hathmah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se isi ki manind."
"250","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: Yala ne mujhe khabar di, Said ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: Agar tumhein barish se takleef ho ya tum beemar ho - Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf Raziallahu anhu zakhmi the."
"251","(43) Namaz se so jane wale aur faut shuda namazon ki qaza ka bab: Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, Said se, Qatadah se, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo namaz se so jaye ya use bhool jaye to us ka kaffara yeh hai ke jab use yaad aaye use parh le."
"252","Harun ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Fudayl ne hum se bayan kiya, Bashir Abu Ismail se, Abu Hazim se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath (raat mein) parhao kiya, to hum bedar na hue yahan tak ke dhoop ne hamein takleef di, to Nabiullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Har shakhs apni sawari ke sar ko pakre, phir is manzil se ek taraf ho jaye, phir Aap ne pani mangwaya aur wuzu kiya, phir do sajde kiye, phir namaz qaim ki gayi to Aap ne namaz parhi."
"253","(44) Sahw ka bab - Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Majishun Abdul Aziz ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Salamah ne mujhe bataya, unhon ne kaha: Zayd ibn Aslam ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein teen aur chaar ke bare mein shak kare to use chahiye ke khara ho aur ek rak'at padhe, hatta ke shak zyadati mein ho jaye, phir salam pherne se pehle sahw ke do sajde kare, phir agar us ne paanch padhi to wo us ke liye sifarish karenge, aur agar chaar padhi to wo shaitan ko ruswa karenge."
"254","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi aur Ahmad ibn Sa'id al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne mujhe bataya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman al-A'raj ne mujhe bataya ke unhon ne Ibn Buhaynah ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein namaz padhai to do rak'aton mein khare ho gaye, to hum ne un ke liye tasbeeh ki to wo apni namaz mein aage badhte rahe, phir do sajde kiye, phir salam phera. Yeh hadees al-Darimi ki hai."
"255","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ibn Abi Imran al-Hilali ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein dopahar ki do namazon mein se ek namaz padhai, ya Zuhar ya Asr, mera khayal hai ke wo Asr thi, to Aap ne do rak'atein padhein phir salam phera, phir aage badhe aur khajoor ke tane ke paas naraaz ki tarah baith gaye, to jaldi karne wale log chale gaye aur wo keh rahe the: Namaz kam ho gayi, namaz kam ho gayi! To Zu al-Yadain aage badhe aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya namaz kam ho gayi? Ya Aap bhool gaye? To Aap ne farmaya: Kya Zu al-Yadain sach keh raha hai? Logon ne kaha: Ji haan, unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne do rak'atein padhein phir salam phera, aur takbeer kahi aur sajda kiya, phir takbeer kahi aur sar uthaya, phir takbeer kahi aur sajda kiya, phir takbeer kahi aur sar uthaya."
"256","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ibn Qudamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, Alqamah se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein namaz padhai to namaz mein zyadati ki ya kami ki, Mansur ne kaha: Ibrahim ne kaha: Ise bhoolne wale Alqamah hain, ya Alqamah ne Abdullah se (riwayat kiya), phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) namaz se farigh hue to apne chehre ke sath hamari taraf mutawajjeh hue, to hum ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya namaz mein koi nayi baat ho gayi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Wo kya hai? To hum ne Aap ko us kaam ki khabar di jo Aap ne kiya tha, to Aap ne apni tang modi aur qibla ki taraf rukh kiya aur do sajde kiye, phir hamari taraf wapas aaye aur farmaya: Agar namaz mein koi nayi baat hoti to main tumhein zaroor batata, lekin main bashar hun, yaad karta hun jaise tum yaad karte ho, aur bhoolta hun jaise tum bhoolte ho, pas jab main bhool jaun to mujhe yaad dilao, aur tum mein se jo apni namaz mein shak kare to use chahiye ke durust baat se zyada qareeb ko dekhe aur us par poora kare, phir salam phere aur do sajde kare."
"257","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Mu'tamir ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Asr ki namaz teen rak'at padh kar salam pher diya, to Aap se kaha gaya, to Aap ne ek rak'at padhi, phir salam phera, phir do sajde kiye, phir salam phera."
"258","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Idris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hasan ibn Ubaydullah se suna, Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Alqamah ne unhein paanch rak'atein padhayin, unhon ne kaha: To logon ne kaha: Ae Abu Shibl, Aap ne namaz mein zyadati ki, unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne kaha: Main ne aisa nahin kiya, unhon ne kaha: Logon ne kaha: Kyun nahin, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ne kaha: To main ne masjid ke kinare se kaha: Kyun nahin, unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne kaha: Aur tum ae kana, kya tum bhi yehi kehte ho? Un hon ne kaha: To wo phire aur un ke sath do sajde kiye, phir un se Abdullah se hadees bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein paanch rak'atein padhayin, unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne un ke sath baithe hue do sajde kiye aur farmaya: Main sirf ek bashar hun, bhoolta hun jaise tum bhoolte ho. Yeh Ibrahim, Ibn Suwayd al-Nakhai hain, aur Ibrahim ibn Yazid al-Nakhai nahin hain."
"259","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn al-Muthanna al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ash'ath ne mujhe bataya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Khalid al-Hazza se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein namaz padhai to apni namaz mein bhool gaye, to sahw ke do sajde kiye, phir tashahhud padha, phir salam phera."
"260","(45) Kusuf ke bare mein jo warid hua - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mutarrif ne hum se bayan kiya, aur main ne ise Ibn Nafi' par Malik se padha, Malik se, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abdullah ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein suraj ko grahan laga, to Rasulullah ne aur Aap ke sath logon ne namaz padhi, to Aap ne taweel qiyam kiya taqreeban Surah al-Baqarah ke barabar, phir taweel ruku kiya, phir sar uthaya aur taweel qiyam kiya, jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir taweel ruku kiya, jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sajda kiya, Ibn Yahya ne kaha: Shayad un dono ne kaha: Phir sar uthaya, ya un dono ne ye nahin kaha, to Aap ne taweel qiyam kiya, jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir taweel ruku kiya, jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sar uthaya aur taweel qiyam kiya, jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir taweel ruku kiya, jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sajda kiya, phir farigh hue aur suraj saaf ho chuka tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, unhein kisi ki maut ya us ki zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta, pas jab tum ye dekho to Allah ko yaad karo, logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hum ne Aap ko dekha ke Aap ne apne is maqam mein kisi cheez ko lene ke liye haath badhaya, phir hum ne Aap ko dekha ke Aap peeche hate, to Aap ne farmaya: Main ne Jannat dekhi, ya mujhe Jannat dikhai gayi, to main ne us mein se angoor ka khosha lene ke liye haath badhaya, aur agar main use le leta to tum duniya ke baqi rehne tak us mein se khate rehte, aur main ne Jahannam dekhi, to main ne aaj jaisa manzar kabhi nahin dekha, aur main ne dekha ke us ke aksar rehne wale aurtein hain, logon ne kaha: Kis wajah se Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Un ke kufr ki wajah se, kaha gaya: Kya wo Allah ka kufr karti hain, Aap ne farmaya: Wo shoher ki nashukri karti hain aur ehsan ki nashukri karti hain, agar tum un mein se ek ke sath poori zindagi ehsan karte raho, phir wo tum se koi cheez dekhe to kehti hai: Main ne tum se kabhi koi bhalai nahin dekhi."
"261","Rabi' ibn Sulayman ne mujhe bataya ke al-Shafi'i ne unhein bataya, unhon ne kaha: Aur main Malik se is hadees ke sath hun, aur unhon ne us maqam par jahan Muhammad ibn Yahya shak mein pade: Phir sar uthaya, nahin kaha."
"262","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb se, Yunus ibn Yazid se, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne mujhe bataya, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki zauja Aishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki zindagi mein suraj ko grahan laga, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) masjid ki taraf nikle aur khare hue aur takbeer kahi, aur log Aap ke peeche safon mein khare hue, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne taweel qira'at ki, phir takbeer kahi aur taweel ruku kiya, phir apna sar uthaya aur kaha: Sami' Allahu liman hamidah, Rabbana wa lakal hamd, phir khare hue aur taweel qira'at ki jo pehli qira'at se kam thi, phir takbeer kahi aur taweel ruku kiya, jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir kaha: Sami' Allahu liman hamidah, Rabbana wa lakal hamd, phir doosri rak'at mein bhi isi tarah kiya aur chaar ruku aur chaar sajde poore kiye, aur Aap ke farigh hone se pehle suraj saaf ho gaya, phir Aap khare hue aur logon ko khutba diya aur Allah ki aisi sana ki jis ka Wo ahl hai, phir farmaya: Beshak suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, unhein kisi ki maut ya us ki zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta, pas jab tum unhein dekho to ghabra kar namaz ki taraf aao."
"263","Harun ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwah se, apne walid se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein suraj ko grahan laga, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khare hue aur namaz padhi aur qiyam ko bahut lamba kiya, phir ruku kiya aur ruku ko bahut lamba kiya, phir sar uthaya aur qiyam ko lamba kiya, jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir ruku kiya, jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sajda kiya, phir khare hue aur qiyam ko lamba kiya, jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir ruku kiya, jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir apna sar uthaya aur khare hue, jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir ruku kiya, jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sajda kiya aur apni namaz se farigh hue aur suraj se grahan khatm ho chuka tha, phir Aap khare hue aur logon ko khutba diya, Allah ki hamd ki aur Us ki sana ki, phir farmaya: Beshak suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, unhein kisi ki maut ya us ki zindagi ki wajah se grahan nahin lagta, pas jab tum ye dekho to namaz padho aur sadqa do aur Allah ko yaad karo, phir farmaya: Ae Muhammad ki ummat, Allah ki qasam, Allah se zyada ghairat wala koi nahin ke Us ka banda zina kare ya Us ki bandi zina kare, ae Muhammad ki ummat, agar tum jante jo main janta hun to bahut rote aur kam hanste."
"264","Muhammad ibn al-Husayn ibn Tarkhan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Huzayfah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwah se, Fatimah bint al-Mundhir se, Asma bint Abi Bakr Raziallahu anha se: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne suraj grahan mein gardanein azad karne ka hukm diya."
"265","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne Utham ibn Ali se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Fatimah se, Asma se, unhon ne kaha: Hamein suraj grahan mein gardan azad karne ka hukm diya jata tha."
"266","(46) Namaz-e-Istisqa ke bare mein jo aya hai: Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Amr al-Ghazzi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Firyabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Kinanah se, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) istisqa ke liye nikle to tumhare in khutbon jaisa khutba nahin diya, ajizi karte hue aur mamuli libas mein nikle, pas do rakat namaz padhi jaisay Eid ki namaz padhte hain."
"267","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr se, Abbad ibn Tamim se, apne chacha se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Eidgah ki taraf nikle pas barish talab ki, pas qibla ki taraf rukh kiya, aur apni chadar ko palat diya, aur do rakat namaz padhi."
"268","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, al-Zuhri se, Abbad ibn Tamim se, apne chacha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) logon ko lekar barish talab karne ke liye nikle, pas unhein do rakat namaz padhai, aur qirat buland awaz se ki, aur apni chadar ko palat diya, aur apne dono hath uthaye, aur dua ki, aur barish mangi, aur qibla ki taraf rukh kiya."
"269","Abbas ibn al-Walid ibn Mazyad ne hum se bayan kiya ke unke walid ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine al-Awza'i ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talhah al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein logon ko qahat pesh aya, pas jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) juma ke din mimbar par logon ko khutba de rahe the ke ek dehati khada hua pas us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, maal halak ho gaya aur biwi bachche bhooke reh gaye pas hamare liye Allah se dua kijiye, unhon ne kaha: pas Aap ne apne dono hath uthaye, aur asman mein badal ka koi tukda na tha, pas us Zaat ki qasam jiske hath mein meri jaan hai Aap ne unhein neeche nahin kiya tha ke pahadon jaisay badal umad aye, phir Aap mimbar se neeche na utre hatta ke maine barish ko Aap ki dadhi par tapakte dekha, pas usi din ham par barish hui, aur agle din, aur us se agle din, aur uske baad wale din hatta ke agle juma tak, pas wohi dehati khada hua - ya unhon ne kaha: uske siwa koi aur shakhs - pas us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, imaratein girne lagin pas hamare liye Allah se dua kijiye, pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apne dono hath uthaye pas farmaya: Allahumma hamare ird gird barsa aur hum par na barsa, unhon ne kaha: Aap apne hath se masjid ke kisi kinare ki taraf ishara na karte magar wahan badal phat jata hatta ke wo khule maidan jaisi ho gayi, aur wadi - wadi-e-Qanat - ek mahine tak behti rahi, aur kisi taraf se koi shakhs na aya magar us ne kasrat-e-barish ki khabar di."
"270","(47) Eidain ke bare mein jo aya hai: Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ibn Yunus ne mujhe khabar di, Hisham se, Hafsah se, Umm Atiyyah al-Ansariyyah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hukm diya ke hum unhein Eid-ul-Fitr aur Eid-un-Nahr ke din nikalein: kunwari jawan ladkiyon, haiza aurton aur parda-nasheen khawateen ko, pas rahi haiza aurtein to wo namaz ki jagah se alag rahein, aur bhalai aur Musalmanon ki dua mein hazir hon, maine kaha: Ya Rasulullah, un mein se kisi ke paas jilbab na ho? Aap ne farmaya: uski behan use apne jilbab mein se pehnaye."
"271","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman - yani Ibn Mahdi - ne mujhe khabar di, Sufyan se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abis se, unhon ne kaha: maine Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte suna: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Fitr ya Azha ke din nikla, pas Aap ne namaz padhai phir khutba diya, phir aurton ke paas aye pas unhein naseehat ki aur unhein yaad-dihani karai, aur unhein sadqa ka hukm diya."
"272","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne mujhe khabar di, Abd al-Malik se, Ata se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Fitr ya Azha ki Eid ke din namaz padhi, pas Aap ne khutbe se pehle namaz se ibteda ki, baghair azan aur baghair iqamat ke."
"273","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke liye harba gaad diya jata tha, Aap Eid ke din uski taraf rukh karke namaz padhte the."
"274","Aur Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hamein ye hadees ek aur martaba bayan ki, aur unhon ne Eid ke din ka zikr nahin kiya."
"275","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, Adi - yani Ibn Thabit - se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Eid-ul-Fitr ke din nikle pas do rakat namaz padhi, un se pehle na padhi aur na unke baad."
"276","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah - yani Ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Ya'la al-Ta'ifi - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Amr ibn Shu'ayb ko suna, apne walid se, apne dada se Raziallahu anhu, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Eid mein Eid-ul-Fitr ke din pehli rakat mein saat takbeerein kahin, aur akhri mein paanch, namaz ki takbeer ke siwa."
"277","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne mujhe bataya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ibn Muslim ne mujhe khabar di, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Eid-ul-Fitr ki namaz Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath aur Abu Bakr aur Umar aur Usman Raziallahu anhum ke saath hazir hokar parhi, to wo sab usay khutbe se pehle parhte the, phir us ke baad khutba dete the, unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabiullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) utre goya main unhen dekh raha hun jab unhon ne apne haath se mardon ko bithaya, phir unhen cheerte hue aage badhe yahan tak ke aurton ke paas aaye, un ke saath Bilal the, to unhon ne farmaya: Aye Nabi! jab aap ke paas momin aurtein aap se is par bai'at karne aayen ke wo Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek na karengi, to unhon ne is ayat ki tilawat ki yahan tak ke us se farigh hue, phir jab us se farigh hue to farmaya: Kya tum is par ho! To ek aurat boli aur us ke siwa un me se kisi ne jawab na diya: Ji haan Aye Nabiullah - Hasan nahi jante wo kaun thin - unhon ne kaha: To sadqa karo, unhon ne kaha: To Bilal ne apna kapra phailaya, phir kaha: Lao, tumhare liye, tum par mere baap aur meri maa fida hon, to wo Bilal ke kapre me bichhwe aur angoothiyan dalne lagin."
"278","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fadl - yani Ibn Musa - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne mujhe bataya, Ata se, Abdullah ibn al-Sa'ib se, unhon ne kaha: Main Eid ke din Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas hazir tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Tum namaz ada kar chuke ho, pas tum me se jo chahe khutbe ke liye baith jaye, aur jo chahe jana chahe to chala jaye."
"279","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Muhammad ibn al-Muntashir se, un ke walid se, Habib ibn Salim se, Nu'man ibn Bashir Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Eid me Sabbihisma Rabbikal A'la aur Hal Ataka Hadeesul Ghashiyah parhte the, phir jab Eid aur Jumuah ikatthe hote to dono me inhi dono se qiraat karte the."
"280","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bishr ne mujhe bataya, Abu Umayr ibn Anas se, mere chachaon ne jo Ansar me se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sahaba me se the mujhe bataya, unhon ne kaha: Hum par Shawwal ka chand ghum ho gaya to hum ne subah roze se ki, phir din ke aakhir me sawar aaye to unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas gawahi di ke unhon ne kal chand dekha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hukm diya ke wo apne is din me iftar karen aur agle din apni Eid ke liye niklen."
"281","(48) Witr ka bab: Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Raat ki namaz do do rak'at hai, pas jab tum subah ka khauf karo to ek rak'at ke saath witr parh lo. Mahmud ne izafa kiya: Jo guzar chuki usay tumhare liye taaq bana degi."
"282","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ya'fur se, Muslim ibn Subayh se, Masruq se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne raat ke har hisse me witr parha, pas Aap ka witr sehri tak khatam hota tha."
"283","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum me se jo dare ke wo raat ke aakhir me bedar na hoga to wo awwal hisse me witr parh kar so jaye, aur tum me se jo ummeed rakhe ke wo raat ke aakhir me bedar hoga to wo aakhir me witr parhe, kyunke aakhri raat ki namaz hazir ki jati hai, pas wahi afzal hai."
"284","(49) Sawari par namaz ka bab: Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Wahb se, unhon ne Yunus ibn Yazid se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim ibn Abdullah ibn Umar se, unhon ne apne walid Abdullah ibn Umar se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) sawari par jis taraf wo rukh karti nafl namaz ada karte the, aur us par witr bhi parhte the, siwaye is ke ke us par farz namaz nahi parhte the."
"285","Ibrahim ibn Abi Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah Abu Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Ubaydah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Talhah al-Yami se, Dharr se, Sa'id ibn Abdur Rahman ibn Abza se, un ke walid se, Ubayy ibn Ka'b Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) witr me Sabbihisma Rabbikal A'la aur Qul Ya Ayyuhal Kafirun aur Qul Huwallahu Ahad parhte the, phir jab salam pherte to kehte: Subhanal Malikil Quddus, Subhanal Malikil Quddus, teen martaba."
"286","(50) Witr ke qunut ka bab: Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ibn Abi Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Burayd ibn Abi Maryam se, Abu al-Hawra se, Hasan ibn Ali Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujhe chand kalimaat sikhaye jo main witr ke qunut me kahun: Aye Allah! mujhe un me hidayat de jinhen Tune hidayat di, aur mujhe un me aafiyat de jinhen Tune aafiyat di, aur mujhe un me apna dost bana le jinhen Tune dost banaya, aur jo Tune mujhe diya us me mere liye barkat de, aur mujhe us ke shar se bacha jiska Tune faisla kiya, pas beshak Tu faisla karta hai aur Tere khilaf faisla nahi kiya jata, aur beshak wo zaleel nahi hota jise Tu dost banaye, hamare Rab Tu barkat wala hai aur buland hai."
"287","Muhammad ibn Ali ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhayr ibn Mu'awiyah se, Abu Ishaq se, Burayd ibn Abi Maryam se, Abu al-Hawra se, Hasan ibn Ali Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen ye kalimaat sikhaye taake wo inhen witr ke qunut me kahen."
"288","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Musa ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nafi' ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma kehte the: Jo raat me namaz parhe wo apni namaz ke aakhir ko witr banaye, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne isi ka hukm diya hai, jab fajr aa jaye to raat ki namaz aur witr chali gayi, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Fajr se pehle witr parh lo."
"289","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: Nafi' ne mujhe khabar di ke Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma kaha karte thay: jo shakhs raat mein namaz parhe to use chahiye ke subah se pehle apni aakhri namaz witr banaye, isi tarah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) unhen hukm diya karte thay. Ibn Yahya ne kaha: Hajjaj in dono ko ek hi musalsal tartib se bayan karta tha."
"290","(51) Sunnat ki rakaton ka bab: Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ulayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Zuhr se pehle do rakaten parhin, aur us ke baad do rakaten, aur Maghrib ke baad do rakaten Aap ke ghar mein, aur Isha ke baad do rakaten Aap ke ghar mein. Unhon ne kaha: aur mujhe Hafsah ne bayan kiya - aur un ka waqt aisa tha ke us mein koi Aap ke pas dakhil nahin hota tha - ke Aap Fajr tulu hote waqt aur munadi ke namaz ke liye nida dete waqt do rakaten parhte thay - Ayyub ne kaha: mera khayal hai ke woh halki hoti thin - aur Jumuah ke baad do rakaten apne ghar mein."
"291","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim aur Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid ne hamen khabar di, Abdullah ibn Shaqiq se, unhon ne kaha: maine A'ishah Raziallahu anha se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki nafl namaz ke bare mein pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Aap mere ghar mein Zuhr se pehle char rakaten parhte thay, phir bahar nikalte aur logon ko namaz parhate, phir mere ghar wapas aate aur do rakaten parhte."
"292","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ya'la ibn Ata se, Ali ibn Abdullah al-Bariqi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: raat aur din ki namaz do do rakat hai."
"293","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: aur us mein se jo maine Ibn Nafi' par parha, aur Mutarrif ne mujh se bayan kiya, Malik se, Ibn Shihab se, Urwah ibn al-Zubayr se, A'ishah Raziallahu anha se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) raat mein gyarah rakaten parhte thay, un mein se ek ke sath witr karte thay, phir jab farigh hote to dayen pehlu par let jate yahan tak ke muazzin Aap ke pas aata to Aap do halki rakaten parhte."
"294","(52) Un auqat ka bab jin mein namaz se mana kiya gaya hai: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: tum mein se koi suraj ke tulu hone aur us ke ghurub hone ka qasd karke (us waqt namaz na) parhe, kyunke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) is se mana farmaya karte thay."
"295","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Samad ibn Abd al-Warith ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Hilal ibn Yasaf se, Wahb ibn al-Ajda' se, Ali Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Asr ke baad namaz parhne se mana farmaya, magar yeh ke suraj buland ho."
"296","(53) Jumuah ka bab: Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: beshak Jumuah mein ek ghari hai, jo shakhs usay namaz parhte hue pa le aur Allah se kisi bhalai ki dua kare to Allah use woh ata farmata hai."
"297","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: tum mein se jo Jumuah ke liye aaye to use ghusl karna chahiye."
"298","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Safwan ibn Sulaym se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se marfu'an riwayat hai: Jumuah ke din ghusl har baligh par wajib hai."
"299","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman - yani Ibn Mahdi - ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammam se, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah ibn Jundub Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jo shakhs Jumuah ke din wuzu kare to wohi kafi hai aur behtar hai, aur jo ghusl kare to ghusl afzal hai."
"300","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: masjid ke har darwaze par farishte hote hain jo logon ko pehle phir pehle likhte hain, phir jab imam baith jata hai to woh sahife lapet dete hain aur khutbah sunte hain, to jaldi aane wala us shakhs ki tarah hai jo oont ki qurbani de, phir jo us ke baad hai woh us ki tarah hai jo gaaye ki qurbani de, phir jo us ke baad hai woh us ki tarah hai jo mendhe ki qurbani de, yahan tak ke Aap ne murghi aur ande ka zikr farmaya."
"301","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Khalid ibn Mawhab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mufaddal ibn Fadalah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyash ibn Abbas se, Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, Hafsa Raziallahu anha se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Har muhtalim par Jumu'ah ke liye jaldi jana lazim hai, aur jo Jumu'ah ke liye jaye us par ghusl lazim hai."
"302","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Sa'id - ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydah ibn Sufyan ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Abu al-Ja'd Amr ibn Bakr al-Damri se, aur unhein suhbat hasil thi, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs susti ki wajah se teen Jumu'ah chhor de us ke dil par muhar laga di jati hai."
"303","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud se, Fulayh se, Uthman ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Taymi se, unhon ne Anas Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamein Jumu'ah ki namaz us waqt padhate jab suraj dhal jata tha."
"304","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir Abd al-Malik ibn Amr al-Aqadi ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhi'b se, al-Zuhri se, al-Sa'ib ibn Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar Raziallahu anhuma ke zamane mein Jumu'ah ke din azaan us waqt hoti thi jab imam nikalta aur jab namaz khadi hoti, yahan tak ke Uthman Raziallahu anhu ka daur aya to makanaat zyada ho gaye to unhon ne al-Zawra par teesri azaan ka hukm diya to woh ab tak qayam hai."
"305","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ibn al-Rabi' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Idris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, aur Muhammad ibn Abi Umamah ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke un ke walid ne unhein bataya ke Abd al-Rahman ibn Ka'b ibn Malik ne kaha: Main apne walid ka un ki beenai jane ke baad rahnuma tha, woh Jumu'ah ke din azaan nahin sunte magar kehte: Abu Umamah par Allah ki rehmat ho, to main ne apne walid se kaha: Mujhe tumhara Jumu'ah ke din jab bhi azaan suno Abu Umamah ke liye dua karna acha lagta hai, unhon ne kaha: Aye mere bete! Woh pehle shakhs the jinhon ne hamein Madinah mein Jumu'ah jama ki, Hazm al-Nabit mein jo Harrah Bani Bayadah mein hai, ek bagh mein jise Naqi' al-Khadabat kaha jata hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne pucha: Us din tum kitne the? Unhon ne kaha: Chalis aadmi."
"306","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Fudayl ne hum se bayan kiya, Husayn se, Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Ek tijarati qafila aya jabke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Jumu'ah ki namaz padh rahe the, to log muntashir ho gaye, sirf barah aadmi reh gaye, to yeh ayat nazil hui: Aur jab unhon ne tijarat ya khel tamasha dekha to us ki taraf muntashir ho gaye."
"307","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Jabir Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Jumu'ah ke din dakhil hua jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khutba de rahe the, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne namaz padhi? Us ne kaha: Nahin, Aap ne farmaya: Khade ho kar do rak'atein padho."
"308","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne Mu'awiyah ibn Salih ko Abu al-Zahiriyyah se, Abdullah ibn Busr se hadees bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Main Jumu'ah ke din un ke pehlu mein baitha tha, to unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Jumu'ah ke din logon ki gardanein phalangta hua aya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khutba de rahe the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Baith jao, tum ne aza di aur der laga di, Abu al-Zahiriyyah ne kaha: Aur hum imam ke nikalne tak un se baatein karte rehte the."
"309","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, Ubaydullah se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Jumu'ah ke din do khutbe dete the, dono ke darmiyan baithte the."
"310","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Simak se, Jabir ibn Samurah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khade ho kar khutba dete the, phir baithte, phir khade hote aur aayatein padhte aur Allah ka zikr karte, aur Aap ka khutba darmiyana hota aur Aap ki namaz darmiyani hoti."
"311","Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Wahhab ibn Abd al-Majid al-Thaqafi ne hum se bayan kiya, Ja'far ibn Muhammad se, un ke walid se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab khutba dete to Aap ki aankhein surkh ho jatin aur Aap ki awaz buland ho jati aur Aap ka gussa sakht ho jata, yahan tak ke goya Aap kisi lashkar se darate hue farmate: Tum par subah aur sham hamla hoga! Aur farmate: Main aur Qayamat in dono ki tarah bhejha gaya hun, aur Aap apni shahadat aur darmiyani unglion ko milate, aur farmate: Amma ba'd, be shak behtareen kalam Allah ki kitab hai, aur behtareen hidayat Muhammad ki hidayat hai, aur badtareen kaam deen mein naye nikale hue kaam hain, aur har bid'at gumrahi hai, phir farmate: Main har momin ka us ki jaan se zyada haqdar hun, jo maal chhor jaye woh us ke ghar walon ke liye hai, aur jo qarz ya be sahara bachche chhor jaye to woh mere zimme hai aur mujh par hai."
"312","Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid ibn Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman - yani Ibn Bilal - ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Muhammad ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka Jumu'ah ke din ka khutba, Allah ki hamd aur sana karte, phir is ke baad buland awaz se kehte, phir unhon ne isi jaisa mazmun zikr kiya."
"313","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, woh isay Nabi tak pahunchate hue bayan karte hain: Jab tum Jumuah ke din kaho jab ke Imam khutba de raha ho: khamosh raho, to tum ne laghw kiya."
"314","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibrahim ibn Muhammad ibn al-Muntashir se, unhon ne kaha: main ne apne walid ko bayan karte hue suna, Habib ibn Salim se jo al-Nu'man ke maula hain, al-Nu'man ibn Bashir Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Jumuah mein Sabbihisma Rabbikal A'la aur Hal Ataka Hadeethul Ghashiyah parha karte thay."
"315","Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Wahhab al-Thaqafi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Muhammad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, apne walid se, Ubaidullah ibn Abi Rafi' se: ke Marwan ibn al-Hakam ne Abu Hurairah ko Madinah par khalifa banaya to Abu Hurairah ne unhen Jumuah parhaya, pehli rak'at mein unhen Surah al-Jumuah parh kar sunayi aur dusri mein Iza Ja'akal Munafiqun, Ubaidullah ne kaha: jab Abu Hurairah ne salam phera to main un ke pehlu mein chala aur main ne kaha: aap ne do surten parhi hain jinhen main ne Ali Raziallahu anhu ko Kufah mein parhte hue suna tha, to Abu Hurairah ne kaha: main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko in dono ko parhte hue suna hai."
"316","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Abd Rabbihi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Baqiyyah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se al-Mughirah al-Dabbi ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn Rufay' se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se ke Aap ne farmaya: tumhare is din mein do eiden jama ho gayi hain, pas tum mein se jo chahe use Jumuah se kifayat karegi, aur hum In Sha Allah jama karne wale hain."
"317","(54) Jama'at aur Imamat ka bab: Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Malik se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Zuhri ne bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se Aap ne farmaya: jama'at ki namaz ki fazilat aadmi ki tanha namaz par pachees darje hai."
"318","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: main ne irada kiya ke main kuch aadmiyon ko hukm dun pas woh namaz qaim karen, phir apne naujawanon ko hukm dun pas woh un logon ki taraf jayen jo us mein hazir nahin hote pas un par un ke ghar lakriyon ke gatthon se jala den, aur agar un mein se koi janta ke woh moti haddi ya do umdah khur payega to Isha mein zaroor hazir hota."
"319","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jab tum namaz ki taraf aao to us ke pas daudte hue na aao, aur us ke pas chalte hue aao, aur tum par sakinat lazim hai, pas jo tum pa lo use parh lo, aur jo reh jaye use pura karo."
"320","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ma'mar se, Zuhri se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jab namaz qaim ki jaye... is hi ki manind, aur unhon ne kaha: to pura karo. Aur Shu'aib, Uqayl, Ibn Abi Dhi'b aur ghairon ne is mein kaha: to pura karo."
"321","Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Ijli ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numayr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ubaidullah se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Muhajirin jab Makkah se Madinah ki taraf aaye to Usbah mein Quba ke pehlu mein utre, to Salim maula Abi Huzaifah ne un ki imamat ki is liye ke woh un mein sab se zyada Quran janne wale thay, un mein Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Asad aur Umar thay."
"322","Yusuf ibn Musa al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-A'mash se, Isma'il ibn Raja se, Aws ibn Dam'aj se, Abu Mas'ud al-Ansari Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: qaum ki imamat woh kare jo un mein Kitabullah ka sab se achcha qari ho, pas agar qirat mein barabar hon to Sunnat ka sab se zyada janne wala, pas agar Sunnat mein barabar hon to hijrat mein sab se aqdam, pas agar hijrat mein barabar hon to umr mein sab se bada. Aur aadmi apne ikhtiyar ki jagah mein imam na bane, aur na us ke ghar mein us ki takrimat par baithe magar us ki ijazat se."
"323","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Nu'man ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Amr ibn Salamah Abu Yazid al-Jarmi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum pani ke pas thay jo logon ki guzargah thi, pas hum un se puchte thay ye mamla kya hai, pas unhon ne hadees ka kuch hissa zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid hamare aas paas walon ke Islam ke sath gaye, unhon ne kaha: pas woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath jitna Allah ne chaha qiyam pazeer rahe, unhon ne kaha: phir wapis aaye. Jab woh qareeb aaye to hum ne un ka istiqbal kiya, jab hum ne unhen dekha to unhon ne kaha: main tumhare pas Wallah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas se haq ke sath aaya hun. Phir unhon ne kaha: woh tumhen is is cheez ka hukm dete hain aur is is cheez se mana karte hain, aur ke tum is is namaz ko is is waqt mein parho, aur jab namaz hazir ho to tum mein se ek azan de phir tum mein se jo sab se zyada Quran janta ho woh tumhari imamat kare, pas hamare aas paas walon ne dekha to mujh se zyada Quran janne wala koi na paya is wajah se jo main sawaaron se yaad karta tha, unhon ne kaha: pas unhon ne mujhe apne aage kar diya, pas main unhen namaz parhata tha jab ke main chhe sala bacha tha."
"324","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran al-Qattan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Qatadah se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Ibn Umm Maktum ko Madinah par do martaba khalifa banaya, aur main ne use Yaum al-Qadisiyyah mein dekha jab ke us ke sath siyah jhanda tha."
"325","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Hazim se (riwayat ki) jinhon ne Sahl ibn Sa'd al-Sa'idi ko kehte hue suna: Ansar ke do muhallon ke darmiyan jahiliyyat ke zamane ki kisi baat par kalah ho gaya hatta ke shaitan ne un ke darmiyan fasad dal diya, aur ek martaba (yun) kaha: hatta ke un me se baaz ne baaz par hath utha liya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko khabar di gayi to woh un ke paas aaye phir wahin ruk gaye, to Bilal ne azan di, phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko aane me der ho gayi aur woh tashreef na laye to Bilal ne iqamat kah di, to Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu aage badhe, phir jab woh aage badh chuke to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tashreef le aaye jabke Abu Bakr logon ki imamat kara rahe the, to Aap saffon me se guzarte hue pehli saff tak pahunche, aur Abu Bakr apni namaz me iltifat nahin karte the, to logon ne is tarah apne hathon se tasfeeh ki, phir jab unhon ne tasfeeh ki awaz suni to mud kar dekha to achanak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) (maujood) the, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ki taraf ishara kiya ke thehre raho, aur ek martaba (yun) kaha: to unhon ne apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaya, aur Abu Bakr ulte qadmon peeche hat gaye, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aage badhe, phir jab Aap ne apni namaz poori ki to farmaya: Ae Abu Bakr! tumhe qaim rehne se kis cheez ne roka, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Quhafah ke liye ye (mumkin) na tha ke Allah use apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke aage dekhe."
"326","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ibn Abi Maryam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Muhammad ya'ni Ibn Ja'far ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Hazim ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine Sahl ibn Sa'd Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek din mimbar par namaz parhi aur log Aap ke peeche the, to Aap namaz parhne lage, ruku karte, phir sar uthate aur ulte qadmon peeche hatte aur zameen par sajda karte, phir wapas aate aur us par chadh jate, jab bhi sajda karte neeche utarte, phir jab Aap farigh hue to farmaya: Ae logo! maine tumhare (sikhane ke) liye is tarah namaz parhi hai jaisa tum mujhe dekh rahe ho taake tum meri iqtida karo."
"327","(55) Imam ka dukkan par namaz parhne ka bab. Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Isa ne khabar di, unhon ne al-A'mash se, unhon ne Ibrahim se, unhon ne Hammam se, unhon ne kaha: Huzayfah Raziallahu anhu ne Madinah me ek dukkan par namaz parhi aur un ke peeche Abu Mas'ud the to unhon ne un ka kapda pakad kar kheencha, phir jab unhon ne namaz parh li to Abu Mas'ud ne un se kaha: kya tum nahin jante ke ye makruh hai, unhon ne kaha: kyun nahin, kya tum mujhe nahin dekh rahe ke mujhe yaad aa gaya tha."
"328","Abdur Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talhah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne apne chacha Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: maine aur ek yateem ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke peeche namaz parhi aur Umm Sulaym ne humare peeche namaz parhi."
"329","Yusuf ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Jarir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne al-A'mash se, unhon ne Umarah ibn Umayr se, unhon ne Abu Ma'mar se, unhon ne Abu Mas'ud Uqbah ibn Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) namaz me humare kandhon par hath pherte the aur farmate the: barabar ho jao aur ikhtilaf na karo warna tumhare dil mukhtalif ho jayenge."
"330","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Talhah ibn Musarrif ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ibn Awsajah se, unhon ne al-Bara ibn Azib Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: Aap humare paas tashreef late jab hum namaz ke liye khade hote to humare seenon aur kandhon par hath pherte aur farmate: tumhari saffen mukhtalif na hon warna tumhare dil mukhtalif ho jayenge, aur farmate the: beshak Allah aur Us ke farishte pehli saff par rahmat bhejte hain, ya kaha: agli saffon par."
"331","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne khabar di, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se (riwayat ki), unhon ne kaha: namaz me mardon ki behtareen saffen agli hain aur badtareen pichhli hain, shayad unhon ne kaha: aur namaz me aurton ki badtareen saffen agli hain aur behtareen pichhli hain. Shak Abu Muhammad ki taraf se hai."
"332","(56) Qaum ke peeche akele namaz parhne wale aadmi ka bab. Abdur Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Yahya ya'ni Ibn Sa'id ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Ash'ath se, unhon ne Ziyad al-A'lam se, unhon ne al-Hasan se, unhon ne Abu Bakrah Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat ki): ke unhon ne saff tak pahunchne se pehle ruku kar liya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Allah tumhara hirs zyada kare, lekin (aisa) dobara na karna."
"333","Abdur Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdur Razzaq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein al-Thawri ne khabar di, unhon ne Mansur se, unhon ne Hilal ibn Yasaf se, unhon ne Ziyad ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, unhon ne Wabisah se (riwayat ki): ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko qaum ke peeche akele namaz parhte hue dekha to use hukm diya to us ne namaz dohrayi."
"334","(57) Takbir aur qiraat ke darmiyan sukut ka bab. Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Muhammad ya'ni Ibn Fudayl ne khabar di, unhon ne Umarah se, unhon ne Abu Zur'ah se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab takbir kehte to takbir aur qiraat ke darmiyan khamosh rehte, to maine Aap se kaha: mere maa-baap Aap par qurban, takbir aur qiraat ke darmiyan Aap ke sukut ke bare me batayiye, Aap kya kehte hain, Aap ne farmaya: main kehta hun: Ae Allah! mere aur meri khaton ke darmiyan itni doori farma de jitni Tune mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan doori rakhi hai, Ae Allah! mujhe meri khaton se is tarah pak farma de jaise safed kapda mail se pak kiya jata hai, Ae Allah! mujhe meri khaton se barf aur pani aur olon se dho de."
"335","(58) Imam ke peeche qiraat ka bab. Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ahmad ibn Khalid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Makhul se, unhon ne Mahmud ibn al-Rabi' se, unhon ne Ubadah ibn al-Samit Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein fajr ki namaz parhayi to Aap par qiraat bhari ho gayi, phir jab Aap (namaz se) phire to farmaya: main dekhta hun ke tum apne imam ke peeche qiraat karte ho! unhon ne kaha: hum ne kaha: haan Allah ki qasam Ae Rasulullah, jaldi jaldi! Aap ne farmaya: aisa na karo magar Umm al-Quran (Surah Fatiha) ke sath, kyunke us ki namaz nahin jo use na parhe."
"336","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Wahb se, unhon ne Malik ibn Anas aur Yunus ibn Yazid se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib aur Abu Salamah ibn Abdur Rahman ne bayan kiya ke Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: jab imam ameen kahe to tum (bhi) ameen kaho, kyunke farishte ameen kehte hain, to jis ki ameen farishton ki ameen ke muwafiq ho gayi us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"337","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, woh isay Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tak pahunchate hain, Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne namaz ki ek rakat pa li to us ne namaz pa li."
"338","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id al-Qattan ne humein khabar di, Ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Muhairiz se, Muawiyah ibn Abi Sufyan Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Mujh se ruku aur sajde me pehal na karo, pas jab me ruku karun to jitna me tum se aage badh jaun use tum pa loge jab me uthun, aur jab me sajda karun to jitna me tum se aage badh jaun use tum pa loge jab me uthun, kyunki me bhari badan ho gaya hun."
"339","Ahmad ibn Sa'id al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Nadr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ziyad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum me se koi ye khauf nahi khata ke jab woh apna sar uthaye jabke Imam sajde me ho to Allah us ke sar ko gadhe ka sar bana de ya us ki surat ko gadhe ki surat bana de."
"340","(59) Logon ke liye namaz halki rakhne ka bab: Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Qays ibn Abi Hazim ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Abu Mas'ud Uqbah ibn Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aya to us ne kaha: Main fulan ki wajah se subah ki namaz se peeche reh jata hun jo humein bahut lambi namaz padhata hai! To maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko nasihat me us din se zyada sakht ghazabnak kabhi nahi dekha, to Aap ne farmaya: Ae logo, beshak tum me se kuch nafrat dilane wale hain, pas tum me se jo bhi logon ko namaz padhaye to use chahiye ke mukhtasar kare, kyunki un me zaeef aur buddha aur hajetmand hota hai."
"341","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amr se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Muadh Raziallahu anhu Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Isha ki namaz padhte the, phir wapas aakar humein imamat karate the, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek raat namaz me takheer ki to Muadh aye aur Surah al-Baqarah padhi, jab ek shakhs ne ye dekha to peeche hat gaya aur namaz padhi, phir nikal gaya, jab woh farigh hue to unhon ne kaha: Ae fulan, kya tune munafiqat ki? Us ne kaha: Nahi, lekin me Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aaunga aur Aap ko khabar dunga, unhon ne kaha: To woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aye aur kaha: Muadh Aap ke sath namaz padhte the phir wapas aakar humein imamat karate hain, aur Aap ne guzishta raat namaz me takheer ki to woh aye aur Surah al-Baqarah padhi, jab maine ye dekha to me alag ho gaya aur namaz padhi, aur hum to pani dhone wale unton wale aur apne hathon se kaam karne wale hain, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum fitne me dalne wale ho? Fulan surat aur fulan surat padho. Abu al-Zubayr ne kaha, Jabir se: Surah Sabbib, Hal Ataka, Wa al-Layl iza Yaghsha aur is jaisi suraten padho."
"342","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Musa ibn Abi Aishah se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ko hukm diya ke logon ko namaz padhayen, unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Abu Bakr ke saamne baithe hue the, aur Abu Bakr un ke peeche namaz padh rahe the. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se ke Abu Bakr sab se aage the."
"343","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Isa ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hafs ibn Ghiyath ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: al-A'mash ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad se, unhon ne kaha: Aishah Raziallahu anha ke samne namaz ki pabandi ka zikr hua, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap ko nikala ja raha tha, do aadmiyon ke darmiyan sahara diye hue, Aap ke dono qadam zameen par ghisat rahe the, phir Aap ko Abu Bakr tak pahunchaya gaya jabke woh logon ko namaz padha rahe the, to Aap ko Abu Bakr ke bayen taraf bithaya gaya, to Abu Bakr Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki namaz ke sath namaz padh rahe the aur log Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ki namaz ke sath namaz padh rahe the."
"344","Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Aur isi tarah Abu Muawiyah ne al-A'mash se riwayat kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aye, to Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ke bayen taraf baithe."
"345","Aur Abu Ishaq ki hadees me, Arqam se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhu se: To Abu Bakr ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki iqtida ki, aur logon ne Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ki iqtida ki."
"346","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Harb ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ibn Khalid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman al-Aswad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu al-Mutawakkil se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko masjid me namaz padhte dekha, to farmaya: Kya koi shakhs nahi jo is par tijarat kare aur us ke sath namaz padhe!"
"347","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ibn Ayyash ne humein khabar di, Asim se, Zirr ibn Hubaysh se, Abdullah ibn Mas'ud Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) farmate the: Shayad tum aisi qaumon ko paoge jo namaz ko us ke waqt ke baghair padhengi, pas agar tum unhein pao to apne gharon me us waqt par namaz padho jo tum jante ho, phir un ke sath namaz padho aur use nafl bana lo."
"348","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa yani Ibn Yunus ne humein khabar di, Muhammad ibn Amr se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki bandiyon ko Allah ki masjiden se na roko, aur jab woh niklen to tafilatain hokar niklen."
"349","Muhammad ibn Ismail al-Ahmasi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Abdullah ibn Jumay' se, un ki dadi se, aur Ibn Khallad se, Umm Waraqa se (riwayat hai) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab Badr ke ghazwe ke liye nikle to unhon ne Aap se kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main Aap ke sath ghazwe par chalun taake main Aap ke bimaroon ki timardari karun aur Aap ke zakhmiyon ka ilaj karun, shayad Allah mujhe shahadat ata farmaye! Aap ne farmaya: Apne ghar me qarar se raho, kyunke Allah tumhe shahadat ata farmayega, unhe al-Shahida kaha jata tha, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Jumu'a me un ki ziyarat karte the aur farmate the: Hamein al-Shahida ke paas le chalo, aur unhon ne Quran parh rakha tha, aur unhon ne ijazat mangi ke un ke ghar me ek muazzin bana diya jaye taake woh namaz parhein, to Aap ne unhe ijazat de di."
"350","(60) Kitab-e-Zakat ka aaghaz: Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Marwan - yani Ibn Mu'awiyah - ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail se, Qays se, Jarir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se namaz qaim karne aur zakat ada karne aur har Musalman ke liye khair-khwahi par bai'at ki."
"351","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo oonton wala un me un ka haq ada nahin karta magar Qayamat ke din woh sab se zyada tadad me aayenge jitne kabhi the, aur use ek khule chapte maidan me un ke liye bithaya jayega, woh use apne paon aur khuron se rondenge, aur jo gaayon wala un me un ka haq ada nahin karta magar Qayamat ke din woh sab se zyada tadad me aayengi jitni kabhi thin, aur use ek khule chapte maidan me un ke liye bithaya jayega, woh use apne seengon se maarengi aur apne paon se rondengi, aur jo bakriyon wala un me un ka haq ada nahin karta magar Qayamat ke din woh sab se zyada tadad me aayengi jitni kabhi thin, aur use ek khule chapte maidan me un ke liye bithaya jayega, woh use apne seengon se maarengi aur apne khuron se rondengi, un me na koi beghair seeng wali hogi aur na toote seengon wali, aur jo khazane wala us me us ka haq ada nahin karta magar Qayamat ke din us ka khazana ganja saanp ban kar aayega jo munh khole us ka peecha karega, jab woh us ke paas aayega to woh us se bhaagega to woh use pukarega: Apna khazana pakar lo jise tum ne chhupa kar rakha tha, main us se be-niyaz hun, phir jab woh dekhega ke us se chhutkara nahin to apna hath us ke munh me dale ga to woh use nar oont ke katne ki tarah kate ga. Abu al-Zubayr ne kaha: Aur maine Ubayd ibn Umayr ko yeh baat kehte hue suna, phir hum ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se is ke bare me puchha to unhon ne Ubayd ibn Umayr ke qaul jaisa kaha. Abu al-Zubayr ne kaha: Aur maine Ubayd ibn Umayr ko kehte hue suna: Ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, oonton ka haq kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Pani par un ka doodh dohna, un ka dol udhaar dena, un ke nar ka (jfutti ke liye) udhaar dena, un ka doodh (muft) dena, aur Allah ki rah me un par (bojh) uthana."
"352","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah - yani Ibn Wahb - ne hamein khabar di, Amr ibn al-Harith se, Darraj Abu al-Samh se, Ibn Hujayrah al-Khawlani se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum ne apne maal ki zakat ada kar di to tum ne jo tum par tha ada kar diya, aur jis ne haram maal jama kiya phir use sadqa kiya to us me us ke liye koi ajr nahin aur us ka wabal usi par hoga."
"353","Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usamah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Burayd ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Burdah ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne dada Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas hazir hua, main aur mere chacha-zad bhaiyon me se do shakhs, to dono me se ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe us me se kuch par aamil bana dijiye jo Allah ne Aap ko ata kiya hai, aur dusre ne bhi usi tarah kaha, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Hum is kaam par us shakhs ko muqarrar nahin karte jo use mange, aur na us ko jo us ka harees ho."
"354","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn Umar ibn Faris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Awn ne hamein khabar di, al-Hasan se, Abdur Rahman ibn Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Imarat mat mango, kyunke agar tumhe baghair mange di gayi to us par tumhari madad ki jayegi, aur agar mange par di gayi to tum usi ke supurd kar diye jaoge."
"355","Ibrahim ibn Abdullah al-Naysaburi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hamein khabar di, Yazid ibn Abi Habib se, Abdur Rahman ibn Shimasah se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Uqbah ibn Amir al-Juhani Raziallahu anhu se suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Maks lene wala - yani ushr lene wala - Jannat me dakhil nahin hoga."
"356","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Yahya ibn Umarah ibn Abi Hasan al-Mazini se, un ke walid se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya - Ibn al-Muqri ne kaha: aur ek martaba unhon ne riwayat ke lafz se (kaha) - : Paanch awaq se kam me koi sadqa nahin, aur paanch awsuq se kam me koi sadqa nahin, aur paanch zaud se kam me koi sadqa nahin."
"357","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - woh Ibn Sa'id hain - ne hum se bayan kiya, Bahz ibn Hakim se, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, mere dada se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Har charne wale oonton me, chalis oonton me bint labun (lazim) hai, oonton ko un ke hisab se juda juda na kiya jaye, jis ne use sawab ki ummid rakhte hue ada kiya to us ke liye us ka ajr hai, aur jis ne use rok liya to hum use aur us ke aadhe oont le lenge, hamare Rabb ke sakht ahkamon me se ek sakht hukm hai, Aale Muhammad ke liye us me se kuch halal nahin."
"358","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn al-Muthanna ibn Abdullah ibn Anas ibn Malik al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Thumamah ibn Abdullah ibn Anas se, ke unhon ne Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Abu Bakr al-Siddiq ne mujhe Bahrain ki taraf bheja aur mere liye yeh kitab likhi: Bismillah al-Rahman al-Rahim, yeh sadqe ka fariza hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Musalmanon par farz kiya, jiska Allah ne Apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko hukm diya, pas Mominon me se jis se us ka us ke (muqarrar) tareeqon par mutalba kiya jaye use dena chahiye, aur jis se us se zyada ka mutalba kiya jaye use na de, chaubis oonton me aur us se kam me bakriyan hain, har paanch me ek bakri, phir jab pachees se paintis tak pahunchen to us me ek mada bint makhad hai, phir agar mada bint makhad na ho to nar ibn labun hai, phir agar chhattis se paintalis tak pahunchen to us me ek bint labun hai, phir jab chhiyalis se saath tak pahunchen to us me ek hiqqah hai jo nar oont ke liye tayyar ho, phir jab iksath se pichhattar tak pahunchen to us me ek jaza'ah hai, phir jab chhihattar se nabbe tak pahunchen to us me do bint labun hain, phir jab ikyanwe se ek sau bees tak pahunchen to us me do hiqqah hain jo nar oont ke liye tayyar hon, phir jab ek sau bees se zyada ho jaye to har chalis me ek bint labun aur har pachaas me ek hiqqah hai. Phir jab sadqaat ke faraiz me oonton ki umrein mukhtalif hon, jis ke paas us ka sadqa oonton me jaza'ah tak pahunche aur us ke paas jaza'ah na ho aur us ke paas hiqqah ho to us se hiqqah qubul ki jayegi aur us ke sath do bakriyan dega agar mayassar hon ya bees dirham, phir jis ka sadqa hiqqah tak pahunche aur us ke paas hiqqah na ho aur us ke paas jaza'ah ho to us se jaza'ah qubul ki jayegi aur sadqa lene wala use bees dirham ya do bakriyan dega, aur jis ka sadqa hiqqah tak pahunche aur us ke paas bint labun ke siwa kuch na ho to us se bint labun qubul ki jayegi aur us ke sath do bakriyan ya bees dirham dega, phir jis ka sadqa bint labun tak pahunche aur us ke paas woh na ho aur us ke paas hiqqah ho to us se hiqqah qubul ki jayegi aur sadqa lene wala use bees dirham ya do bakriyan dega, aur jis ka sadqa bint labun tak pahunche aur us ke paas woh na ho aur us ke paas bint makhad ho to us se bint makhad qubul ki jayegi aur us ke sath bees dirham ya do bakriyan dega, aur jis ka sadqa bint makhad tak pahunche aur us ke paas woh na ho aur us ke paas bint labun ho to us se bint labun qubul ki jayegi aur sadqa lene wala use bees dirham ya do bakriyan dega, phir jis ke paas apne taur par bint makhad na ho aur us ke paas nar ibn labun ho to us se ibn labun qubul kiya jayega aur us ke sath kuch nahin. Phir jis ke paas chaar oonton ke siwa kuch na ho to us me kuch nahin siwaye is ke ke us ka malik (khushi se) dena chahe, phir jab paanch oont ho jayen to us me ek bakri hai. Aur bakriyon ke sadqe me un ke charne walon me jab chalis bakriyan hon to us me ek bakri hai ek sau bees tak, phir jab ek sau bees se zyada ho kar do sau tak pahunche to us me do bakriyan hain, phir jab do sau se zyada ho kar teen sau tak pahunche to us me teen bakriyan hain, phir jab teen sau bakriyon se zyada ho jaye to har sau me ek bakri hai, aur sadqe me na buddhi nikali jaye, na aib wali aur na bakra siwaye is ke ke sadqa lene wala (lena) chahe, aur sadqe ke khauf se juda juda ko jama na kiya jaye aur na jama ko juda kiya jaye. Aur jo do shareekon ka ho to woh dono apas me barabari se ruju' karenge, phir jab aadmi ki charne wali bakriyan chalis bakriyon se ek bakri kam hon to us me koi sadqa nahin siwaye is ke ke us ka malik (dena) chahe. Aur chandi me chauthai ushr hai, phir agar us ka maal sirf ek sau nabbe dirham ho to us me koi sadqa nahin siwaye is ke ke us ka malik (dena) chahe."
"359","Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di. Aur Ahmad ibn Sa'id al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qabisah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Abu Wa'il se, Masruq se, Mu'adh Raziallahu anhu se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhe Yemen ki taraf bheja aur unhe hukm diya ke gaayon me se har chalis me se ek musinnah lein aur har tees me se ek tabi' ya tabi'ah lein. Aur Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne kaha: Nabi ne unhe Yemen ki taraf bheja aur unhe hukm diya."
"360","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdus Salam - yani Ibn Harb - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khusayf ne hamein khabar di, Abu Ubaydah se, Abdullah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Tees gaayon me ek tabi' ya tabi'ah hai, aur chalis me ek musinnah hai."
"361","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ahmad ibn Khalid al-Wahbi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amr ibn Shuayb se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamare darmiyan khateeb ban kar khade hue, phir farmaya: Un ke sadaqat un ke gharon ke siwa (kahin aur se) na liye jayen."
"362","Abu Hatim al-Razi Muhammad ibn Idris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Salih ibn Muslim al-Ijli ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Malik ibn Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne apne chacha Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr se, unhon ne Urwah se, unhon ne Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ahl-e-badiya ke sadaqat un ke paniyon aur un ke sehnon par liye jayen."
"363","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se Ibn Wahb se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn al-Harith ne mujh se khabar di ke Abu al-Zubayr ne un se hadees bayan ki, ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ko zikr karte hue suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ko nehren aur chashme sairab karen us mein ushr hai, aur jis ko saniyah se sairab kiya jaye us mein nisf ushr hai."
"364","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Said ibn Abi Maryam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ibn Yazid ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne apne walid Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se ke Aap ne sunnat muqarrar farmayi: Jis ko aasman aur chashme sairab karen ya jo athri ho us mein ushr hai, aur jis ko nadh se sairab kiya jaye us mein nisf ushr hai."
"365","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ismail ibn Umayyah se, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban se, unhon ne Yahya ibn Umarah se, unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch awsuq se kam ghalla ya khajoor mein koi sadaqah nahin hai."
"366","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hamen khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Abdullah ibn Salim ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne Abdul Rahman ibn al-Harith al-Makhzumi se, unhon ne Amr ibn Shuayb se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se ke Banu Shababah jo Fahm ka ek batn hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko apne us shehed mein se ushr ada karte the jo un par tha, har das qirbah mein se ek qirbah, aur Aap un ke liye un ke do wadiyon ki hifazat farmate the, phir unhon ne Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu ko wahi ada kiya jo woh Rasulullah ko ada karte the, aur unhon ne un ke liye un ke dono wadiyon ki hifazat ki."
"367","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr al-Humaydi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Raja ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Abbad ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Said ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne Attab ibn Asid Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen bheja aur unhen hukm diya ke angoor ka andaza lagayen jaise khajoor ka andaza lagate hain, aur angoor ki zakat kishmish ki surat mein len jaise khajoor ki zakat khajoor ki surat mein lete hain."
"368","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Shubah se, unhon ne Khubayb se, unhon ne Abdul Rahman ibn Masud ibn Niyar se, unhon ne Sahl ibn Abi Hathmah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum andaza lagao to lo aur chhod do, sulus chhod do, phir agar sulus na chhodo to rubu chhod do."
"369","Ishaq ibn Abdullah al-Naysaburi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hafs ibn Abdul Rahman ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Said ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Amr al-Thaqafi se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aya aur us ke hath mein sone ki ek badi anguthi thi, to us ne kaha: Kya tum is ki zakat ada karte ho, us ne kaha: Aur is ki zakat kya hai, phir jab woh peeth pher kar chala gaya to farmaya: Ek bada angara hai. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: al-Walid ibn Muslim ne is ke bare mein Sufyan se, unhon ne Umar ibn Yala al-Taifi se kaha."
"370","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyaynah ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Yazid ibn Yazid ibn Jabir se, unhon ne Irak ibn Malik se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman par us ke ghode aur us ke ghulam mein koi sadaqah nahin hai."
"371","Abdul Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ayyub ibn Musa se, unhon ne Makhul se, unhon ne Sulayman ibn Yasar se, unhon ne Irak ibn Malik se, unhon ne Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman par us ke ghode aur us ke ghulam mein koi sadaqah nahin hai."
"372","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se Ibn Wahb se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Umar aur Malik ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne logon par Ramazan mein zakat al-fitr farz farmayi, khajoor ka ek sa ya jau ka ek sa, Musalmanon mein se har aazad ya ghulam, mard ya aurat par."
"373","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - ya'ni Ibn Sa'id - ne hum se bayan kiya, Dawud ibn Qays se, unhon ne kaha: Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane me sadqa nikalte rahe, khajoor ka ek sa' ya kishmish ka ya aqit ka ya sult ka ya jau ka, phir hum barabar use nikalte rahe yahan tak ke Mu'awiyah ka daur aaya, to unhon ne kaha: meri ray me Sham ki samra gandum ke do mudd jau ke ek sa' ke barabar hain, unhon ne kaha: to logon ne usi ko ikhtiyar kar liya."
"374","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ibn Qays ne hamein isi isnad se isi tarah khabar di, aur izafa kiya: Abu Sa'id ne kaha: lekin me to hamesha isi tarah nikalta rahunga jis tarah me nikalta tha."
"375","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Uqbah ne mujhe khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne zakat-ul-fitr ka hukm diya logon ke Eidgah ki taraf nikalne se pehle."
"376","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Zakariyya al-Asadi ne hum se bayan kiya, Hajjaj ibn Dinar se, Hakam ibn Utaibah se, Hujayyah ibn Adi se, Ali Raziallahu anhu se ke Abbas ibn Abdul Muttalib ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se apne sadqe ko waqt se pehle jald ada karne ke baare me pucha, to Aap ne unhen is ki ijazat de di. Yahya ibn Ma'in ne kaha: Ismail ibn Zakariyya al-Khulqani - siqah hain - aur Hajjaj ibn Dinar al-Wasiti, siqah hain."
"377","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine Abdullah ibn Abi Awfa ko kehte hue suna: jab koi gharana Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas sadqa lata to Aap un ke liye dua farmate, phir mere walid Aap ke paas sadqa laye, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Aal-e-Abi Awfa par rehmat nazil farma."
"378","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Numair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu se: ke unhon ne Allah ke raste me ek ghora sawari ke liye diya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use ek shakhs ko de diya, to woh shakhs use bechne ke liye roke raha, phir Umar Raziallahu anhu Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaye, to unhon ne Aap se kaha: kya woh ghora jo maine Allah ke raste me sawari ke liye diya tha becha ja raha hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: use na kharido, aur apne sadqe me ruju' na karo."
"379","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nu'aim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'd ibn Ibrahim se, Raihan ibn Yazid al-Amiri se, Abdullah ibn Amr Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: sadqa ghani ke liye halal nahin, aur na mazboot tandrust jism wale ke liye."
"380","Hasan ibn Arafah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Husain se, Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: beshak sadqa ghani ke liye halal nahin, aur na mazboot tandrust jism wale ke liye."
"381","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, Zaid ibn Aslam se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ghani ke liye sadqa halal nahin magar paanch ke liye: us par kaam karne wale ke liye, ya us shakhs ke liye jis ne use apne maal se kharid liya, ya qarzdar ke liye, ya Allah ke raste me jihad karne wale ke liye, ya us miskin ke liye jise us me se sadqa diya gaya phir us ne us me se ghani ko hadiya de diya."
"382","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: aur us me se jo maine Abdullah ibn Nafi' ko parh kar sunaya aur Mutarrif ne mujh se bayan kiya, Malik se, Zaid ibn Aslam se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Banu Asad ke ek shakhs se, unhon ne kaha: me apne ahl-o-ayal ke sath Baqi'-ul-Gharqad me utra, to mere ghar walon ne mujh se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas jao aur hamare liye kuch mang lao jo hum khayen, aur woh apni hajat ka zikr karne lage, phir me Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas gaya to Aap ke paas ek shakhs ko mangte hue paya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) farma rahe thay: me tumhen dene ke liye kuch nahin pata, phir woh shakhs Aap se peeth pher kar ghusse me wapas gaya aur kehte hue: meri jaan ki qasam, tum to jise chahte ho dete ho, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: beshak woh mujh par is liye ghussa hai ke me use dene ke liye kuch nahin pata, tum me se jo shakhs sawal kare jabke us ke paas ek uqiyah ya us ke barabar ho to us ne chipat kar sawal kiya. Asadi ne kaha: to maine kaha: hamari doodh wali oontni ek uqiyah se behtar hai. Malik ne kaha: aur uqiyah chalis dirham hota hai, phir me wapas laut aaya aur maine sawal nahin kiya, phir is ke baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas jau aur kishmish aayi, to Aap ne hamein us me se taqseem karke diya yahan tak ke Allah ne hamein apne fazl se ghani kar diya."
"383","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Harun ibn Ri'ab se, Kinanah ibn Nu'aim se, Qabisah ibn Mukhariq se, unhon ne kaha: maine ek himalat uthayi phir me Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya, to Aap ne farmaya: hum tumhari taraf se use ada kar denge, jab sadqe ke oont aayenge to use nikal denge, unhon ne kaha: Aap ne farmaya: Ae Qabisah! beshak sawal karna haram hai magar teen me se ek surat me: ek woh shakhs jis ne himalat uthayi ho to us ke liye sawal halal hai yahan tak ke use ada kar de phir ruk jaye, aur ek woh shakhs jise aisi aafat pahunche jis ne us ka maal tabaah kar diya to us ke liye sawal halal hai, phir woh sawal karta hai yahan tak ke guzare ke liye kafi ya guzare ke qiyam ke qadar pa le phir ruk jaye, aur ek woh shakhs jise hajat aur faqa pahunche yahan tak ke us ki qaum ke aqalmandon me se teen gawahi den to us ke liye sawal halal hai yahan tak ke guzare ke liye kafi ya guzare ke qiyam ke qadar pa le phir ruk jaye, aur is ke siwa sawal karna suht hai."
"384","Abu Hashim Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ismail - ya'ni Ibn Ulayyah - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Awn ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Umar Raziallahu anhu ko Khaibar me ek zameen mili to woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur us ke baare me Aap se mashwara talab kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! mujhe Khaibar me ek zameen mili hai, mujhe us se zyada nafis koi maal nahin mila, Aap ne farmaya: agar tum chaho to us ki asl ko roke rakho aur use sadqa kar do, unhon ne kaha: phir Umar Raziallahu anhu ne use sadqa kar diya, us ki asl na bechi jaye, na hibah ki jaye, na wirasat me li jaye, phir use fuqara me aur qarzdaaron me aur gardanon me aur Allah ke raste me aur musafir me aur mehmaan me sadqa kiya, jo shakhs us ka mutawalli ho us par us me se dastur ke mutabiq khane me, ya kisi dost ko khilane me koi gunah nahin, baghair us me maal jam'a karne ke."
"385","Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Awn ki hadees ki manind, aur unhon ne kaha: Aal-e-Umar me se sahib-e-rae shakhs is ka zimma lega."
"386","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad, yani Ibn Jafar ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ala ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab insan mar jata hai to us ka amal us se munqata ho jata hai siwae teen cheezon ke: sadqa-e-jariya, ya aisa ilm jis se faida uthaya jaye, ya nek beta jo us ke liye dua kare."
"387","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nuaim ibn Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz ne Rabiah se bayan kiya, unhon ne Haris ibn Bilal ibn Haris se, unhon ne apne walid se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Maadin-e-Qabaliyyah se sadqa liya."
"388","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sab se pehle jab maine Zuhri ko dekha to maine un se is hadees ke bare me sawal kiya to unhon ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Saeed aur Abu Salamah ne mujh se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se hadees bayan karte hue suna ke Aap ne farmaya: Be-zaban janwar ka zakhm raegan hai, aur maadin raegan hai, aur rikaz me panchwan hissa hai."
"389","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne Humaid se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hasan se, unhon ne Usman ibn Abi al-Aas Raziallahu anhu se: ke Wafd-e-Saqeef Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya, to Aap ne unhein masjid me thahraya taake un ke dil narm hon, to unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se shart lagai ke na unhein jang ke liye jama kiya jayega, na un se ushr liya jayega, na unhein jhukaya jayega, aur na un par un ke ghair me se kisi ko aamil banaya jayega, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhein na jang ke liye jama kiya jayega, na tum se ushr liya jayega, aur tum par tumhare siwa kisi aur ko aamil na banaya jayega, aur us deen me koi bhalai nahin jis me ruku na ho."
"390","(61) Roze ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Hasan ibn Muhammad Zafarani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim ibn Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Jamrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma mujhe apne takht par bithate the, unhon ne kaha: Jab Wafd-e-Abdul Qais Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Ye log kaun hain ya ye wafd kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Rabiah me se, Aap ne farmaya: Wafd ko ya qaum ko khush aamdeed, na ruswa hue na nadim hue, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hum Aap ke paas mah-e-haram ke siwa nahin aa sakte, aur hamare aur Aap ke darmiyan Mudar ke kafiron ka ye qabila hai, pas humein faisla-kun baat batayiye jise hum apne peeche rehne walon ko batayen aur jis se hum jannat me dakhil hon, unhon ne kaha: Aur unhon ne Aap se mashrubat ke bare me sawal kiya, unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne unhein chaar baton ka hukm diya aur chaar se mana kiya, unhon ne kaha: Unhein Allah wahdahu par iman lane ka hukm diya, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho Allah wahdahu par iman kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ka Rasul khoob jante hain, Aap ne farmaya: Gawahi dena ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasul hain, aur namaz qaim karna, aur zakat dena, aur Ramazan ke roze rakhna aur maal-e-ghaneemat me se panchwan hissa dena, aur unhein hantam, aur dubba, aur naqeer se mana kiya - aur aksar unhon ne kaha - aur muqayyar aur muzaffat se, aur farmaya: Inhein yaad rakho aur in ki khabar apne peeche walon ko do."
"391","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne humein khabar di, Amr ibn Dinar se ke unhon ne Muhammad ibn Hunain ko kehte hue suna: Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma is baat ko napasand karte the ke Ramazan ka chand dekhe baghair Ramazan ke roze me pehal ki jaye, kehte hain: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum chand na dekho to tees raten poori karo."
"392","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa, yani Ibn Yunus ne Shubah se khabar di, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Ziyad se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya - ya unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Qasim (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya - Shubah ne shak kiya -: Us ke dekhne par roza rakho aur us ke dekhne par iftar karo, phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to tees ki ginti poori karo."
"393","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asad ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muawiyah, yani Ibn Salih ne Abdullah ibn Abi Qais se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Aisha Raziallahu anha ki taraf bheja gaya ke un se chand chhup jane par Ramazan ke roze ke bare me aur Asr ke baad namaz ke bare me sawal karun, to main Aisha ke paas dakhil hua to maine kaha: Fulan shakhs Aap ko salam kehta hai, us ne mujhe Aap ke paas Asr ke baad namaz ke bare me, aur wisal ke bare me, aur mah-e-Ramazan me roze ke bare me sawal karne ke liye bheja hai, to unhon ne hadees ka kuch hissa zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap Shaban ka is tarah ehtemam karte the jis tarah kisi aur mahine ka ehtemam nahin karte the, phir Ramazan dekh kar roza rakhte, phir agar Aap par badal chha jata to tees ginte, phir roza rakhte - yani Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) -."
"394","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne Ali ibn al-Mubarak se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yahya ibn Abi Kaseer se, unhon ne Abu Salamah se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardar Ramazan ke mahine se ek din ya do din pehle roza rakh kar aage na badho, siwae is shakhs ke jo koi roza rakhta tha to use chahiye ke use rakhe."
"395","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fazl, yani Ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Simak se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ikrimah se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya, to us ne kaha: Maine chand dekha hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, aur Muhammad Us ke bande aur Us ke Rasul hain, us ne kaha: Ji han, Aap ne farmaya: To nida kar do ke roza rakho."
"396","Ali ibn al-Hasan Zuhli ne Husain ibn Ali se, unhon ne Zaidah se, unhon ne Simak se, unhon ne Ikrimah se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya, to us ne kaha: Maine chand dekha hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, aur main Allah ka Rasul hun? Us ne kaha: Ji han, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Bilal, logon me elaan kar do ke kal roza rakhen."
"397","Ibrahim ibn Marzuq ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rawh ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Qatadah se, Azrah se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Bahut boodhe mard aur bahut boodhi aurat ko is bare mein rukhsat di gayi jabke wo roza rakhne ki taqat rakhte hon ke agar chahen to iftar kar len, ya har din ek miskin ko khana khilayen, aur un par koi qaza nahin, phir ye is ayat mein mansukh kar diya gaya: To jo tum mein se is mahine ko paye to use chahiye ke us ke roze rakhe, aur ye baqi raha bahut boodhe mard aur bahut boodhi aurat ke liye jab wo roza rakhne ki taqat na rakhte hon, aur hamila aur doodh pilane wali aurat ke liye jab wo daren to iftar kar len aur har din ek miskin ko khana khilayen."
"398","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Mas'adah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sulaiman se, Abu Uthman se, Ibn Mas'ud Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Bilal ki azan tumhen tumhari sehri se na roke, kyunke Bilal azan dete hain taake tumhare sone wale ko jagayen, aur wo is tarah ya is tarah nahin hai yahan tak ke is tarah aur is tarah ho jaye, yani fajr."
"399","Sa'id ibn Bahr al-Qaratisi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ulayyah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abd al-Aziz ibn Suhayb se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sehri karo kyunke sehri mein barkat hai."
"400","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Humaid ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya to us ne kaha: Main halak ho gaya, unhon ne farmaya: Tumhara kya mamla hai? Us ne kaha: Main Ramazan mein apni ahliya se sohbat kar baitha, to unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum ek gardan azad karne ki taqat rakhte ho? Us ne kaha: Nahin, unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum lagatar do mahine roze rakhne ki taqat rakhte ho? Us ne kaha: Nahin, unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum saath miskinon ko khana khilane ki taqat rakhte ho? Us ne kaha: Nahin, unhon ne farmaya: Baith jao, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas khajuron se bhara ek araq laya gaya aur araq bara tokra hota hai, to unhon ne farmaya: Ye lo aur ise sadqa kar do, us ne kaha: Kya hum se zyada faqir par? To dono pathrili zaminon ke darmiyan hum se zyada faqir koi ghar wale nahin, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hanse yahan tak ke aap ki daadhen zahir ho gayin, unhon ne farmaya: Ye lo aur ise apne ghar walon ko khila do. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Aur al-Laith ibn Sa'd, aur Ma'mar, aur Isma'il ibn Umayyah, aur al-Awza'i, aur Shu'aib ibn Abi Hamzah, aur Uqail, aur Irak ibn Malik, aur Ibn Abi Hafsah, aur Mansur ibn al-Mu'tamir ne al-Zuhri se rivayat ki: Main apni ahliya se sohbat kar baitha, kya tum ek gardan azad karne ki taqat rakhte ho? Ya is mafhum par."
"401","Malik, aur Ibn Juraij, aur Yahya ibn Sa'id al-Ansari ne kaha: Ke ek shakhs ne Ramazan mein roza tor diya, to unhon ne use hukm diya ke ek gardan azad kar ke ya roze rakh kar ya khana khila kar kaffara ada kare."
"402","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Musaddad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa ibn Yunus ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Hassan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise qai ghalib aa jaye jabke wo rozedar ho to us par qaza nahin, aur agar wo khud qai kare to use chahiye ke qaza kare."
"403","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir al-Aqadi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Abi Abdullah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu Asma al-Rahabi se, Thawban Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jabke aap Ramazan mein al-Baqi' mein chal rahe the ke achanak ek shakhs singhi lagwa raha tha, to aap ne farmaya: Singhi lagane wala aur lagwane wala iftar kar chuke."
"404","Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Matar al-Warraq se, Bakr ibn Abdullah al-Muzani se, Abu Rafi' se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Musa ke paas dakhil hua jabke wo raat mein singhi lagwa rahe the, to main ne kaha: Kash ye din mein hota? To unhon ne kaha: Kya tum mujhe hukm dete ho ke main apna khoon bahaun jabke main rozedar hun halanke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna hai: Singhi lagane wala aur lagwane wala iftar kar chuke."
"405","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Shu'bah se, al-Hakam se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne al-Qahah mein singhi lagwai jabke aap rozedar the. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Aur aap safar mein the."
"406","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa ibn Yunus ne humen khabar di, Awf se, Khilas ibn Amr se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhul kar kha le ya bhul kar pi le to use chahiye ke apna roza pura kare, kyunke use to Allah ne khilaya aur pilaya hai."
"407","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Abdullah al-Ansari ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Qatadah se, Abu Rafi' se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi roza rakhe phir bhul kar kha le ya pi le to use chahiye ke apna roza pura kare, kyunke use to Allah ne khilaya aur pilaya hai."
"408","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, Alqamah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) bosa dete aur mubasharat karte jabke aap rozedar hote, aur aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tum sab se zyada apni hajat par qaboo rakhne wale the."
"409","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sumayy se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith se suna, unhon ne Aisha Raziallahu anha se suna, woh kehti thin: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko subah pa leti jabke Aap junbi hote, phir Aap ghusl karte aur roza rakhte."
"410","Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Shakir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usamah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, apne walid se, Asim ibn Umar se, Umar Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab raat aa jaye aur din peeth pher jaye aur suraj ghuroob ho jaye to tum ne iftar kar liya."
"411","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - woh al-Qattan hain - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ubaydullah se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne wisal se mana farmaya, to kaha gaya: Kya aap wisal karte hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Main tum me se kisi ki tarah nahin hun, main is haal me raat guzarta hun ke mujhe khilaya aur pilaya jata hai."
"412","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamen khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ibn al-Musayyib aur Abu Salamah se, ya un dono me se ek se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum hilal dekho to roza rakho, aur jab use dekho to iftar karo, phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to tees din roze rakho."
"413","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sufyan se, Mansur se, Ribi se, Rasul (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke Sahaba me se baaz se, unhon ne kaha: Log tees din pure karke subah ko roze se the, phir do aarabi aaye aur unhon ne gawahi di ke unhon ne guzishta kal hilal ka ihlal kiya tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne logon se farmaya, to unhon ne iftar kiya."
"414","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Muawiyah aur Ibn Idris ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Hisham ibn Urwah se, apne walid se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Hamzah al-Aslami ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se safar me roze ke bare me sawal kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Agar chaho to roza rakho, aur agar chaho to iftar karo."
"415","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Fath wale saal roza rakha, yahan tak ke jab al-Kadid pahunche to iftar kiya, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke aakhri amal hi ko liya jata hai. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Un ka qaul: aur aakhri hi ko liya jata hai - yeh al-Zuhri ke qaul me se hai, is ki wazahat Mamar ne ki hai. Hamen Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamen khabar di."
"416","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yaani Ibn Sa'id - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Shuba se, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Muhammad ibn Amr ibn al-Hasan se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ek safar me the to Aap ne ek aadmi ko dekha jis par bheed thi, aur us par saya kiya gaya tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Yeh kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Rozedar hai, Aap ne farmaya: Safar me tumhara roze rakhna neki me se nahin hai - ya farmaya: neki - yeh nahin hai ke tum safar me roze rakho."
"417","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Maryam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Nafi ibn Yazid ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Had ne mujh se hadees bayan ki ke Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ne un se hadees bayan ki, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Ham me se ek Ramazan me iftar karti phir qudrat na pati ke qaza kare yahan tak ke Shaban aa jata, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) kisi mahine me is tarah roze na rakhte the jis tarah Shaban me rakhte the, Aap us ke thore hisse ke siwa sara roza rakhte the, balke Aap us ka sara roza rakhte the."
"418","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Abu Ubayd se, unhon ne kaha: Main Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu ke sath Eid me hazir hua, to unhon ne khutbe se pehle namaz se aaghaz kiya aur kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne in do dinon ke roze ko haram qarar diya hai. Aur Sufyan ne ek aur martaba kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne in do dinon ke roze se mana farmaya hai: Fitr ke din aur Adha ke din, raha Fitr ka din to tumhara apne rozon se iftar karna hai, aur raha Adha to tum apne nusuk ke gosht me se khate ho."
"419","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamen khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Ramazan ke mahine me ek raat masjid me namaz parhi aur Aap ke sath kuch log the, phir Aap ne dusri raat namaz parhi, to us raat pehli raat se zyada log jama ho gaye, phir jab teesri ya chauthi raat hui to masjid bhar gayi yahan tak ke masjid apne logon se tang par gayi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) un ki taraf bahar tashreef na laye, to log Aap ko pukarne lage: Namaz! Phir bhi Aap un ki taraf bahar tashreef na laye, phir jab subah hui to Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu ne Aap se kaha: Log guzishta raat se aap ka intezar karte rahe ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Un ka muamla mujh se makhfi na raha, lekin mujhe darr hua ke kahin woh un par farz kar di jaye."
"420","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamen khabar di, Dawud ibn Abi Hind se, al-Walid ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Jurashi se, Jubayr ibn Nufayr al-Hadrami se, Abu Dharr Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Ramazan ke roze rakhe, to Aap ne mahine me se kuch hisse me hamari imamat na karayi yahan tak ke jab saat raaten baqi rah gayin to Aap ne hamari imamat karayi yahan tak ke raat ka tihai hissa guzar gaya, phir Aap ne chhati baqi raat me hamari imamat na karayi aur us ke baad wali raat me hamari imamat karayi yahan tak ke taqreeban aadhi raat guzar gayi. Hum ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kash aap hamari is raat ke baqiya hisse me hamen nafl namaz parhate! Aap ne farmaya: Beshak aadmi jab Imam ke sath qiyam kare yahan tak ke woh laut jaye to us ke liye us ki baqiya raat shumar ki jati hai, phir Aap ne chhati raat me hamari imamat na karayi, aur saatvin raat me hamari imamat karayi aur apne ghar walon ko bulwaya aur log jama ho gaye, to Aap ne hamari imamat karayi yahan tak ke hamen darr hua ke ham se falah choot jayegi, main ne kaha: Aur falah kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Suhur hai."
"421","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se - Ibn al-Muqri ne kaha: aur unhon ne ek martaba kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tak pahunchate hue - Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne Ramadan ke roze iman ke sath aur sawab ki niyyat se rakhe us ke pichle gunah bakhsh diye gaye, aur jis ne Lailat al-Qadr me iman ke sath aur sawab ki niyyat se qiyam kiya us ke pichle gunah bakhsh diye gaye."
"422","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Use akhri ashre me talash karo, us me se taaq raaton me, yani Lailat al-Qadr."
"423","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman - yani Ibn Mahdi - ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ibn Yazid ibn Rifaa ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Yazid ibn Abi Sulayman se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zirr ibn Hubaysh ko kehte hue suna: Agar tumhare bewaquf na hote to main apne dono haath apne kaanon me rakh leta, phir pukar kar kehta: Khabardar! Beshak Lailat al-Qadr Ramadan me akhri ashre me akhri saat me hai, us se pehle teen aur us ke baad teen, us ki khabar jis ne mujh se jhoot nahi bola, us ki khabar se jis ne us se jhoot nahi bola - yani Ubayy ibn Kab se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se."
"424","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar aur Ibn Jurayj se, Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Ramadan ke akhri ashre ka itikaf karte rahe hatta ke Allah Taala ne Aap ko wafat de di."
"425","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yala ibn Ubayd al-Tanafisi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Amrah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab itikaf ka irada karte to Fajr ki namaz padhte, phir us jagah me dakhil hote jis me itikaf karna chahte, phir Aap ne Ramadan ke akhri ashre ka itikaf karna chaha, to Aap ne hukm diya to Aap ke liye khema laga diya gaya, aur Aishah Raziallahu anha ne hukm diya to un ke liye khema laga diya gaya, aur Hafsah ne hukm diya to un ke liye khema laga diya gaya, phir jab Zaynab ne un dono ke kheme dekhe to unhon ne hukm diya to un ke liye khema laga diya gaya, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ye dekha to farmaya: Kya tum neki ka irada rakhti ho? To Aap ne Ramadan me itikaf na kiya aur Shawwal ke das din itikaf kiya."
"426","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Urwah aur Amrah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Main jab ghar aati jis me mareez hota to main us ke bare me sawal na karti magar guzarte hue - jabke wo itikaf me thin - aur beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) apna sar mere paas dakhil kar dete jabke Wo masjid me hote to main use kanghi karti jabke Wo itikaf me hote, aur Wo ghar me kisi hajat ke liye na aate magar jab wuzu ka irada karte jabke Wo itikaf me hote."
"427","(62) Manasik ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ibn al-Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Ahwas ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya Hajj har saal hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke ek Hajj, phir jo chahe us ke baad nafl kare to nafl kare, aur agar main kehta: har saal, to har saal hota."
"428","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Uqbah se, Kurayb se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke ek aurat ne apne ek bacche ko kajave me se uthaya, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya is ke liye hajj hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, aur tumhare liye ajr hai."
"429","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ahl-e-Madinah ke liye Dhu al-Hulayfah muqarrar kiya, aur ahl-e-Sham ke liye Juhfah, aur ahl-e-Najd ke liye Qarn, aur mujh se zikr kiya gaya aur main ne suna nahi ke Aap ne ahl-e-Yaman ke liye Yalamlam muqarrar kiya."
"430","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Dinar se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se. Aur Ibn Tawus ne, apne walid se, dono ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ahl-e-Madinah ke liye Dhu al-Hulayfah muqarrar kiya, aur ahl-e-Sham ke liye Juhfah, aur ahl-e-Najd ke liye Qarn - aur Ibn Tawus ne kaha: Qarn al-Manazil - aur ahl-e-Yaman ke liye Yalamlam - Amr ne kaha: aur Ibn Tawus ne kaha: Alamlam - Aap ne farmaya: To ye un ke rehne walon ke liye hain aur jo un par se guzre un ke alawa jo un ke rehne wale nahi, aur jo un se qareeb ho, Amr ne kaha: to apne ghar walon se. Aur Ibn Tawus ne kaha: to jahan se wo shuru kare isi tarah to isi tarah, hatta ke ahl-e-Makkah usi se ihram bandhenge."
"431","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim se, un ke walid se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko khushbu lagai Aap ke ihram ke liye, ihram bandhne se pehle, aur Aap ke halal hone ke liye, Baitullah ka tawaf karne se pehle."
"432","Muhammad ibn Said al-Attar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydah ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ne humein khabar di, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Goya main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki maang me khushbu ki chamak dekh rahi hun jabke Aap muhrim the."
"433","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamen khabar di, az Zuhri, az Salim, az Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma: ke ek shakhs ne pukar kar kaha: Ya Rasulullah, muhrim kapdon me se kin se bache? To Aap ne farmaya: Na shalwar pehne aur na qamees, aur na burnus, aur na amama, aur na koi aisa kapda jise za'fran ya wars laga ho, aur tum me se har ek izar aur rida aur do jootiyon me ehram bandhe, phir agar do jootiyan na paye to do moze pehen le aur unhe kaat le yahan tak ke woh dono takhnon tak ho jayen."
"434","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyaynah ne hamen khabar di, az Amr, az Jabir, yani Ibn Zaid, az Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko khutba dete hue suna jabke Aap farma rahe the: Shalwar us ke liye hai jo izar na paye, aur moze us ke liye hain jo do jootiyan na paye. Phir main nahin janta ke in dono hadeeson me se kis ne dusri ko mansukh kiya."
"435","Yusuf ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, az Yazid, az Mujahid, az Aisha Raziallahu anha, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath the aur hum muhrim the, phir jab hamare paas se sawar guzarte to hum apne peeche se kapda apne chehron par latka letin, aur woh yahan se na aata, yani unke rukhsaron ki taraf se, phir jab woh aage badh jate to hum use hata letin. Aur unhon ne kaha: Muhrima aurat jo chahe pehne siwaye burqa ke."
"436","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad, yani Ibn al-Awwam, ne hum se bayan kiya, az Hilal, az Ikrimah, az Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma, ke Dubaa'a bint al-Zubair Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aayin aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main Hajj karna chahti hun, to kya main shart lagaun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, unhon ne kaha: Main kya kahun? Aap ne farmaya: Labbaik Allahumma Labbaik, zameen me se mere halal hone ki jagah wahin hai jahan Tu mujhe rok de."
"437","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamen khabar di, az Zuhri, az Urwah, az Aisha Raziallahu anha, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Dubaa'a bint al-Zubair ibn Abdul Muttalib ke paas tashreef laye to unhon ne kaha: Main Hajj karna chahti hun aur main bimar hun? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Hajj karo aur shart laga lo ke mera halal hona wahin hai jahan Tu mujhe rok de. Hasan ibn Ahmad ibn Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ki hadees hamare nazdeek Dubaa'a Raziallahu anha ke qisse me mahfooz hai, Hajj me shart lagane ke khwahishmand ke liye is se hujjat li jati hai."
"438","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, az Zuhri, az Urwah, az Aisha Raziallahu anha, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Hajj ka ehram bandha aur kuch logon ne Aap ke saath us ka ehram bandha, aur kuch logon ne Hajj aur Umrah ka ehram bandha aur main un me se thi jinhon ne Umrah ka ehram bandha."
"439","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, az Ibn Shihab, az Urwah, az Aisha Raziallahu anha, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath Hajjatul Wada ke saal nikle to hum ne Umrah ka ehram bandha, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke saath qurbani ho woh Umrah ke saath Hajj ka bhi ehram bandhe, phir halal na ho yahan tak ke dono se ek saath halal ho."
"440","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, az Zuhri, az Urwah, az Aisha."
"441","Aur Abdur Rahman ibn al-Qasim se, az unke walid, az Aisha Raziallahu anha, unhon ne kaha: Main apne in dono hathon se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki qurbani ke haaron ko batti thi, phir Aap kisi cheez se parhez na karte the jis se muhrim parhez karta hai. Aur Abdur Rahman ne kaha: Na kisi cheez se alag hote, aur na use chhodte. Unhon ne kaha: Aur hum Hajji ke halal hone ki koi surat nahin jante siwaye Baitullah ke tawaf ke."
"442","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, az Qatadah, az Abu Hassan al-A'raj, az Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Zul Hulaifa me Zuhr ki namaz padhi phir Aap ke paas Aap ki untni layi gayi to Aap ne us ke dayen pehlu ki taraf se ish'aar kiya, phir khoon ko us se ponchh diya, phir use do jootiyon ka haar pehnaya, phir Aap ke paas Aap ki sawari layi gayi to Aap us par sawar hue, phir jab woh Aap ko lekar Baida par seedhi khadi ho gayi to Aap ne ehram bandha."
"443","Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Ulayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, az Abi al-Tayyah, az Musa ibn Salamah, az Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne atharah qurbani ke oont ek shakhs ke saath bheje, aur unke bare me use apna hukm diya, woh rawana ho gaya, phir woh Aap ke paas wapas aaya, aur kaha: Bataiye agar un me se koi mere zimme me thak kar baith jaye to? Aap ne farmaya: Use zabah kar do, phir us ke jooton ko us ke khoon me rang do, phir use us ke pehlu par rakh do, aur na tum us me se khao aur na tumhare humsafar sathiyon me se koi."
"444","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, az Sufyan, az al-A'mash, az Ibrahim, az al-Aswad, az Aisha Raziallahu anha: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne haar pehnayi hui bakriyan qurbani ke liye bhejin."
"445","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Abi Uthman se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko dekha aur us ke sath badanah thi, to Aap ne farmaya: Is par sawar ho ja, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, yeh to badanah hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Wailaka - ya Waihaka - is par sawar ho ja."
"446","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, al-Araj se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko dekha jo badanah hank raha tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Is par sawar ho ja, to us ne kaha: Yeh to badanah hai, Aap ne farmaya: Is par sawar ho ja, Wailaka, dusri ya teesri martaba me."
"447","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Said - ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne kaha: Ata ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir Raziallahu anhu ko suna jab un se budn par sawari ke bare me sawal kiya gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jab tum us ki taraf majboor kar diye jao to maruf tariqe se is par sawar ho, yahan tak ke tum (dusri) sawari pa lo."
"448","Muhammad ibn Wazir al-Wasiti ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Abi Adi ne hum se bayan kiya, Humaid se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko talbiyah kehte hue suna: Labbaika bi umratin wa hajjatin maan."
"449","al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Zafarani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humaid al-Tawil ne hum se bayan kiya, Bakr ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se zikr kiya ke Anas ibn Malik ne hum se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne umrah aur hajj ka ihram bandha, to unhon ne kaha: Anas ko waham hua, Rahimahullah, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne to sirf hajj ka ihram bandha tha aur hum ne bhi Aap ke sath usi ka ihram bandha tha."
"450","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Qais - yani Ibn Muslim - se, Tariq se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke pas aya jabke Aap al-Batha me oont bithaye hue the, to Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Kya tum ne hajj kiya? Maine kaha: Ji han, Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne kis tarah kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Labbaika, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ihlal ki tarah ihlal ke sath, Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne acha kiya, jao pas Bait ka aur Safa aur Marwah ka tawaf karo, phir halal ho jao, unhon ne kaha: Pas maine Bait ka aur Safa aur Marwah ka tawaf kiya."
"451","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail - yani Ibn Ulaiyah - ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka talbiyah tha: Labbaika Allahumma Labbaika, Labbaika la sharika laka Labbaika, inna al-hamda wa al-ni'mata laka wa al-mulka, la sharika laka, unhon ne kaha: Aur Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ne izafa kiya: Labbaika wa sadaika, wa al-khairu fi yadaika, wa al-raghbau ilaika wa al-amalu."
"452","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr se ke unhon ne Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham ko khabar dete hue suna, Khallad ibn al-Saib se, unhon ne apne walid Raziallahu anhu se, us ko (Nabi tak) pahunchate hue - Ibn al-Muqri ne kaha, aur ek martaba kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, aur ek martaba kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya -: Jibril mere pas aya to us ne mujhe hukm diya ke main apne ashab ko hukm dun ke woh ihlal ya talbiyah ke sath apni awazein buland karein."
"453","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Samad ibn Abd al-Warith ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn Abdullah ibn Mawhab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah ibn Abi Qatadah ko suna, woh apne walid se bayan kar rahe the ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ashab me se kuch logon ke sath the aur woh muhrim the, jabke Abu Qatadah muhrim nahin the, pas unhon ne ghode par sawari ki aur ek jangli gadha mar giraya, pas us ke gosht me se khaya aur un ke sathiyon ne khane se inkar kiya, aur unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne ishara kiya tha, ya qatl kiya tha, ya shikar kiya tha? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, Aap ne farmaya: Is me koi harj nahin, ise khao."
"454","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah ibn Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, al-Saab Raziallahu anhu se, aur Ibn Abd al-Hakam ne hamein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Malik ibn Anas aur Ibn Abi Zib aur al-Laith ne khabar di ke Ibn Shihab ne unhein khabar di, Ubaidullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke al-Saab ibn Jaththamah Raziallahu anhu ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko ek jangli gadha tohfe me diya jabke Aap al-Abwa ya Waddan me the, to Aap ne use un par wapas kar diya, unhon ne kaha: Pas jab Aap ne mere chehre me (na-gawari) dekhi to farmaya: Hum ne use tum par sirf is liye wapas kiya hai ke hum hurum (muhrim) hain, aur Ibn Uyainah ne is me kaha: Gadhe ka gosht, aur Said ibn Jubair ne, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se kaha: Gadhe ka pichla hissa."
"455","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, Yahya ibn Abdullah ibn Salim aur Yaqub ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Zuhri se, ke Amr mawla al-Muttalib ne un dono ko khabar di, al-Muttalib ibn Abdullah ibn Hantab se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Khushki ke shikar ka gosht tumhare liye halal hai jabke tum muhrim ho, jab tak tum ne use khud shikar na kiya ho ya tumhare liye shikar na kiya gaya ho."
"456","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se, Abdullah ibn Ubaid se, Ibn Abi Ammar se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se dabu (bijju / hyena) ke bare me sawal kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Use khao, unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Kya main use khaun? Unhon ne kaha: Han, use mere hukm se khao, maine kaha: Kya woh shikar hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han, maine kaha: Kya tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han."
"457","Ibn Abdul Hakam ne humen khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ibn Hazim ne mujhe khabar di, Abdullah ibn Ubaid ibn Umair al-Laithi se, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Abi Ammar ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se: ke Aap se dabu (bijju) ke bare me sawal kiya gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Yeh shikar hai, aur is me ek mendha (lazim) hai."
"458","Ibn al-Muqri aur Ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch janwar aise hain ke unhen qatl karne me koi gunah nahin us par jo unhen qatl kare haram aur ehram me, aur Ibn Hashim ne kaha: halal aur haram me: chuhiya, cheel, kawwa, bichchhu aur kaatne wala kutta."
"459","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zaid ibn Aslam se, Ibrahim ibn Abdullah ibn Hunain se, un ke walid se: Ibn Abbas aur Miswar ibn Makhrama Raziallahu anhuma ka muhrim ke sar dhone ke bare me ikhtilaf hua jabke woh dono Arj me the, to unhon ne mujhe Abu Ayyub ke paas bheja, to main un ke paas aaya aur unhen paya ke woh kunwen ke dono sutoonon ke darmiyan ghusl kar rahe the, to main ne salam kiya to unhon ne kapda apne seene ki taraf samet liya, to main ne kaha: Mujhe aap ke paas aap ke bhai ke bete ne bheja hai, aap se puchhta hun ke aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko apna sar dhote hue kis tarah dekha tha? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko apna sar is tarah dhote dekha, phir unhon ne apne dono haathon ko apne sar par aage laate hue aur peeche le jaate hue phera, unhon ne kaha: Isi tarah main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko apna sar dhote dekha."
"460","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amr aur Ata aur Tawus se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hijama karwaya is haal me ke Aap muhrim the."
"461","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ayyub se - ya'ni Ibn Musa se - Nubayh se, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn Ubaidullah ibn Ma'mar ne apni aankhon ki shikayat ki, phir jab woh Rawha me pahunche to unhen takleef sakht ho gayi, to unhon ne Aban ibn Uthman ki taraf paigham bheja, to Aban ne paigham bheja ke Uthman ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se hadees bayan ki ke Aap ne farmaya: Un dono par sabr se patti bandho."
"462","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar al-Zahrani ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Nafi se, Nubayh ibn Wahb se, Aban ibn Uthman se, Uthman ibn Affan Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Muhrim na nikah kare, na nikah karwaye, aur na paigham bheje."
"463","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Habib ibn al-Shahid se, Maimun ibn Mihran se, Yazid ibn al-Asamm se jo Maimuna bint al-Harith ki behan ke bete hain, Maimuna se, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Sarif me nikah kiya jabke hum dono halal the."
"464","Ibn al-Muqri aur Abdur Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki - aur hadees Ibn al-Muqri ki hai - Amr se, Abu al-Sha'tha se, ke Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Maimuna Raziallahu anha se nikah kiya jabke Aap muhrim the, to main ne is ki khabar Zuhri ko di, to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Yazid ibn al-Asamm ne khabar di - aur woh un ki khala thin - ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se nikah kiya jabke Aap halal the aur woh halal thin."
"465","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa ibn Yunus ne humen khabar di, Ibn Jurayj se, unhon ne kaha: Ata ne mujhe khabar di ke Safwan ibn Ya'la ibn Umayya ne unhen khabar di ke Ya'la, Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu se kaha karte the: Kash main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko us waqt dekh sakta jab Aap par wahi nazil hoti hai, phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Ji'rana me the aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) par ek kapda tha jis se Aap par saya kiya gaya tha, Aap ke saath Aap ke ashab me se kuch log the un me Umar Raziallahu anhu bhi the, ke achanak Aap ke paas ek aadmi aaya jis par jubba tha, khushbu me basa hua tha, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aap kya farmate hain ek aise shakhs ke bare me jis ne umre ka ehram bandha ba'd is ke ke woh khushbu me bas gaya tha? To Nabi ne us ki taraf kuch der dekha phir khamosh ho gaye, phir Aap par wahi aayi, to Umar ne apne haath se Ya'la ibn Umayya ki taraf ishara kiya: Aao, unhon ne kaha: To Ya'la aaye aur apna sar andar dakhil kiya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) surkh chehre wale the, kuch der kharrate lete rahe, phir Aap se yeh kaifiyat door kar di gayi, to Aap ne farmaya: Woh sawal karne wala kahan hai jis ne abhi mujh se umre ke bare me sawal kiya tha? To us aadmi ko talash kiya gaya, phir use laya gaya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Raha woh khushbu jo tum par hai to use teen martaba dho dalo, aur raha jubba to use utar do, phir apne umre me wahi karo jo tum apne hajj me karte ho."
"466","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn al-Haitham ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Aur Ata, Hajjatul Wada se pehle jubbe wale shakhs ke muamle ko liya karte the, aur ba'd wala, ba'd wala Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke hukm me se zyada haqdar hai, aur jubbe wale shakhs ke muamle me se yeh hai ke Ata ne mujhe khabar di ke Safwan ibn Ya'la ibn Umayya ne unhen khabar di ke Ya'la isi tarah kaha karte the."
"467","Muhammad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Humaidi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, Safwan ibn Ya'la se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas Ji'rana me tha, to Aap ke paas ek aadmi aaya jis par kata hua kapda tha - ya'ni jubba - aur woh khaluq khushbu me basa hua tha, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main ne umre ka ehram bandha hai aur mujh par yeh hai? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum apne hajj me kya karte the? Us ne kaha: Main is kate hue kapde ko utar deta tha, aur is khaluq ko dho deta tha, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tum apne hajj me karne wale the wahi apne umre me karo."
"468","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abdul Hakam ne humen khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Malik ibn Anas ne khabar di, Abdul Karim al-Jazari se, Mujahid se, Abdur Rahman ibn Abi Laila se, Ka'b ibn Ujra Raziallahu anhu se ke woh Rasulullah ke saath muhrim the, to unhen juon ne takleef di, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen apna sar mundwane ka hukm diya aur farmaya: Teen din roze rakho, ya chhe miskino ko khana khilao, do do mudd, ya ek bakri ki qurbani karo, in me se jo bhi tum ne kiya woh tumhari taraf se kafi ho jayega."
"469","Muhammad ibn Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Layla se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) umrah mein talbiyah se ruk jate the jab Hajar ka istilam karte."
"470","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asbagh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Wahb ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yunus aur Amr ibn al-Harith ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Salim se ke un ke walid ne un se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Umar Raziallahu anhu ne Hajar ka bosa liya, phir kaha: Khuda ki qasam beshak mein janta hun ke tu ek patthar hai aur agar mein ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko tujhe bosa dete hue na dekha hota to mein tujhe bosa na deta."
"471","Amr ne kaha: Aur Zayd ibn Aslam ne mujh se isi ki misl hadees bayan ki, apne walid se."
"472","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah ne mujhe khabar di, Nafi se, unhon ne kaha: Mein ne Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ko dekha ke unhon ne Hajar ka apne hath se istilam kiya, phir apne hath ka bosa liya, phir kaha: Mein ne ise nahin chhora jab se mein ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko aisa karte hue dekha hai."
"473","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq ibn Ibrahim ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Adam ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Jafar ibn Muhammad se, un ke walid se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab Makkah tashreef laye to Hajar ke paas aaye aur us ka istilam kiya, phir apni dayen taraf chale, pas teen mein ramal kiya aur chaar mein paidal chale."
"474","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di, Malik ibn Anas se, Jafar ibn Muhammad se, un ke walid se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Hajar se Hajar tak teen martaba ramal kiya aur chaar martaba paidal chale."
"475","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Ubaid maula al-Saib ne mujhe khabar di ke un ke walid ne unhein khabar di, ke Abdullah ibn al-Saib ne unhein khabar di, ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko Rukn Bani Jumah aur Rukn Aswad ke darmiyan ye kehte hue suna: Rabbana atina fid-dunya hasanatan wa fil-akhirati hasanatan wa qina azab an-nar."
"476","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne humein khabar di, Ubaidullah ibn Abi Ziyad se, unhon ne kaha: Qasim ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan aur jamarat ko kankariyan marna sirf Allah Ta'ala ke zikr ko qaim karne ke liye muqarrar kiya gaya hai."
"477","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya ke Ibn Wahb ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ahl-e-ilm mein se chand afrad ne mujhe khabar di, un mein Malik ibn Anas hain, Ibn Shihab se, Urwah ibn al-Zubayr se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki zauja Aishah se, ke unhon ne kaha: Rahe wo log jinhon ne Hajj aur Umrah ko jama kiya to unhon ne sirf ek tawaf kiya."
"478","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ashab ne apne Hajj aur Umrah ke liye ek tawaf kiya aur Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sai ki, Abu Asim ne ek martaba kaha ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aur un ke ashab ne Baitullah ka apne Hajj aur Umrah ke liye ek tawaf kiya aur Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sai ki."
"479","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Mansur ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Hajj aur Umrah ka ihram bandhe to us ke liye dono ke liye ek tawaf kafi hai, phir wo halal na ho yahan tak ke dono se halal ho."
"480","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Nufayli ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur Sa'id ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fudayl ibn Iyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn al-Saib se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Baitullah ka tawaf namaz hai lekin Allah ne tumhare liye us mein guftagu halal ki hai, pas jo shakhs bole to sirf bhalai ke sath bole."
"481","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Malik ibn Anas se, Abu al-Aswad se, Urwa se, Zaynab bint Umm Salama se, Umm Salama Raziallahu anha se: ke woh aayin jabke woh bimar thin to unhon ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: logon ke peeche se tawaf karo jabke tum sawar ho."
"482","Unhon ne kaha: aur main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko suna jabke Aap Ka'ba ke paas thay aur Surah al-Tur ki tilawat kar rahe thay."
"483","Muhammad ibn Abd al-Hakam ne hum se hadees bayan ki ke Ibn Wahb ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ibn Yazid ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ubayd Allah ibn Abd Allah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Hajjat al-Wada mein oont par sawar ho kar tawaf kiya, Rukn ko mihjan (tedhi chhadi) se chhoote thay."
"484","Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Harawi - jo al-Rayy mein rehte thay - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ma'ruf se, Abu al-Tufayl Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap apni sawari par tawaf kar rahe thay, Rukn ko apne mihjan se chhoote thay aur mihjan ke sire ko choomte thay, phir Aap Safa ki taraf nikle to apni sawari par saat chakkar lagaye."
"485","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hum Jabir ibn Abd Allah ke paas aaye jabke woh Banu Salima mein thay to hum ne un se Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke hajj ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne hum se hadees bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Madina mein nau saal thehre, hajj nahin kiya, phir logon mein elan kiya gaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) is saal hajj karne wale hain, to Madina mein bahut se log utre, sab ke sab is ke talabgar thay ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki iqtida karen aur jo Aap karen wohi karen, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Dhu al-Qa'da ke paanch din baqi hone par nikle aur hum Aap ke saath nikle, yahan tak ke jab Aap Dhu al-Hulayfa pahunche to Asma bint Umays ne Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr ko janam diya, to unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf paigham bheja aur poocha: main kya karoon, Aap ne farmaya: ghusl karo, phir kapde se kas kar patti bandho, phir ihram bandho, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) nikle yahan tak ke jab Aap ki oontni Aap ko lekar al-Bayda par barabar hui to Aap ne tawheed ke saath talbiya kaha: Labbayk Allahumma labbayk, labbayk la sharika laka labbayk, inna al-hamda wa al-ni'mata laka wa al-mulk, la sharika lak, aur logon ne talbiya kaha, aur log izafa karte thay: Dha al-Ma'arij waghaira, aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) sunte thay to un se kuch na kehte thay, to main ne apni nazar ki had tak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke samne dekha to koi sawar aur koi paidal tha, aur Aap ke peeche bhi isi tarah, aur Aap ke dayen bhi isi tarah, aur Aap ke bayen bhi isi tarah, Jabir ne kaha: aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamare darmiyan thay, Aap par Quran nazil hota tha aur Aap us ki ta'weel jante thay, to jo bhi us mein se Aap amal karte hum bhi amal karte, phir hum nikle, hum sirf hajj ki niyyat rakhte thay, yahan tak ke jab hum Ka'ba pahunche to Nabiullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Hajar-e-Aswad ko chhua, phir teen chakkar mein ramal kiya aur chaar mein aam chaal chale, yahan tak ke jab farigh hue to Maqam-e-Ibrahim (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka qasd kiya aur us ke peeche do rak'at namaz padhi, phir tilawat ki: Wattakhidhu min Maqam-e-Ibrahim musalla, mere walid ne kaha: to Aap ne us mein Surah al-Tawheed aur Qul ya ayyuha al-kafirun padhi, phir Hajar ko chhua aur Safa ki taraf nikle, phir tilawat ki: Inna al-Safa wa al-Marwa min sha'a'ir Allah, phir farmaya: hum usi se shuru karte hain jis se Allah ne shuru kiya, phir Safa par chadhe, yahan tak ke jab Baitullah ki taraf dekha to takbir kahi, phir farmaya: La ilaha illa Allah wahdahu la sharika lah, lahul mulk wa lahul hamd wa huwa ala kulli shay'in qadir, la ilaha illa Allah, anjaza wa'dahu wa nasara abdahu, wa hazama ya ghalaba al-Ahzab wahdah, phir dua ki, phir isi kalam ki taraf laute, phir utre yahan tak ke jab Aap ke dono qadam wadi mein behne lage to ramal kiya, yahan tak ke jab chadh gaye to chale, yahan tak ke jab Marwa par aaye to us par chadhe, yahan tak ke jab Baitullah ki taraf dekha to us par bhi wahi kaha jo Safa par kaha tha, phir jab saatwan chakkar Marwa par hua to farmaya: aye logon, agar main apne mu'amle mein woh pehle se janta jo ab mujhe ma'lum hua to main qurbani saath na lata aur ise umrah bana deta, to jis ke saath qurbani na ho woh ihram khol de aur ise umrah bana le, unhon ne kaha: to sab logon ne ihram khol diya, phir Suraqa ibn Ju'shum ne kaha jabke woh Marwa ke neeche thay: Ya Rasulullah, kya yeh hamare is saal ke liye hai ya hamesha ke liye, unhon ne kaha: to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apni ungliyon ko ek dusre mein dakhil kiya aur farmaya: hamesha ke liye - teen martaba - phir farmaya: umrah hajj mein dakhil ho gaya Qayamat ke din tak, unhon ne kaha: aur Ali Raziallahu anhu Yemen se aaye, qurbani lekar aaye, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) bhi Madina se apne saath qurbani laye thay, to Fatima Raziallahu anha ne ihram khol diya tha aur range hue kapde pehne thay aur surma lagaya tha, to Ali Raziallahu anhu ne un par is baat ko napasand kiya, to unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne is ka hukm diya hai, unhon ne kaha: Ali Raziallahu anhu ne Kufa mein kaha - mere walid ne kaha: yeh jumla Jabir Raziallahu anhu ne zikr nahin kiya - phir main josh dilate hue Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se us baat ke bare mein fatwa lene gaya jo Fatima ne zikr ki thi, main ne kaha: Fatima ne range hue kapde pehne hain aur surma lagaya hai, aur kehti hain: mujhe mere walid ne is ka hukm diya hai, to Aap ne farmaya: us ne sach kaha, us ne sach kaha, main ne hi use is ka hukm diya tha, Jabir ne kaha: aur Aap ne Ali Raziallahu anhu se farmaya: tum ne kis cheez ka ihram bandha, unhon ne kaha: main ne kaha: Aye Allah, main usi cheez ka ihram bandhta hoon jis ka Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ihram bandha hai, Aap ne farmaya: aur mere saath qurbani hai, Aap ne farmaya: to tum ihram na kholo, unhon ne kaha: aur qurbaniyon ki kul tadad jo Ali Raziallahu anhu Yemen se laye aur jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) laye sau thi, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apne haath se tirsath nahr kiye aur Ali Raziallahu anhu ko diye to unhon ne baqi nahr kiye aur unhen apni qurbani mein shareek kiya, phir har oont se ek boti ka hukm diya to woh handi mein dali gayin, phir dono ne us ke gosht se khaya aur us ke shorbe se piya, phir Nabiullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: main ne yahan nahr kiya hai aur Mina sara manhar hai, aur Arafat mein wuquf kiya aur farmaya: main ne yahan wuquf kiya hai aur Arafat sara mawqif hai, aur Muzdalifa mein wuquf kiya aur farmaya: main ne yahan wuquf kiya hai aur Muzdalifa sari mawqif hai."
"486","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abdur Rahman ibn al-Qasim se, un ke walid se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: hum nikle, hum sirf hajj ki niyyat rakhte thay, phir jab hum Sarif mein thay to mujhe haiz aaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) mere paas tashreef laye jabke main ro rahi thi, to Aap ne farmaya: kya tumhen haiz aaya hai, main ne kaha: ji haan, to Aap ne farmaya: yeh woh cheez hai jo Allah ne Adam ki betiyon par likh di hai, to woh sab ada karo jo muhrim ada karta hai siwaye is ke ke tum Baitullah ka tawaf na karo."
"487","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zakariyya se, al-Sha'bi se, Urwa ibn Mudarris Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: main Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap Muzdalifa mein thay to main ne kaha: main Aap ke paas Jabalay Tayy se aaya hoon, aur main ne apni sawari ko thaka diya hai aur koi pahad nahin chhoda magar us par wuquf kiya hai, to Aap ne farmaya: jo hamare saath namaz mein hazir hua aur Arafat mein raat ya din mein wuquf kiya to us ne apna tafath poora kar liya aur us ka hajj mukammal ho gaya."
"488","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Thawri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Bukayr ibn Ata se, Abdur Rahman ibn Ya'mar al-Dili se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Hajj Arafat hai - teen martaba - to jo Tulu'-e-Fajr se pehle Arafat pa le us ne hajj pa liya."
"489","Jamil ibn al-Hasan ne mujhe khat likha, unhon ne kaha: Mahbub - ya'ni Ibn al-Hasan - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ikrima se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Arafat mein wuquf kiya, phir jab Aap ne kaha: Labbayk Allahumma labbayk, to farmaya: asal khair to aakhirat ki khair hai."
"490","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf al-Firyabi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abdur Rahman ibn Ayyash ibn Abi Rabi'a se, unhon ne kaha: Zayd ibn Ali ne hum se hadees bayan ki, apne walid se, Ubayd Allah ibn Abi Rafi' se, Ali Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Arafat mein mawqif par tashreef laye aur wuquf kiya aur farmaya: yeh mawqif hai, aur Arafat sara mawqif hai, phir Aap ne ifadah kiya jab suraj ghuroob ho gaya."
"491","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amr se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: main un logon mein se tha jinhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Muzdalifa se apne ghar walon ke kamzor logon mein aage rawana kiya tha."
"492","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hamen khabar di, Awf se, Ziyad ibn al-Husayn se, Abu al-Aliya se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujh se Aqaba ki subah farmaya jabke Aap apni sawari par thay: mujhe kankariyan lao, to main ne Aap ke liye khadhf ki kankariyon jaisi kankariyan chunin, phir jab main ne unhen Aap ke haath mein rakha to farmaya: inhi jaisi - teen martaba - aur deen mein ghulu se bacho, kyunke tum se pehle log deen mein ghulu hi ki wajah se halak hue."
"493","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Jurayj se, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) yaum al-nahr ko chasht ke waqt rami karte the, aur us ke baad suraj dhalne ke baad."
"494","Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Abi Adi ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ba se, al-Hakam aur Mansur se, Ibrahim se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne jamrah ko saat kankariyon se rami ki aur Baitullah ko apne bayen taraf aur Arafah ko apne dayen taraf rakha aur kaha: Yeh us hasti ke khade hone ka maqam hai jin par Surah al-Baqarah nazil ki gayi."
"495","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Jurayj se, unhon ne kaha: Ata ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne mujhe khabar di ke al-Fadl ne unhein khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) barabar talbiyah kehte rahe yahan tak ke unhon ne Jamrah al-Aqabah ki rami ki."
"496","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Bakr se, unhon ne apne walid ko Abu al-Baddah se, un ke walid Raziallahu anhu se hadees bayan karte hue suna: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne charwahon ko rukhsat di ke woh ek din rami karein aur ek din chhod dein."
"497","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, apne walid se, Abu al-Baddah ibn Asim se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne oonton ke charwahon ko baitutah ke bare mein rukhsat di ke woh yaum al-nahr ko rami karein, phir nahr ke baad ke do dinon ki rami jama karke use un dono mein se ek din mein kar lein. Malik ne kaha: Mera khayal hai ke unhon ne kaha un dono mein se pehle din mein: Phir woh yaum al-nafr ko rami karein."
"498","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Abu al-Zubayr se ke unhon ne Jabir Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath hajj aur umrah mein shirkat ki, har saat aadmi ek badanah mein."
"499","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hamein khabar di, Yahya ibn Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: Amrah bint Abd al-Rahman al-Ansariyyah ne mujhe khabar di, Aisha Raziallahu anha se ke unhon ne unhein kehte hue suna: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath nikle, to yaum al-nahr ko hamare paas gaay ka gosht laya gaya, to main ne kaha: Yeh kya hai? To kaha gaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apni azwaj ki taraf se zabah kiya hai. Yahya ne kaha: To main ne is ka zikr al-Qasim se kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, unhon ne tumhein hadees bilkul sahi tarah pahunchayi."
"500","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ba se, unhon ne kaha: Aur Sulaiman ibn Abd al-Rahman ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Ubaid ibn Fayruz se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara se sawal kiya, to main ne kaha: Mujhe woh bayan kijiye jis se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana kiya, ya woh jinhein woh qurbaniyon mein se makruh samajhte the? To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamare darmiyan khade hue, aur mera hath un ke hath se chhota hai, to unhon ne farmaya: Char jayez nahin hain: kana jiska kanapan wazeh ho, aur bimar jiska bimar hona wazeh ho, aur langdi jiska langdapan wazeh ho, aur tuti-phuti jo guda na rakhti ho, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Pas be-shak main napasand karta hun ke daant mein nuqs ho ya kaan mein ya seeng mein, unhon ne kaha: Jo tum napasand karte ho use chhod do, aur use kisi par haram na thehrao."
"501","Abd al-Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ibn Muslim aur Abd al-Karim al-Jazari ne mujhe khabar di ke Mujahid ne un dono ko khabar di, ke Ibn Abi Layla ne unhein khabar di, ke Ali Raziallahu anhu ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke woh apne budn par khade rahen, aur un ke gosht aur khalon ko taqsim karein aur un mein se jizarah mein kuch na dein."
"502","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Karim se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abi Layla se, Ali Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujhe hukm diya ke main apne budn par khada rahun, aur un ke gosht aur jilon ko taqsim karun, aur mujhe hukm diya ke qassab ko un mein se kuch na dun. Aur farmaya: Hum use apni taraf se denge."
"503","Sulaiman ibn Shu'ayb al-Naysaburi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Hassan ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne jab apna sar mundwaya to apne sar ke dayen hisse se shuru kiya to use Abu Talhah ko de diya, phir apne sar ke bayen hisse ko mundwaya to use logon mein taqsim kar diya."
"504","Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Ijli ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah muhalliqin par rehem farmaye, unhon ne kaha: Aur muqassirin par, ya Rasulullah? Unhon ne farmaya: Allah muhalliqin par rehem farmaye, unhon ne kaha: Aur muqassirin par, ya Rasulullah? Unhon ne farmaya: Allah muhalliqin par rehem farmaye, unhon ne kaha: Aur muqassirin par? Unhon ne farmaya: Aur muqassirin par."
"505","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ne hum ko khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne yawm al-nahr ko ifadah kiya, phir wapas aaye to Mina me Zuhar ki namaz padhi. Nafi' ne kaha: to Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma yawm al-nahr ko ifadah karte, phir wapas aakar Mina me Zuhar ki namaz padhte aur zikr karte ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne aisa kiya tha."
"506","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Isa ibn Talha se, Abdullah ibn Amr Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se ek shakhs ne sawal kiya, to us ne kaha: main ne halq karne se pehle zibh kar diya? Aap ne kaha: halq kar lo aur koi harj nahin, phir dusre ne Aap se sawal kiya, to us ne kaha: main ne zibh karne se pehle halq kar liya? Aap ne kaha: zibh kar lo aur koi harj nahin, ek aur ne kaha: main ne rami karne se pehle zibh kar diya, Aap ne kaha: rami kar lo aur koi harj nahin."
"507","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne hum ko khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Isa ibn Talha se, Abdullah ibn Amr Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko Mina me Apni untni par dekha, to Aap ke paas ek shakhs aaya, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main samjha tha ke halq nahr se pehle hai to main ne nahr karne se pehle halq kar liya? Aap ne kaha: nahr kar lo aur koi harj nahin, unhon ne kaha: aur Aap ke paas dusra aaya, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main samjha tha ke halq rami se pehle hai to main ne rami karne se pehle halq kar liya? Aap ne kaha: rami kar lo aur koi harj nahin, unhon ne kaha: to us din Aap se kisi aisi cheez ke baare me sawal nahin kiya gaya jise kisi shakhs ne aage ya peeche kar diya tha magar Aap ne kaha: kar lo aur koi harj nahin."
"508","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hum ko khabar di, Ibn Jurayj se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Ibn Shihab ko kehte hue suna: mujh se Isa ibn Talha ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Abdullah ibn Amr Raziallahu anhuma ne hadees bayan ki: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) jab yawm al-nahr ko khutba de rahe the, to Aap ki khidmat me ek shakhs khada hua aur kaha: main ne khayal nahin kiya tha aur hadees zikr ki. Abu Muhammad ne kaha: aur is me Abu Bakra aur Nubayt ibn Sharit aur Ibn Umar se bhi hai."
"509","Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usama ne hum se bayan kiya (ha). Aur al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uqba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubayd Allah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Nafi' ne hadees bayan ki, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Abbas ibn Abd al-Muttalib Raziallahu anhu ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se ijazat maangi ke wo apni siqayat ki wajah se Mina ki raaton me Makkah me raat guzarein, to Aap ne unhen ijazat de di. Yeh hadees ke alfaz al-Ashajj ke hain."
"510","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya yani Ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubayd Allah se, mujhe Nafi' ne khabar di, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath Mina me do rak'atein padhein, aur Abu Bakr ke saath do rak'atein, aur Umar ke saath do rak'atein aur Uthman ke saath un ki khilafat ke ibtedai hisse me do rak'atein, phir Uthman Raziallahu anhu ne poori padhein."
"511","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Qasim se, un ke walid se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apne aakhri din ke ikhtetam par jab Zuhar ki namaz padh li to ifadah kiya, phir wapas aaye aur ayyam al-tashriq ki raaton Mina me thehre, suraj dhalne par jamre ko rami karte, har jamre ko saat kankariyon se, har kankari ke saath takbir kehte, aur pehle aur dusre ke paas khade hote to qiyam lamba karte aur aajizi se dua karte, phir teesre ko rami karte aur us ke paas khade na hote."
"512","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum ko khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Amr ibn al-Harith ne khabar di ke Qatada ibn Di'ama ne unhen khabar di, Anas ibn Malik se jinhon ne un se hadees bayan ki: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Zuhar aur Asr aur Maghrib aur Isha ki namaz padhi aur al-Muhassab me kuch der soye, phir Baitullah ki taraf sawar hue aur us ka tawaf kiya."
"513","Muhammad ibn Wazir al-Wasiti ne Ishaq al-Azraq se, unhon ne Sufyan al-Thawri se, unhon ne Abd al-Aziz ibn Rufay' se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Anas Raziallahu anhu se kaha: mujhe koi aisi cheez ke baare me hadees bayan kijiye jo Aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se samjhi ho, Aap ne yawm al-tarwiya ko Zuhar kahan padhi? Unhon ne kaha: Mina me, main ne kaha: to yawm al-nafr ko Asr kahan? Unhon ne kaha: al-Abtah me, phir unhon ne kaha: waisa hi karo jaisa tumhare umara karte hain."
"514","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman se jo al-Ahwal hain, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: log har taraf se wapas ja rahe the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: koi shakhs na rawana ho hatta ke us ka aakhri ahad Baitullah se ho."
"515","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Urwa se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Safiyya bint Huyayy ko ifadah karne ke baad haiz aa gaya, to is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: kya wo hum ko rokne wali hai? Main ne kaha: use ifadah karne ke baad haiz aa gaya hai, Aap ne farmaya: to phir koi baat nahin."
"516","Ibn al-Muqri aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya (ha), aur Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ibn Uyayna ne khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Sulayman ibn Yasar se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Khath'am ki ek aurat ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya Ibn Khashram aur Ibn Hashim ne izafa kiya: ghadaat al-nahr unhon ne kaha: aur al-Fadl Aap ke peeche sawar the, to us ne kaha: beshak Allah ka apne bandon par Hajj ka farizah mere walid ko is haal me paya hai ke wo bahut buddhe sheikh hain aur kajave par jam kar baithne ki taqat nahin rakhte, to kya Aap dekhte hain ke un ki taraf se Hajj kiya jaye? Aap ne kaha: haan."
"517","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Isa ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu al-Tayyah se, Musa ibn Salama se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se ke falan al-Juhani ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya, to us ne kaha: Mere walid bahut budhe hain jo hajj kiye baghair faut ho gaye - ya us ne kaha: hajj ki isteta'at nahin rakhte -? Aap ne farmaya: To un ki taraf se hajj karo."
"518","Harun ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Abda ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sa'id ibn Abi Aruba se, Qatada se, Azra se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko kehte hue suna: Shubruma ki taraf se labbaik, Aap ne farmaya: Shubruma kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Mera bhai hai ya mera rishtedar hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne kabhi hajj kiya hai? Us ne kaha: Nahin, Aap ne farmaya: To yeh apni taraf se kar lo, phir Shubruma ki taraf se talbiya kaho."
"519","Amr ibn Abdullah al-Awdi aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Shu'ba se, Nu'man ibn Salim se - Ibn Hashim ne izafa kiya: aur woh siqa the - Amr ibn Aws se, Abu Razin al-Uqayli Raziallahu anhu se ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaye, to unhon ne kaha: Mere walid bahut budhe hain jo hajj aur umra ki isteta'at nahin rakhte aur na safar ki taqat rakhte hain? Aap ne farmaya: Apne walid ki taraf se hajj karo aur umra karo."
"520","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne humein khabar di, Shu'ba se, Ja'far ibn Iyas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id ibn Jubayr ko Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se hadees bayan karte hue suna ke ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya, to us ne kaha: Meri behan ne hajj ki nazr mani thi aur woh faut ho gayi? To Aap ne farmaya: Agar us par qarz hota to kya tum use ada karte? Us ne kaha: Ji haan, Aap ne farmaya: To Allah ka haq ada karo, pas Woh wafa ka zyada haqdar hai."
"521","Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Uyayna ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sumayy se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayra Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Hajj mabroor ka badla Jannat ke siwa kuch nahin, aur ek umra se dusre umre tak un ke darmiyan ke gunahon ka kaffara hai."
"522","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki - isi ki manind."
"523","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Sa'id - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Jurayj se, unhon ne kaha: Ata ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Ansar ki ek aurat se farmaya - Ibn Abbas ne us ka naam liya tha phir main us ka naam bhool gaya: Is saal hamare saath hajj karne se tumhein kis cheez ne roka? Us ne kaha: Ae Nabiullah, mere paas do pani lane wale oont the, to Abu fulan aur us ka beta - yani us ka shauhar aur us ka beta - sawar ho gaye aur ek pani lane wala oont chhor diya jis par pani dhota hai, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan aaye to umra karo, kyunke us mein umra hajj ke barabar hai, ya Aap ne farmaya: hajj ke barabar hai."
"524","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se Maghazi mein se bayan kiya jo unhon ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne kaha: Zuhri ne kaha: Urwa ibn al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di, Miswar ibn Makhrama aur Marwan ibn al-Hakam se jabke un mein se har ek apne saathi ki hadees ki tasdeeq karta hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Hudaybiya ke zamane mein apne ashab mein se kuch das sau se zyada afrad mein nikle, yahan tak ke jab woh Dhu al-Hulayfa mein the to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne qurbani ke janwaron ko qelade pehnaye aur umre ka ehram bandha, aur apne aage Khuza'a mein se apna ek jasoos bheja jo Aap ko Quraysh ki khabar de, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) chalte rahe yahan tak ke jab Ghadir al-Ashtat mein the jo Usfan ke qareeb hai, to un ka Khuza'i jasoos un ke paas aaya, to us ne kaha: Main ne Ka'b ibn Lu'ayy aur Amir ibn Lu'ayy ko chhora hai ke unhon ne aap ke khilaf Ahabish ko jama kiya hai, aur aap ke khilaf majme jama kiye hain aur woh aap se ladenge aur aap ko Baitullah se rokenge, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe mashwara do - phir Ibn Yahya ne mushrikeen ke unhein Baitullah se rokne ke bare mein hadees ko tawalat ke saath zikr kiya - aur unhon ne muqadme ke zikr ke baad us ke aakhir mein kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apne ashab se farmaya: Khade ho jao pas qurbani zabah karo, phir halq karao, aur unhon ne baqi hadees zikr ki."
"525","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Uyayna ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amr se jinhon ne Sa'id ibn Jubayr ko khabar dete hue suna ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath the to ek shakhs apne oont se gir pada pas us ki gardan toot gayi aur woh ehram ki halat mein faut ho gaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Use pani aur beri ke patton se ghusl do aur use us ke dono kapdon mein kafan do, aur us ka sar na dhanko, kyunke Allah use Qayamat ke din talbiya kehte hue uthayega."
"526","Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abaida - yani Ibn Humayd - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ibn al-Mu'tamir ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Hakam ibn Utayba se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Ek oontni ne ehram ki halat mein ek shakhs ki gardan tod di aur woh faut ho gaya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ke bare mein hukm diya ke use us ke dono kapdon mein kafan diya jaye aur ghusl diya jaye, aur na us ka chehra dhanka jaye, aur na use khushbu lagayi jaye, kyunke woh Qayamat ke din talbiya kehte hue uthaya jayega."
"527","Abbas ibn al-Walid ibn Mazyad ne humein khabar di ke un ke walid ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Awza'i ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Abi Kathir ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salama ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurayra Raziallahu anhu ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Jab Makka fatah hua to Huzail ne Banu Layth ke ek shakhs ko jahiliyyat mein apne ek maqtool ke badle qatl kar diya, to yeh baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tak pahunchi to Aap khade hue, to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne Makka se Hathi ko rok diya aur us par Apne Rasool aur mominon ko ghalib kar diya, aur woh na mujh se pehle kisi ke liye halal hui, aur na mere baad kisi ke liye halal hogi, aur woh mere liye sirf din ki ek ghadi mein halal ki gayi thi, aur woh is ghadi mein haram hai, na us ke darakht kaate jayen aur na us ke kaante ukhade jayen, aur na us ki giri hui cheez uthaye magar elan karne wala, aur jis ka koi maqtool qatl kiya jaye to woh do behtar suraton mein se ek ka ikhtiyar rakhta hai ya qisas liya jaye ya fidya liya jaye. To Ahl-e-Yaman mein se ek shakhs khada hua jise Abu Shah kaha jata hai, to us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, mere liye likh dijiye! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Abu Shah ke liye likh do. To Abbas ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, izkhir ke siwa, kyunke hum use apne gharon aur qabron mein istemal karte hain, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Izkhir ke siwa, izkhir ke siwa."
"528","Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abaida ibn Humayd ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Mujahid se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Fatah Makka ke din farmaya: Beshak yeh shehar haram hai Allah ne use us din haram qarar diya jis din aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya, pas woh Allah ke haram kiye hue ehteram ke saath Qayamat ke din tak haram hai, mere siwa kisi ke liye us mein qatl halal nahin kiya gaya, aur na mere baad kisi ke liye halal hai yahan tak ke Qayamat qayam ho jaye, na us ke kaante kaate jayen, aur na us ki ghaas ukhadi jaye, aur na us ke shikar ko bhagaya jaye."
"529","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Malik se, unhon ne Zuhri se, unhon ne Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab se, unhon ne Abu Huraira Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Agar main Madina me hiranon ko dekhun to main unhen na daraun, beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo us ke do labon ke darmiyan hai wo haram hai. Malik ne kaha: Madina ka haram ek barid me ek barid hai, aur do laba darakhton me se hain aur wo dono harra hain."
"530","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne Sa'id se, unhon ne Abu Huraira Raziallahu anhu se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Madina ke do labon ke darmiyan ko haram qarar diya, us ke darakht kaate na jayen aur us ke shikar ko bhagaya na jaye."
"531","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Zuhri se, unhon ne Sa'id se, unhon ne Abu Huraira Raziallahu anhu se, wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tak pahunchate hain - aur Mahmud ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sawariyan sirf teen masjidon ki taraf kasi jati hain: Masjid al-Haram, Masjid al-Aqsa aur meri ye masjid."
"532","(63) Kitab al-Janaiz: Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Yazid ibn Kaysan se, unhon ne Abu Hazim se, unhon ne Abu Huraira Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne marne walon ko La ilaha illa Allah talqeen karo."
"533","Ahmad ibn Sa'id al-Darimi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Nadr - yani Ibn Shumayl - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Hafsa se, unhon ne Umm Atiyya Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Jo hum se bai'at me liya gaya us me se tha: ke hum noha na karen."
"534","Muhammad ibn Yahya aur Ibrahim ibn Marzuq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, dono ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jahiliyyat ke mamle ki do shakhen hain: nasab me ta'n karna aur noha karna. Ibn Yahya ne kaha: Aur ek martaba unhon ne kaha: Log unhen kabhi nahin chhodenge."
"535","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ne hamen khabar di. (Ha). Aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Sufyan se, unhon ne Zubayd se, unhon ne Ibrahim se, unhon ne Masruq se, unhon ne Abdullah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Wo hum me se nahin jo rukhsaron ko peete, girebanon ko phaade aur jahiliyyat ki pukar pukare, aur Ibn Hashim ki hadees me hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Zubayd ne hadees bayan ki."
"536","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Nufayli ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Salama ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Yahya ibn Abbad ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne apne walid Abbad se, unhon ne Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Jab unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko ghusl dene ka irada kiya to us bare me ikhtilaf kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam hum nahin jante kya hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko un ke kapdon se nanga karen jaise hum apne murdon ko nanga karte hain ya hum unhen ghusl den aur un par un ke kapde hon, unhon ne kaha: To jab unhon ne ikhtilaf kiya to Allah ne un par neend daal di hatta ke un me se koi shakhs na tha magar us ki thodi us ke seene me thi, phir ghar ki taraf se ek pukarne wale ne un se kalam kiya jise wo nahin jante the wo kaun hai: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko ghusl do aur un par un ki qamees ho, unhon ne kaha: To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki taraf khade hue, unhen ghusl dete the aur un par un ki qamees thi, qamees ke upar pani bahate the aur qamees ke sath malte the apne hathon ke baghair, unhon ne kaha: Aur Aisha Raziallahu anha kaha karti thin: Kash main apne mamle me pehle se wo jan leti jo bad me jana to unhen un ki biwiyon ke siwa koi ghusl na deta, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ghusl se farigh hue to unhen teen kapdon me kafan diya gaya: do Sahari kapde aur Hibara ki chadar, un me lapet kar lapeta gaya."
"537","Jaise mujh se Ja'far ibn Muhammad ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada Ali ibn al-Husayn se. Aur Zuhri ne, unhon ne Ali ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhum se."
"538","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ayyub se, unhon ne Muhammad se, unhon ne Umm Atiyya Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Hamare pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tashreef laye jabke hum un ki beti ko ghusl de rahi thin, to unhon ne farmaya: Use teen ya paanch martaba ya is se zyada agar tum munasib samjho, pani aur ber ke patton se ghusl do, aur aakhir me kafur ya kuch kafur shamil karo, phir jab tum farigh ho jao to mujhe ittila do. Jab hum farigh huen to hum ne unhen ittila di, to unhon ne hamari taraf apna tehband dala aur farmaya: Use us ka astrah banayo."
"539","Hasan ibn Arafa ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Qawm me se Khalid al-Hadhdha ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Hafsa aur Ibn Sirin se, unhon ne Umm Atiyya Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Aur us ke dayan pehluon aur wuzu ke maqamon se ibtida karo."
"540","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ya'la ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Hisham se, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Hafsa ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Umm Atiyya Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah ki beti ke sar me teen chotiyan banayin aur unhen us ke peeche dal diya."
"541","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hamein Hisham se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha Raziallahu anha se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko teen safed Yamani kapron mein kafan diya gaya jin mein na qameez thi aur na amama."
"542","Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mu'awiya al-Darir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-A'mash ne hum se Shaqiq se, unhon ne Khabbab ibn al-Aratt Raziallahu anhu se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath Allah ke raste mein hijrat ki Allah ka chehra talash karte hue, pas hamara ajar Allah par wajib ho gaya, pas hum mein se woh hain jo guzar gaye aur unhon ne apne ajar mein se kuch na khaya, un mein se Mus'ab ibn Umayr hain, woh Uhud ke din qatal kiye gaye pas un ke liye kafan dene ko ek namira ke siwa kuch na mila, pas hum jab use un ke sar par rakhte to un ke paon nikal aate aur jab use un ke paon par rakhte to un ka sar nikal aata, pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Use us taraf se rakho jo un ke sar ke qareeb hai aur un ke paon par izkhir daal do. Aur hum mein se woh hain jin ka phal pak gaya aur woh use chun rahe hain."
"543","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne hamein Ayyub se, unhon ne Abu Qilaba se, unhon ne Samura ibn Jundub se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum par in safed kapron ko lazim hai, tumhare zinda inhein pehnein aur apne murdon ko in mein kafan do."
"544","Sa'dan ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Amr se bayan kiya jinhon ne Jabir ibn Abd Allah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Abd Allah ibn Ubayy ki qabr par tashreef laye baad is ke ke use us ke garhe mein dakhil kiya gaya tha, pas aap ne us ke bare mein hukam diya to use nikala gaya, pas aap ne use apne ghutnon ya apni ranon par rakha, pas apne luaab se us par phoonka aur use apni qameez pehnai, pas Allah khoob janta hai."
"545","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne hamein al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Ibn al-Musayyab se, unhon ne Abu Hurayra Raziallahu anhu se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch cheezein Musalman ke liye us ke bhai par wajib hain: salam ka jawab dena, cheenkne wale ko yarhamukallah kehna, mareez ki iyadat karna, janaze ke peeche jana, aur dawat qabool karna."
"546","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se Sumayy se, unhon ne Abu Salih se, unhon ne Abu Hurayra Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se bayan kiya ke aap ne farmaya: Jis ne janaze par namaz parhi to us ke liye ek qirat hai, aur jo us ke saath chala yahan tak ke woh dafan ki jaye to us ke liye do qirat hain, un mein se ek ya un mein se chhota Uhud ke barabar hai. Aur Ibn al-Muqri ne kaha: Aur jo us ke peeche chala yahan tak ke us se farigh ho jaya jaye."
"547","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Sa'id se, unhon ne Abu Hurayra Raziallahu anhu se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se bayan kiya ke aap ne farmaya: Janaze mein jaldi karo, pas agar woh khair ho to woh khair hai jis ki taraf tum use aage barhate ho, aur agar woh shar ho to woh shar hai jise tum apni gardano se utar phenkte ho."
"548","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Salim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Amir ibn Rabi'a Raziallahu anhu se jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tak baat pahunchate hain bayan kiya, aur Mahmud ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se ke aap ne farmaya: Jab tum janaza dekho to us ke liye khare ho jao, yahan tak ke woh tum se aage nikal jaye ya rakh diya jaye."
"549","Umar ibn Shabba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ghundar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'ba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Mas'ud ibn al-Hakam ko kehte hue suna: Ali Raziallahu anhu ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekha aap ek janaze mein khare hue to hum khare ho gaye, aur main ne aap ko dekha aap baith gaye to hum baith gaye."
"550","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne hamein Ayyub se, unhon ne Nafi' se, unhon ne Ibn Umar se, unhon ne Ibn Rabi'a Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se khabar di ke aap ne farmaya: Jab tum janaza dekho, pas agar tum us ke saath chalne wale na ho to us ke liye khare ho jao yahan tak ke woh tum se aage nikal jaye ya rakh diya jaye, unhon ne kaha: Pas Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma kabhi janaze se aage barh kar baith jate, pas jab use aate hue dekhte to khare ho jate yahan tak ke woh rakh diya jata, unhon ne kaha: Aur kabhi us se parda kar lete."
"551","Al-Hasan ibn Arafa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaym ne hum se Mansur se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Sirin aur Hisham se, unhon ne Hafsa aur Muhammad ibn Sirin se, unhon ne Umm Atiyya Raziallahu anha se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humein janazon ke peeche jane se mana kiya gaya aur hum par sakhti se lazim qaraar nahin diya gaya."
"552","Abd Allah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se Shu'ba se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Murra ne hum se Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab se, unhon ne Umar Raziallahu anhu se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Har ek paanch aur chaar hua karta tha, pas unhon ne chaar ka hukam diya."
"553","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ba se, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn Murra ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Abi Layla se: ke Zayd ibn Arqam Raziallahu anhu hamare janazon par chaar takbirein kehte the, aur unhon ne ek janaze par paanch takbirein kahin, to un se poocha gaya to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) paanch takbirein kehte the, ya (kaha): Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne paanch takbirein kahin."
"554","Hasan ibn Muhammad Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Abbad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'ba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd ibn Ibrahim ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine Talha ibn Abdullah ko suna, unhon ne kaha: maine Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ke peeche janaze ki namaz padhi to unhon ne us me Fatiha-tul-Kitab padhi, to maine un ka haath pakda aur kaha: kya aap is me padhte hain? Unhon ne kaha: beshak yeh sunnat aur haq hai."
"555","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'd ibn Ibrahim se, Talha ibn Abdullah ibn Awf se, unhon ne kaha: maine Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ke saath isi tarah namaz padhi."
"556","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Talha Taymi se, unhon ne kaha: maine Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ko suna, woh janaze par Fatiha-tul-Kitab aur ek surat padh rahe the aur qirat me awaz buland kar rahe the aur kaha: maine awaz sirf is liye buland ki taake tumhein bata dun ke yeh sunnat hai, jabke imam use aahista padhta hai."
"557","Hasan ibn Muhammad Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Dawud Hashimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Talha ibn Abdullah ibn Awf se jo Abdur Rahman ibn Awf ke bhai hain, unhon ne kaha: maine Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ke peeche janaze ki namaz padhi to unhon ne Fatiha-tul-Kitab aur ek surat padhi, awaz buland ki yahan tak ke hum ne suna, phir jab woh faregh hue to maine un ka haath pakda aur un se is ke baare me poocha, to unhon ne kaha: sunnat aur haq hai."
"558","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se isi sanad ke saath isi tarah (riwayat ki) aur unhon ne kaha: aur ek surat."
"559","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiya ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Habib ibn Ubayd se, unhon ne Jubayr ibn Nufayr Hadrami ko kehte hue suna: maine Awf ibn Malik Ashja'i ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek janaze ki namaz padhai, to maine Aap ki dua me se yaad kiya jabke Aap farma rahe the: Ae Allah! use bakhsh de aur us par rehem farma, use aafiyat de aur use muaf farma, us ki mehmani ko izzat de, us ke dakhil hone ki jagah ko kushada farma, use pani aur barf aur oolon se dho de, use khatayon se paak saaf kar de jaise Tune safed kapde ko mail se paak saaf kiya, use us ke ghar se behtar ghar, us ke ghar walon se behtar ghar wale, aur us ki biwi se behtar biwi ata farma, use Jannat me dakhil farma, aur use qabr ke azab se panah de, yahan tak ke maine tamanna ki ke kaash woh maiyyat main hota."
"560","Bahr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiya ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Abdur Rahman ibn Jubayr se, unhon ne apne walid se hadees bayan ki, Awf Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se – isi hadees ki tarah bhi (marvi hai)."
"561","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Umama ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf ko Ibn Musayyab se bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: janaze ki namaz me sunnat yeh hai ke tum takbeer kaho, phir Umm-ul-Quran padho, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) par durood bhejo, phir maiyyat ke liye khuloos se dua karo, aur pehli takbeer ke siwa (kisi me) qirat na karo, phir apni taraf se dayen jaanib salam phere."
"562","Abu Ja'far Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdus Samad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya se – ya'ni Ibn Abi Kathir se – Abu Ibrahim se, un ke walid se, ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko ek maiyyat par namaz padhte hue dekha, to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! hamare zinda aur hamare murda ko, hamare hazir aur hamare ghaib ko, hamare chhote aur hamare bade ko, hamare mard aur hamari aurat ko bakhsh de."
"563","Hasan ibn Muhammad Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asbat ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaybani ne hum se bayan kiya, Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ne mujh se hadees bayan ki – aur unhon ne da'wa kiya ke unhon ne yeh dekha tha – unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ek qabr ke paas se guzre jo raat me dafn ki gayi thi, to Aap ne farmaya: yeh kaun hai? Logon ne kaha: yeh fulaan ki qabr hai, woh guzishta raat faut hua, to hum ne raat me Aap ko takleef dena napasand kiya ke kahin Aap ko koi cheez na pahunche ya Aap par mashaqqat na ho, is liye hum ne use dafna diya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) khade hue aur hum ne Aap ke peeche saf bandhi, phir Aap ne us par (janaze ki) namaz padhi."
"564","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Malik ibn Anas ko Ibn Shihab se hadees bayan karte hue suna, Sa'id ibn Musayyab se, Abu Huraira Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne logon ko Najashi ki maut ki khabar di usi din jis din woh faut hua, aur Aap unhein le kar Eidgah ki taraf nikle, phir Aap ne unhein saf me khada kiya, aur us par chaar takbirein kahin."
"565","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husayn - yani al-Mu'allim - ne humen khabar di, Abdullah ibn Burayda se, Samura ibn Jundub Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Umm Fulan ki namaz-e-janaza parhi jo nifas me faut ho gayi thi, pas Aap us ke darmiyan me khare hue."
"566","Ahmad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: main ne Nafi' ko ye dawa karte hue suna ke Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ne nau janazon ki ek sath namaz parhi, mardon ko imam ki taraf rakha aur aurton ko qibla ki taraf, pas unhen ek saf me khara kiya, aur Umm Kulthum bint Ali ibn Abi Talib - jo Umar ibn al-Khattab ki biwi thin - aur un ke ek bete jise Zayd kaha jata tha Raziallahu anhum ki janaze ek sath rakhe gaye, aur us din imam Sa'id ibn al-As the, aur logon me Ibn Abbas aur Abu Hurayra aur Abu Sa'id aur Abu Qatada Raziallahu anhum the, pas ladke ko imam ki taraf rakha gaya, to ek shakhs ne kaha: pas main ne is ko napasand kiya, to main ne Ibn Abbas aur Abu Hurayra aur Abu Sa'id aur Abu Qatada Raziallahu anhum ki taraf dekha aur kaha: ye kya hai? To unhon ne kaha: ye sunnat hai."
"567","Ibrahim ibn al-Harith ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij ne kaha: aur mujhe Abu al-Zubayr ne khabar di ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ko bayan karte hue suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek din khutba diya pas Aap ne Apne ashab me se ek shakhs ka zikr kiya jo faut ho gaya tha pas use na-kaf kafan me kafnaya gaya tha, aur use raat me dafn kiya gaya tha, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne danta ke kisi shakhs ko raat me dafn kiya jaye yahan tak ke us par namaz parhi jaye, magar ye ke koi insan is par majbur ho jaye, aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jab tum me se koi apne bhai ko kafnaye to use umda kafnaye."
"568","Muhammad ibn Abd al-Malik ibn Zanjawayh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Badr Shuja' ibn al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ziyad ibn Khaythama ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Isma'il al-Suddi ne khabar di, Ikrima se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki qabr me al-Abbas aur Ali aur al-Fadl dakhil hue, aur Aap ki lahad ek Ansari shakhs ne khodi, aur wahi hai jo shuhada ki qabron ki lahden khodta hai."
"569","Amr ibn Abdullah al-Awdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammam ibn Yahya se, Qatada se, Abu al-Siddiq al-Naji se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: jab tum apne murdon ko un ki qabron me rakho to kaho: Allah ke naam se, aur Rasulullah ki sunnat par."
"570","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Uqba ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'ba ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Jamra se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki qabr me ek surkh qatifa rakhi."
"571","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'ba ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Najiya ibn Ka'b se, Ali Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ke chacha faut ho gaye hain - ya mere walid faut ho gaye hain - Aap ne farmaya: jao use chhupao (dafn karo). Main ne kaha: wo mushrik ho kar mara hai, Aap ne farmaya: jao use chhupao. Pas main ne use chhupaya phir Aap ke pas aya, Aap ne farmaya: jao ghusl karo."
"572","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhadir ibn al-Muwarri' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd ibn Sa'id al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Amra bint Abd al-Rahman ne khabar di ke unhon ne Aisha Raziallahu anha ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: momin ki haddi ko murda hone ki halat me torna us ke zinda hone ki halat me torne jaisa hai."
"573","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ayb ibn al-Layth se, unhon ne apne walid se, Ibn Shihab se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Ka'b ibn Malik se ke Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ne unhen khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Uhud ke maqtulin me se do aadmiyon ko ek hi kapde me jama karte the, phir farmate: in me se Quran ka zyada lene wala kaun hai? Pas jab Aap ko un me se ek ki taraf ishara kiya jata to use lahad me aage rakhte, aur farmate: main Qayamat ke din in par gawah hun. Aur unhen un ke khoon ke sath dafn karne ka hukm diya, aur un par namaz nahin parhi gayi, aur na unhen ghusl diya gaya."
"574","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Aswad se jinhon ne Nubayh al-Anazi ko kehte hue suna: main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Uhud ke maqtulin ke bare me, jab unhen Madina ki taraf muntaqil kar diya gaya tha, hukm diya ke unhen un ke girne ki jaghon ki taraf lautaya jaye. Hadees ke alfaz Mahmud ke hain. Aur Ibn al-Muqri ne kaha: Nubayh se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se."
"575","Ibn al-Muqri aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Sa'id se, Abu Hurayra Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se Aap ne farmaya: kisi Musalman ke tin bachche faut nahin hote ke wo aag me dakhil ho, magar qasam puri hone ke liye."
"576","(64) Tijarat ke bab: Abu Hashim Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Awn ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: main ne al-Nu'man ibn Bashir Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko farmate hue suna - aur Allah ki qasam! Un ke baad main kisi ko ye kehte hue nahin sununga: main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se suna ke Aap ne farmaya: beshak halal wazeh hai aur beshak haram wazeh hai, aur in dono ke darmiyan mushtabihat umoor hain, unhon ne kaha: aur kabhi unhon ne kaha: mushtabiha, aur main tumhare liye is bare me ek misal bayan karunga: beshak Allah ne ek charagah muqarrar ki hai, aur beshak Allah ki charagah Us ki hurmat wali cheezen hain, aur beshak jo charagah ke ird-gird charayega qareeb hai ke wo us me charne lage, aur beshak jo shubhe wali cheez me ghulta hai qareeb hai ke wo (had se) aage badh jaye. Ibn Awn ne kaha: main nahin janta ye wahi hai jo unhon ne al-Nu'man se suna, ya unhon ne apni raay se kaha."
"577","Ali ibn Abi Isa aur Hisham ibn al-Junayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Majid - yani Ibn Abi Rawwad - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak koi shakhs hargiz nahi marega hatta ke woh apna rizq mukammal kar le, pas rizq ko dheer se aane wala mat samjho, aur Allah se daro aye logon aur talab me husn-e-tariqa ikhtiyar karo, aur jo halal ho woh lo aur jo haram ho use chhor do."
"578","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim aur Jami' aur Abdul Malik se, Abu Wa'il Shaqiq se, Qays ibn Abi Gharazah se, unhon ne kaha: Hum al-Baqi' me becha karte the, pas hamare paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tashreef laye jabke humein samasira kaha jata tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Aye tajiron ki jama'at, pas Aap ne humein hamare naam se behtar naam diya, phir farmaya: Beshak is be' me qasam aur jhoot shamil ho jate hain, pas use sadqe ke sath milaya karo."
"579","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Salamah ibn Kuhayl se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ka Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) par oonton me se ek umr ka oont (qarz) tha, pas woh apna taqaza karne aaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Use de do, pas unhon ne us ke liye us ki umr se upar umr ke siwa (koi oont) na paya, to Aap ne farmaya: Use de do, pas us ne kaha: Tum ne mujhe pura ada kar diya, Allah tumhe pura ada kare, pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum me se behtareen woh hain jo ada karne me sab se behtar hain."
"580","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Simak ibn Harb se, Suwayd ibn Qays se, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Makhramah al-Abdi Hajar se kapra lakar bechne aaye, pas hamare paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tashreef laye, pas Aap ne hum se shalwar ka bhao kiya, aur hamare paas ek wazzan tha jo ujrat par tolta tha, pas Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne wazzan se farmaya: Tol aur jhuka kar de."
"581","Yusuf ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum me se kisi ka hawala kisi maal-dar par kar diya jaye to use us ki pairwi karni chahiye, aur maal-dar ka tal-matol karna zulm hai."
"582","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Safwan ibn Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ajlan se, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se (riwayat karte hain): Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke masjid me becha jaye ya us me kharida jaye."
"583","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Nufayli ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Yazid ibn Khusayfah ne khabar di, Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Thawban se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum dekho ke koi masjid me bech ya kharid raha hai to kaho: Allah tumhari tijarat me nafa na de! Aur jab tum dekho ke koi us me gumshuda cheez ka elan kar raha hai to kaho: Allah tum par use wapas na lautaye!"
"584","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyaynah ne humein khabar di. Aur Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se - aur Ali ne kaha: woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) tak pahunchate hain - Aap ne farmaya: Najsh na karo, aur koi shehri kisi dehati (ke maal) ko na beche, aur koi shakhs apne bhai ki be' par be' na kare, aur koi shakhs apne bhai ke paigham-e-nikah par paigham na bheje, aur koi aurat apni behen ki talaq ka sawal na kare."
"585","Muhammad ibn Abdillah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ala ibn Abd al-Rahman se, woh apne walid se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ek shakhs ke paas se guzre jo ghalla bech raha tha, pas Aap ki taraf wahi ki gayi: Apna hath us ke neeche se dakhil karo. Pas Aap ne apna hath dakhil kiya to use mukhalif paya, pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo humein dhoka de woh hum me se nahi."
"586","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo musarrat ya muhaffalah kharide to use ikhtiyar hai; agar chahe to use rok le, aur agar chahe to use lautade aur us ke sath khajoor ka ek sa' (de), samra (gehun) nahi."
"587","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo musarrat kharide to use teen din tak ikhtiyar hai; agar chahe to use rok le, aur agar chahe to use lautade aur us ke sath khajoor ka ek sa' (de), samra nahi. Wahb ne kaha: Yani gehun."
"588","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: Ke Habban ibn Munqidh ke sar me ma'muma zakhm laga tha, pas us ki zaban bhari ho gayi thi aur use be' me dhoka diya jata tha, pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ke liye muqarrar kar diya ke jo bhi woh kharide us me use teen (din) tak ikhtiyar hoga, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Becho aur kaho: Khilaba (dhoka) nahi, pas main ne use kehte suna: La khidhabah la khidhabah."
"589","Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahhab ibn Ata ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sa'id se, Qatadah se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se: ke Ansar me se ek shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane me bei' karta tha, aur us ki uqdah (aqal-o-fahm) me kamzori thi, to us ki qaum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aayi aur unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, falan par hajr (pabandi) laga dein, kyunke wo bei' karta hai aur us ki uqdah me kamzori hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use bulaya aur use bei' se mana kiya, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main bei' par sabr nahin kar sakta, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum bei' na chhorne wale ho to kaho: ha aur ha (lo aur do), aur khilabah (dhoka-o-fareb) na ho."
"590","Muhammad ibn Isma'il al-Sa'igh ne humen khabar di ke Rawh ibn Ubadah ne un se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Al-Akhdar ibn Ajlan al-Taymi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, ke unhon ne Banu Hanifah ke ek shaikh se suna jinhen Abu Bakr kaha jata tha, wo Anas ibn Malik Raziallahu anhu se hadees bayan kar rahe the, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Is hils aur qadah (kambal aur pyale) ko kaun kharidega? To ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Nabiyullah, main in donon ko ek dirham me lunga. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek dirham par zyada kaun dega? To ek shakhs ne kaha: Main in donon ko, Ya Nabiyullah, do me lunga. Unhon ne kaha: Ye donon tumhare hain."
"591","Muhammad ibn Abdillah ibn Abd al-Hakam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn Malik ne mujhe khabar di, Abdillah ibn Abi Ja'far se, Zayd ibn Aslam se, unhon ne kaha: Maine ek shakhs se suna jinhen Shahr kaha jata tha - wo tajir tha - jabke wo Abdillah ibn Umar se bei' al-muzayadah (boli lagakar bechne) ke bare me sawal kar raha tha, to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke tum me se koi kisi ke bei' par bei' kare hatta ke wo chhor de, siwae ghanimat aur miraas ke."
"592","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humen khabar di, Ayyub se, Ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne jalab (bahar se aane wale tijarati qafilon) ko (aage jakar) milne se mana farmaya, to jo kisi jalab ko mile aur us se kharide to bechne wale ko ikhtiyar hasil hoga jab wo bazaar me utre."
"593","Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Warraq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numayr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ubaydullah ibn Umar se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke saman ko (raste me) mila jaye hatta ke wo bazaaron me dakhil ho jayen."
"594","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Sa'id aur Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se unhon ne kaha: Koi shehri (hazir) kisi dehati (badi) ki taraf se bei' na kare."
"595","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi shehri (hazir) kisi dehati (badi) ki taraf se bei' na kare, logon ko chhor do taake un me se baaz baaz se faida uthayen."
"596","Abu Umayyah al-Tarsusi Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Ubaydullah al-Ansari ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Amr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Zayd ibn Abi Unaysah se, al-Hakam se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, Ali Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujhe hukm diya ke do bhai gulamon ko bechun, to maine un donon ko becha aur un donon ke darmiyan tafreeq kar di, phir maine is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Un donon ko pao aur unhen wapas lo, aur unhen magar ikatthe hi becho."
"597","Muhammad ibn Uthman ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numayr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-A'mash se, Muslim se, Masruq se, A'ishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Surah al-Baqarah ki aakhri ayaat nazil huin jin me riba ka zikr hai to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) bahar tashrif laye aur unhen logon par parha, phir sharab me tijarat ko haram qarar diya."
"598","Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, un donon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Amr se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Umar Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna - aur unhen ye baat pahunchi thi ke ek shakhs ne sharab bechi - to unhon ne kaha: Allah falan ko halak kare! Kya wo nahin janta ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Yahud ko halak kare, un par charbiyan haram ki gayin to unhon ne unhen pighlaya phir unhen becha. Mahmud ne izafa kiya: aur un ki qeematen khayin. Aur Mahmud ne kaha: Maine Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha."
"599","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Walid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Layth ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Yazid ibn Abi Habib se, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdillah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne sharab, buton, murdar aur khinzir ki bei' ko haram kiya hai, to baaz Musalmanon ne kaha: To murdar ki charbiyon ke bare me aap kya farmate hain, un se khalon aur kashtiyon ko tail lagaya jata hai, aur log un se chiragh jalate hain? To unhon ne farmaya: Haram hai, Allah Yahud ko halak kare, jab un par charbiyan haram ki gayin to unhon ne unhen pighlaya phir use becha, aur us ki qeemat khayi."
"600","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Sulaym - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il - yani Ibn Umayyah - ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sa'id ibn Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare Rabb ne farmaya: Teen (shakhs) hain jin ka main Qiyamat ke din muqabil hun, aur jis ka main muqabil hua use ghalib aaunga: ek shakhs jis ne mere (naam) par dekar phir gadari ki, aur ek shakhs jis ne aazad shakhs ko becha phir us ki qeemat khayi, aur ek shakhs jis ne mazdoor ko ujrat par rakha phir us se pura kaam liya aur use us ki ujrat na di."
